<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yabura</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yabura Dawuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yabura</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yab</para>
  <para style="mt">Yabura Dawuda</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi kitaabui findixi bɛɛti kitaabui nan na. Annabi Dawuda naxa yi bɛɛti wuyaxie sɛbɛ Ala saabui ra, a e malan kitaabui kui danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ. A naxa bɛɛti ndee sa kitaabui kui namiɲɔnmɛ gbɛtɛe naxee sɛbɛ alɔ Asafi (Yabura 50). Bɛɛtibae nu yi bɛɛtie bama Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui sali tɛmui. Dawuda to bɛɛti ndee sɛbɛ, a naxa yaamari fi bɛɛtibae ma na bɛɛti lanma a xa ba ki naxɛ (Yabura 3:3, 4:1). To danxaniyatɔɛe fan nɔma yi bɛɛtie bade e gbe ki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bafe na ra, yi bɛɛtie findixi misaali xungbe nan na danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye. Mixi nɔma rakɔrɔside yi bɛɛtie kui a Ala wama nɛ mixie xa e bɔɲɛ xa fe masen a bɛ. Xa kɔntɔfili nde na mixie furi kui, Ala tinma e xa na masen a bɛ, a findi Ala maxandi ra. Xa mixie na sofe fahaamui kui Ala xa gboe xa fe ra, e nɔma na fan masende Ala bɛ, a findi Ala matɔxɔɛ ra. Adamadi lanma a xa na fe mɔɔli birin masen e Marigi Ala bɛ. Ala wama na dɛ masarɛ mɔɔli xɔn ma a tan nun danxaniyatɔɛe tagi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa i mali yi xaranyi ra, a xa a niya i fan xa masenyi ti Ala bɛ naxan na i furi kui, alako a fan xa i yaabi, wo dɛ xa fan. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Yabura Dawuda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kira firinyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxan mu birama mixi ɲaaxi xa marasi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxan mu a ɲɛrɛma yunubitɔɛ fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxan mu a makɔrɛma mixie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">naxee yoma Ala fe ma.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">Alatala xa sɛriyɛ rafan naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">naxan a ɲɔxɔ sama Alatala xa sɛriyɛ xɔn ma kɔɛ nun yanyi.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Na adama maniyɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">wuri bili ra naxan tixi xure dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">A bogima a waxati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">A burɛxɛ mu lisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Na adama, fefe suxuma, a sɔɔnɛyama nɛ a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Kɔnɔ a mu na ki xɛ mixi ɲaaxie tan bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">E tan maniyɛ maale lagi ra foye naxan xaninma.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Mixi ɲaaxie bɔnɔma nɛ kiiti waxati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">e mu luma tinxin mixie ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">Lude mu na e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Alatala mɛɛnima tinxintɔɛe ma a xa kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxi tan xa kira findima gbaloe kira nan na.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Munfe ra sie bɔɲɛ texi fufafu?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Duniɲa mangɛe bara keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">xunmatie bara ti Alatala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">nun a xa mixi sugandixi kanke.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Na duniɲa mangɛe naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">«Won xa won ba e yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">Won xa mini e xa nɔɛ bun ma.»<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Marigi naxan na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">na na yelefe e ma.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />A xɔnɔma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">a e magaaxuma.<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />Ala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">«N tan nan mangɛ sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">n a dɔxɔ Siyoni geya fari, n ma yire sɛniyɛnxi.»<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Na mangɛ sugandixi xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">«N xa Alatala xa natɛ masen wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">Ala bara a masen n bɛ, ‹To, i bara findi n ma di ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">N tan bara findi i baba ra.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />I xa n maxandi n xa si birin fi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">e xa findi kɛ ra i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">Duniɲa birin xa findi i gbe ra.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />I e yamarima sawuri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">i e kanama alɔ wure fɛɲɛ bɔɔma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">a kebelae yensen yɛ.›»<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Yakɔsi wo tan mangɛe, wo xaxili sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">Kuntigie, wo bira nɔndi fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Wo Alatala batu gaaxui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">wo sɛɛwa a xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">wo gaaxu a ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Wo wo xun sin a xa mixi sugandixi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Xa na mu a ra, a wo halakima nɛ wo xa duniɲɛigiri kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Ala xa xɔnɛ dɛxɛma alɔ tɛ nu so fiili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">naxan kantari fenma Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda nun a xa di Abisalomi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti a nu a gima a xa di Abisalomi ma tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Alatala, n yaxuie bara wuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">N gerefae bara gbo.<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Mixi wuyaxi a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">Ala mu nɔma n nakiside. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Kɔnɔ i tan Alatala, i findixi n kantama nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">N ma binyɛ nun n ma xunnakeli fatanxi i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />N nan n xui rate Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">a n yaabima keli a xa geya sɛniyɛnxi fari. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />N nan n sama, n xa xi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">n man xunuma xaxili sa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">barima Alatala nan na n dɛmɛnma ra.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />N mu gaaxuma yi ɲama duniɲa ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">naxee mu wama n ma fe xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Alatala yandi, n nakisi, n Marigi Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">I n yaxuie dɛ ragarinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">i mixi ɲaaxi ɲinyie magirama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 3:9" />Marakisima nan na Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:9">I xa barakɛ sa i xa ɲama xa fe. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 3:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala keren nan nɔma n kantade</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />N Marigi Ala tinxinxi, n na n xui rate i ma, yandi a ratin n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">N ma tɔɔrɛ kui, i n bɔɲɛ sama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Hinnɛ n na, n ma dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Adamadie, wo n ma binyɛ masarama yaagi ra han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Wo birama fe fufafu nun wule fɔxɔ ra han mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Wo xa a kolon Alatala bara tinxintɔɛ sugandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">N nan n xui rate Alatala ma, a a ramɛma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Wo fan xa gaaxu, wo gbilen yunubi fe fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">Wo wo yɛtɛ rasi kɔɛ ra, wo xa wo raxara.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Wo xa sɛrɛxɛ ba tinxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">wo xa wo yɛtɛ taxu Alatala ra.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Mixi gbegbe a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">«Nde nɔma hɛɛri masende won bɛ?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">Alatala, i xa nɔrɛ masen muxu bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />I bara n bɔɲɛ rafe sɛɛwɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">dangife xɛ xaba tɛmui ra.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 4:9" />N na n sa, n xima bɔɲɛsa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:9">barima i tan Alatala, i keren nan nɔma n kantade.<verse eid="PSA 4:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s1">N soma Ala xɔnyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ xule xui ra<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Alatala, i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">i xa n ma tɔɔrɛ kolon.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />N Marigi Ala, i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">n na i tan nan maxandife.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Alatala, kuye nɛ ibama, i n xui ramɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">Gɛɛsɛgɛ, n nan n yɛtɛ ragbilenma i ma, n i mɛmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />I mu ɲɛlɛxinma fe kobi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">Fe ɲaaxi mu nɔma makɔrɛde i yire ra.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Yɛtɛ igboe mu tima i ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">I tinxintaree birin xɔnxi.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />I wule falɛ rahalakima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">I faxatie nun yanfantee xɔnma.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Kɔnɔ n tan soma i xa banxi kui i xa fonisireya saabui nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">N nan n igoroma i xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi kui gaaxui ra.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Alatala, n yaxuie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">n xun ti i xa tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">i xa kira yailan n ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Nɔndi mu na n yaxuie xa masenyi sese kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">E yuge mu fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">E xa wɔyɛnyi mixi rafilima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">barima e dɛ iɲɔxun.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Ala, e ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">E xa yanfɛ xa gbilen e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">E keri e xa fe kobi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">barima e bara i matandi.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Kɔnɔ mixi naxan birin a yɛtɛ taxuma i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">e birin xa sɛɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">e xa ɲɛlɛxinyi naxa ɲɔn abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">I xili rafanxi mixi naxee ma, e makanta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">e xa sɛɛwa i xa fe ra,<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 5:13" />barima i tan Alatala, i barakɛ sama mixi tinxinxi xa fe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:13">I xa hinnɛ naxan e rabilinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:13">a bara findi e xa kantari ra.<verse eid="PSA 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Furema wa xui</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra luuti solomasaxan xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Alatala, i naxa n ɲaxankata i xa xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">i naxa n tɔɔrɔ i xa bɔɲɛ te kui.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Alatala, hinnɛ n na, n bara halaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Alatala, n nayalan, n xɔrie na sɛrɛnfe nɛ yi ki.<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />N nii birin na sɛrɛnfe tɔɔrɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">Alatala, han tɛmui mundun fa?<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Alatala, fa n nii rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">N natanga i xa fonisireya xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Mixi mu nɔma ratude i ma gaburi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">Nde nɔma i tantude aligiyama?<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />N bara tɔɔrɔ han n sɛnbɛ birin bara ɲɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">Kɔɛ yo kɔɛ n wama, han n ma sade birin bunda n ya ye ra.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Sunnunyi bara n ya mafɔɔrɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">N mu sese tofe n yaxuie xa gboe xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Wo wo masiga n na, wo tan tinxintaree, barima n wa xui bara Alatala li.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Alatala bara n ma maxandi mɛ. Alatala bara n ma dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 6:11" />N yaxuie birin yaagima nɛ, han e e gi.<verse eid="PSA 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kiitisa fanyi nan na Ala ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti mɔɔli nde Alatala bɛ Kusi Bunyaminka xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />N Marigi Alatala, i tan nan na n kantama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">N natanga n yaxuie ma, n ba e yi ra,<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />e naxa n faxa alɔ yɛtɛ mixi faxama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">A na naxan suxu, na mu bama a yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />N Marigi Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">xa n bara kɔbiri ramuruta,<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />xa n bara fe ɲaaxi raba mixi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">muxu nun naxan dɔxɔxi bɔɲɛsa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">xa n bara n gerefa muɲa tɔɔɲɛgɛ kui,<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />n yaxuie xa n keri, e xa n masɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">e xa n maboron, e n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Alatala, n mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">i bɔɲɛ xa te n yaxuie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">N dɛmɛn, sɛriyɛ na i tan naxan yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />I xa nɔɛ xa lu ɲamae xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">e xa lu i xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Alatala, ɲamae makiiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">Alatala, n ma nɔndi makɛnɛn e bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">n ma tinxinyi nun n ma sɛriyɛ bɛrɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Danyi sa fe kobi rabae xa fe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">Sɛnbɛ fi mixi tinxinxie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">i tan, Ala naxan tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">naxan birin sondon ma fe kolon.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Ala, n kantama na i tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">naxan mixi tinxinxi rakisima.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Kiitisa fanyi nan na Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">naxan xɔnɔma tinxintaree ma tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Xa mixi ɲaaxie mu gbilen e yuge fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">Ala a xa santidɛgɛma raluganma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">a a xa xali maxiri.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Ala na faxatise yailanma mixi ɲaaxie nan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">a a xa tanbɛe dɛ findi tɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Mixi ɲaaxi luma fe ɲaaxi nan tun naba ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">A a ɲɔxɔ sa a xɔn ma han a findi a ra.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />A yili gema han a tilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">a fa bira a yɛtɛ xa yili gexi kui.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />A xa fe ɲaaxi nun a xa geregiri bara gbilen a ma.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 7:18" />N Alatala tantuma nɛ a xa tinxinyi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:18">N suuki bama nɛ Alatala xili ra, Ala xili xungbe kanyi.<verse eid="PSA 7:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Xili xungbe kanyi nan lanxi Ala ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba maxase luuti daaxi xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Muxu Marigi Alatala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">Xili xungbe kanyi nan lanxi i ma duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">i tan naxan ma nɔrɛ na koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Dimɛe nun diyɔrɛe i sɛnbɛ matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">i i yaxuie nun i gerefae dɛ balanma na matɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />N na koore mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">i naxan yailanxi i bɛlɛxɛ ra, kike a nun tunbuie,<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />n nan n yɛtɛ maxɔrinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">«Munse lanxi adama ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">i to i maɲɔxunma a xa fe ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">Munse lanxi adamadi ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">i to i ɲɛngi sama a xa fe xɔn ma?<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />I a daaxi ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">a gbe mu luxi a xa findi malekɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">I bara binyɛ nun fisamanteya fi a ma.<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />I bara yaamari so a yi ra i xa daalisee birin xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">I bara duniɲa findi a sanyi bun ma se ra:<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />yɛxɛɛe, ningee, wulai subee,<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />xɔni naxee ɲɛrɛma koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">yɛxɛ naxee birin ɲɛrɛma baa ma.<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 8:10" />Muxu Marigi Alatala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:10">Xili Xungbe Kanyi nan lanxi i ma duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari!»<verse eid="PSA 8:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala kolonxi a xa tinxinyi nan ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «Di xa faxɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Alatala, n i tantuma n sondonyi birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">n i xa wali fanyi ixaranma mixi birin bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />N sɛɛwama nɛ i xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">i tan Alatala Xili Xungbe Kanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">n i matɔxɔ bɛɛti ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />N yaxuie gbilenma nɛ e kelide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">Xa e bara ti i ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">e sanyie mu xanma bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">e nii mu xanma duniɲa,<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />barima i xa tinxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">i tan mangɛ bara kiiti so n yi.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />I bara si gbɛtɛe kalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">i fe kobi rabae rahalakima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">i e xili ralɔɛma nɛ han duniɲa ɲɔn.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />I bara e xa taae sɔntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">na taa sɔntɔxie luma nɛ na ki han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">e xa fe nɛɛmu mixie ra!<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Alatala xa mangɛya tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">danyi mu na a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">A xa kibanyi dɔxɔxi kiiti safe nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />A duniɲa makiitima tinxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">a dɔxɔxi sie xun ma tinxinyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Tɔɔrɔmixie kantama nan na Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">e ratangama na a tan nan na e xa kɔntɔfilie kui.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Alatala, i kolonma laxi i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">barima i singe mu nu i fenma rabolo.<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Alatala dɔxɔxi a xa geya sɛniyɛnxi xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">won xa a tantu bɛɛtie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">A bara fe naxee raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">won xa nee masen si birin bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Ala ratuxi wuli filixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">a fan na ɲɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">A tɔɔrɔmixie wa xui danxunxi.<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />Alatala, kinikini n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">I xa n mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">A mato n yaxuie na n tɔɔrɔfe ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">I tan naxan n nakisima saya kira ma,<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />alako n xa i tantu Siyoni ɲama tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">n xa sɛɛwa i xa kisi ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Sie nu gantanyi naxan texi e yaxuie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">e bara e yɛtɛ sanyie suxu a ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Alatala kolonxi a xa tinxinyi nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">Tinxintaree suxuma e yɛtɛ bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi nan saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Matandila naxee nɛɛmuma Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">e birin naɲɔnma aligiyama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Ala fama ratude tɔɔrɔmixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">a mu nɛɛmuma e ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Alatala, keli, i naxa a lu adama xa nɔ i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">A makiiti.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 9:21" />Alatala, i xa e magaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:21">E xa a kolon ibunadama gbansan nan e ra.<verse eid="PSA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s1">I naxa nɛɛmu setare ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Alatala, i i makuyaxi n na munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">I i nɔxunxi muxu ma muxu xa tɔɔrɛ kui munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Yɛtɛ igboe setaree tɔɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">a xa maɲɔxunyi kobi nɔma e ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />A a yɛtɛ igboma a xa wali ɲaaxi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">Alatala xɔnɔma a xa naafuli sɔtɔ ki ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Mixi ɲaaxi yɛtɛ igboe naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">«Ala mu na! A mu nɔma sese rabade n na!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">A xa maɲɔxunyi birin nan ya.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />A xa wali birin sɔɔnɛyama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">A mu gaaxuma Ala xa kiiti ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">A yoma a yaxuie ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />A maɲɔxunma a bɔɲɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">«Sese mu a niyama n bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">Tɔɔrɛ man mu n suxuma.»<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />A dɛ mixi dankama, a wule fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">A fe ɲaaxi tinxintare nan tun falama.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />A mixi mɛlɛnma taa fari ma, a xa mixi fanyi faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">A mu taganma fe ɲaaxi rabafe ra mixi fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />A setaree mɛlɛnma alɔ yɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">A e suxu a xa gantanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Na setaree luma a xa nɔɛ bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />A a falama a bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">«Ala mu sese toma. A ya raxixi.»<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Alatala keli! I naxa nɛɛmu setare ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Munfe ra mixi ɲaaxi yoma Ala ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">Munfe ra a a falama a yɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">«Ala mu n ɲaxankatama»?<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Kɔnɔ Ala, i tɔɔrɛ nun nimisɛ toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">I tɔɔrɔmixie malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Naxan mu nɔma a yɛtɛ kantade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">a a yɛtɛ taxuma i tan na na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">I tan nan na kiridi malima ra.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Mixi ɲaaxi sɛnbɛ kana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">E ɲaxankata e xa fe ɲaaxi xa fe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">E ralɔɛ yi duniɲa ma!<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Mangɛ nan Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Na mu kanama abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Kuye batui mu luma a xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Alatala, i i tuli tixi mixi magoroxie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">I limaniya fima e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">I e xa maxandi suxuma.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />I tɔɔrɔmixi nun kiridi kantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">alako adamadi naxan findixi bɛndɛ ra, a naxa e magaaxu.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Tinxinyi rafan Ala ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">N bara Alatala findi n yigi ra. Wo a falama n bɛ di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">«I i gi alɔ xɔni naxan tuganma sigafe ra geya ma,<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />barima mixi ɲaaxie bara e xa xalie tongo, e xa mixi bɔɲɛ fanyie faxa.»<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Xa sɛriyɛ mu na mixie tagi sɔnɔn, tinxintɔɛ fa munse rabama?<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Alatala na a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">A xa kibanyi na ariyanna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">A adamadie matoma a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">a xa a kolon naxan na e sondonyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Alatala tinxintɔɛ nun tinxintare matoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">Gbaloe rafan naxee ma, a nee raɲaaxu.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />A tinxintare luma tɔɔrɛ mɔɔli birin kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">Na luma nɛ alɔ tɛ wolenxi nun foye ɲaaxi.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Alatala tinxin. Tinxinyi rafan a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">Tinxintɔɛ fama a yatagi tode.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ɲaaxuɲa bara gbo yɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra luuti solomasaxan xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Alatala, muxu rakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">Lanlanteya mu na sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">nɔndi falɛe bara ɲɔn adamadie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Kankan a boore tɔɔɲɛgɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">a a yanfama wɔyɛn ɲɔxunmɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">Filankafui nan e ra.<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />Alatala xa e dɛ balan. E dɛ igbo.<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />E naxɛ, «Muxu sɛnbɛ gbo, muxu fata wɔyɛnde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">Nde nɔma muxu ra?»<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Alatala a masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">«N kelima tɔɔrɔmixi nun setare xa fe ra ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">N e ratangama mixie ma naxee e ɲaxankatama.»<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Alatala xa masenyi sɛniyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">A luma alɔ gbeti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">mixi naxan naxunuma sanya solofere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">alako a gbi xa ba.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Alatala, i tɔɔrɔmixi kantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">i muxu ratangama yi mixi mɔɔli ma tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 12:9" />Na mixi ɲaaxie e maɲɛrɛma yire birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:9">ɲaaxuɲa bara gbo yɛ adamadie ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 12:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Alatala, i nɛɛmuma n ma han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">I i nɔxunma n ma han mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />N bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔma han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">N sondonyi ɲaxankatama han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">N luma n yaxuie bun ma han mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />N Marigi Alatala, a mato, i xa n yaabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Ti n fanga ra, xa na mu n faxama nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />n yaxuie fa a fala, «N bara nɔ a ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">N yaxuie ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ n ma birɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Kɔnɔ n tan bara la i xa hinnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">n bɔɲɛ bara ɲɛlɛxin i xa kisi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">N bɛɛti bama Alatala bɛ a xa hinnɛ nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɲaaxuɲa</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Xaxilitare a falama a bɔɲɛ kui, «Ala mu na.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">A bɔɲɛ bara kana, a ɲaaxuɲa nan tun nabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Fe fanyi rabae mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Alatala a ya ragorofe adamadie ma keli ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">a xa a to xa lɔnnila nde na na naxan Ala fenma.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Kɔnɔ birin bara kira bɛɲin, e ɲaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">Hali fe fanyi rabama keren mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Maɲɔxunyi fanyi mu na fe kobi rabae bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">E na n ma ɲama xa geeni nan tun donfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">E mu Alatala xilima fefe ma.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Kɔnɔ e fama sɛrɛnde Ala ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">naxan na tinxintɔɛe ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Wo bara wa setaree waxɔnfe kanafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">kɔnɔ e Kanta Marigi Alatala na na.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Nde fama kisi ra Isirayila bɛ kelife Siyon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Alatala nan fama a xa ɲama raminide konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛwama nɛ, Isirayila ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ!<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Sali mixi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Alatala, nde nɔma lude i xa salide kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Nde nɔma sabatide i xa geya sɛniyɛnxi fari?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Mixi naxan ɲɛrɛma tinxinyi kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">naxan fe fanyi rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">naxan nɔndi falama a bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />A mu mixi mafalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">a mu fe ɲaaxi rabama a boore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">a man mu a rayaagima.<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />A a makuyama mixi ra naxan mu rafan Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">kɔnɔ a mixi binyama naxan gaaxuma Ala ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">Hali a tɔɔrɔma, a mu a xa marakali masarama.<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />A mu mixi donima kɔbiri ra alako a xa geeni sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">A mu kɔbiri rasuxuma a xa wule sa mixi xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Yi mixi mɔɔli mu dinkonma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xanuntenyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Dawuda xa suuki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">Ala, i xa n kanta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">N ma kantari na i yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Alatala, n Marigi nan i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">N ma fe fanyi birin na i tan nan yi.<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Yi bɔxi sɛniyɛntɔɛe rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">Mixi xungbe nan e ra.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Kuye batuie xa tɔɔrɛ gboma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Kɔnɔ n tan mu sɛrɛxɛ wuli daaxi bama kuyee bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">N dɛ mu e xili falama.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Sese mu na n yi ra, fo Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">N waxɔnfe birin, Ala nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">N ma duniɲɛigiri birin na Ala yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Ala naxan soxi n yi ra na fan n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">n bara ɲɛlɛxin a ra.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />N bara Alatala tantu, a marasi fima n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">Hali kɔɛ ra, n xaxili sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ n xaxili tixi Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">Xa a na n sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">n mu birama.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />N bɔɲɛ ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">n xaxili sɛɛwama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">n fate fan malabuma nɛ bɔɲɛsa kui,<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />barima i mu n nii rabɛɲinma aligiyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">I mu i xanuntenyi luma gaburi kui.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />I simaya kira masenma n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">Ɲɛlɛxinyi gbegbe na i yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">Fe fanyi mu ɲɔnma i yire fanyi ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s1">N ma kiiti bolon</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Dawuda xa Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">Alatala, n ma maxandi ramɛ tinxinyi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">I tuli mati n wa xui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">I tuli mati n ma maxandi xui ra wule mu na naxan kui.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />I xa n ma kiiti bolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">barima naxan tinxin, i na kolon.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />I na n bɔɲɛ mato kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">i na n ma duniɲɛigiri mato yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">i mu tantanyi yo toma n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">N mu tinma wɔyɛn ɲaaxi xa mini n dɛ i.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Mixi gbɛtɛe fe ɲaaxi rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">kɔnɔ n tan bara i xa yaamari suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">N mu birama suutee xa kirae fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />N birama i tan nan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">n mu na kira bɛɲinma.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Ala, n i xilima nɛ, barima i yaabi fima mixi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">Yandi, i xa i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />I xa hinnɛ muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">i tan naxan mixie rakisima e yaxuie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">naxee yigiya fenma i ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Mɛɛni n ma alɔ i ya firinyie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">N nɔxun alɔ tɔxɛyɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">naxan a nɔxunma a nga gabutenyie bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />Na na a toma, mixi ɲaaxi naxee n nabilinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">e mu nɔma n na.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Yɛtɛ igboe nan e ra, e dɛ igbo.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />E bara fa n fɔxɔ ra yakɔsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">e n nabilin, e alako e xa n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />E luxi alɔ yɛtɛ naxan sube fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">alɔ yɛtɛ kaamɛxie naxee gbataxi sube faxade.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Alatala, keli! N yaxuie gere, i xa nɔ e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">N natanga mixi ɲaaxie ma i xa santidɛgɛma ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />N natanga na duniɲa mixi mɔɔlie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">naxee e masundi sɔtɔma yi duniɲɛigiri gbansan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">E raluga na masundi ra, i naxan nagataxi e bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">E xa die fan xa wasa na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">a dɔnxɔɛ xa lu e xa mamadie bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Kɔnɔ n tan fama nɛ i yatagi tode tinxinyi saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">N na xunu, n wasama nɛ i yatagi ra.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ala sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Alatala xa konyi Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A yi bɛɛti nan ba Alatala bɛ a to a ratanga Sɔlu nun a yaxui birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Alatala, n sɛnbɛ nun n xanuntenyi nan i ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />N nakisima Alatala luma alɔ fanye, a findi n bɛ tɛtɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">N Marigi Ala luma alɔ gɛmɛ xungbe, n yigiyama dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">Sɛnbɛma nan a ra naxan n nakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">naxan n makantama.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />N xa a fala n xui itexi ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">Ala tantu! Ala bara n nakisi n yaxuie ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Saya nu bara n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">faxɛ nu bara gbaku n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Laaxira nu bara makɔrɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">gaburi nu bara a dɛ rabi n ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />N Alatala maxandima n ma tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">n nan n Marigi Ala xilima n xui itexi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">A n xui mɛma a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">a a tuli matima n wa xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">geya naxa ramaxa Ala xa xɔnɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />A xa xɔnɛ naxa lu alɔ tuuri naxan tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">alɔ tɛ naxan minima a dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">alɔ tɛ wole dɛxɛxi.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Ala naxa kuye ibɔɔ firin na, a goro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">a sanyie tixi nuxui ifɔɔrɔxi fari.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />A ti malekɛ xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">a ɲɛrɛ koore ma foye fari.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />A a nɔxun dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">tunɛ nun nuxui ifɔɔrɔxie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Seyamakɔnyi naxa mini a ya ra nuxuie kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">Balabalanyi nun tɛ naxa goro.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Alatala xui naxa lu alɔ galanyi kelife koore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi naxa a xui ramini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">balabalanyi nun tɛ fan naxa goro.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />A naxa a xa tanbɛe woli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">a a yaxuie rayensen seyamakɔnyi ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Baa nun bɔxi naxa rabi Alatala xa xɔnɛ ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Alatala naxa n suxu kelife koore ma, a n ba ye xɔɔra.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />A naxa n natanga n yaxui sɛnbɛmae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">n xɔnmixi naxee sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />E naxa n gere n ma tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">kɔnɔ Alatala naxa n natanga.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />A naxa n namini gbaloe kui a xa xanunteya saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Alatala bara n ma tinxinyi sare ragbilen n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">a bara n mali n ma kɛwali sɛniyɛnxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />N bara lu Alatala xa kira xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">n mu n Marigi Ala bɛɲin kobiɲa ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />N bara a xa sɛriyɛ birin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">n mu tondixi a xa yaamarie rabatude.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />N bara tinxin a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">n mu tin birade yunubi fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Alatala bara n ma tinxinyi sare ragbilen n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">a bara n mali n ma kɛwali sɛniyɛnxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />I dugutɛgɛɲa masenma dugutɛgɛɲa kanyi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">I tinxinyi masenma tinxintɔɛ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />I sɛniyɛnyi masenma sɛniyɛntɔɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">kɔnɔ i kɔɔta nde rabama mixi ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />I yɛtɛ magoroe rakisima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">kɔnɔ i yɛtɛ igboe tan magoroma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Alatala, i tan nan naiyalanyi ra n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">N Marigi Ala, n ba dimi kui.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Xa won birin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">n mu gaaxuma gali xungbe gerede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">N nɔma gere xɔrɔxɔɛ ra Ala xa mali saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Ala xa kira fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Alatala xa masenyi tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">A mixie kantama naxee yigiya fenma a ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Ala gbɛtɛ mu na, fo Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">Sɛnbɛma mu na, fo won Marigi Ala.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Ala nan sɛnbɛ fima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">a n naɲɛrɛ sɛniyɛnyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />A n malima n xa lu alɔ xeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">naxan fata ɲɛrɛde yire xɔrɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />A bara n nafala gere kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">a n malima xali fanyi rawalide.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />I bara n xun nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">i bara n tongo i xɔnyɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">i bara i ɲɛngi sa n xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">Na nan a niyaxi n dariyɛ sɔtɔxi,<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />n sɛnbɛ sɔtɔxi, alako n naxa bira.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />N birama n yaxuie fɔxɔ ra han n e suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">N mu gbilenma e fɔxɔ ra fo n nɔ e ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />N nee rabirama nɛ han e mu nɔ kelide sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">e fa lu n sanyi bun.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />I sɛnbɛ soma n yi ra n ma gere kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">I n yaxuie ragoroma n bun ma,<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />i a niya n xa nɔ e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">N xɔnmixie mu wɔyɛnma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />E mixie xilima e xa fa e mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">kɔnɔ mixi yo mu e rakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">E Alatala xilima, kɔnɔ a fan mu e yaabima.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />N e luxutama nɛ e fa lu alɔ xube, foye naxan xaninma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">N e boronma alɔ bɛndɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />I bara n natanga ɲama murutaxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">i fa n findi sie xunyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">N mu naxan kolon na bara lu n bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />E n xui rabatuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">xɔɲɛe wɔyɛn ɲɔxunmɛ falama n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />E mu suusama n ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">E minima e xa tɛtɛ makantaxi kui gaaxui ra.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Alatala sɛnbɛ mu ɲɔnma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">Tantui na n ma Kantama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">Tantui na n Marigi Ala Marakisima bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />Ala nan n gbeɲɔxɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">Ala nan sie rabirama n ma nɔɛ bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Ala nan n natangama n yaxuie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">I tan nan n itema n yaxuie xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">I tan nan n natangama suutee ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Alatala, n i tantuma sie tagi na birin nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">n bɛɛti bama nɛ i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 18:51" />A xunnakeli nun hinnɛ fima nɛ a xa mixi sugandixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:51">naxan findi mangɛ Dawuda nun a xa die ra abadan.<verse eid="PSA 18:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa nɔrɛ nun sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Koore Ala xa nɔrɛ masenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">Koore walaxɛ Ala xa wali masenma.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Yanyi lɔnni masenma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">Dimi xaxili masenma kɔɛ yo kɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Xui yati yati mu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">wɔyɛnyi fan mu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Tuli mu nɔma e xui mɛde.<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />E fɔxi toma duniɲa birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">E fɔxi yire makuye birin lima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">han soge sa sama kankira naxan kui.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Soge minima nɛ alɔ xɛmɛ naxan baxi ginɛ dɔxɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">a fa mini a xa konkoe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">alɔ mixi xungbe naxan ɲɛrɛma a yɛtɛ xa kira xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />A ɲɛrɛ fɔlɔma sogetede, a sa ɲɔn sogegorode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">Sese mu nɔma a wuyenyi bade.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Alatala xa sɛriyɛ, sɛriyɛ fanyi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">A sɛnbɛ fima mixi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">Alatala xa nɔndi, nɔndi yati na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">A lɔnnitare findima lɔnnila ra.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Alatala xa nɔɛ, nɔɛ tinxinxi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">A mixi bɔɲɛ raɲɛlɛxinma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Alatala xa masenyi, masenyi tinsexi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">A mixi xaxili ya rabima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Alatala xa yaragaaxui, fe sɛniyɛnxi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">A mu ɲɔnma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">Alatala xa yaamari, yaamari fanyi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">A birin tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Ala xa yaamari, a fan xɛɛma bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">a fan dangi xɛɛma fanyi birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">Ala xa yaamari, a ɲɔxun kumi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">a ɲɔxun dangi kumi fanyi birin na.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />I xa konyi xaxili sɔtɔma nɛ i xa sɛriyɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">A geeni gbegbe toma nɛ naa.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Nde nɔma a yɛtɛ kan yuge ɲaaxie birin kolonde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">I xa n ma yunubi nɔxunxi xafari n mu naxan kolon.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />I xa n ma yunubi makɛnɛnxi makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">A naxa n suxu sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Na tɛmui n fama findide mixi tinxinxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">naxan mu yunubi ɲaaxi rabama.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 19:15" />Wɔyɛnyi naxan kelima n dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">a nun wɔyɛnyi naxan kelima n bɔɲɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">Ala xa na tongo n bɛ ɲɛlɛxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">Alatala, n kantama nan i ra, i bara n xunsara.<verse eid="PSA 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa mangɛ mali</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Alatala xa i yaabi i xa tɔɔrɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">Yaxuba Marigi Ala xa i ratanga.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Ala xa i mali kelife a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">a xa i mali kelife Siyon geya fari.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Ala xa i xa sɛrɛxɛ birin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">a xa ɲɛlɛxin i xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie ra. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Ala xa i waxɔnfe fi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">a xa i xa wali sɔɔnɛya i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Won won xui itema ɲɛlɛxinyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">Won won ma tɔnxuma itema won Marigi Ala xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">Alatala xa i xa maxandi birin nasuxu.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />N a kolon a Alatala a xa mixi sugandixi rakisima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">A a yaabima nɛ a sɛnbɛ ra kelife ra a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Nde lama a xa sɔɔri ragise ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">nde lama a xa soee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">kɔnɔ won tan laxi won Marigi Alatala xili nan na.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Soee tan birama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">kɔnɔ won tan tixi tun.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 20:10" />Alatala xa mangɛ rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:10">a xa won ma maxandi suxu.<verse eid="PSA 20:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Mangɛ barakatɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Alatala, mangɛ bara sɛɛwa i sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">A xa ɲɛlɛxinyi gbo barima i bara a rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />I bara a waxɔnfe raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">i bara a xa dubɛ suxu. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />I fama barakɛ ra a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">i tɔnxuma mangɛ daaxi dɔxɔma a xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">a yailanxi xɛɛma ra.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />A bara i maxandi a xa simaya xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">I bara na maxandi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">a xa simaya xɔn naxa kuya han.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />I to a rakisi, a xa binyɛ naxa gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">I naxa xunnakeli nun binyɛ fi a ma.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />I naxa a findi barakatɔɛ xungbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">I naxa a rasɛɛwa i ya i.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Mangɛ lama Alatala nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">A mu birama Ala Xili Xungbe xa hinnɛ saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />I fama i yaxui birin suxude.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">I fama nɔde i xɔnmixie ra.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />I na fa, i e ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">alɔ tɛ belebele wuri ganma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">Alatala xɔnɔma e ma han tɛ e gan.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />I bɔnsɔɛe bama nɛ duniɲa ma, i adamadie raɲɔn.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />E bara wa fe ɲaaxi rabafe i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">E bara kata han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">kɔnɔ na mu findixi sɔɔnɛya yo ra e bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />barima i tan nan fama e ragide i xa xali ra.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 21:14" />Alatala, i xa i sɛnbɛ masen e bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:14">Muxu wama bɛɛti bafe i ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:14">muxu xa i matɔxɔ i sɛnbɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ala, i naxa i makuya n na</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «Subaxɛ xeli.»<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Ala, n Marigi Ala, i n naboloxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">I kisi makuya n na, i mu n wa xui ramɛ?<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />N Marigi Ala, kɔɛ nun yanyi, n i xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">kɔnɔ i mu n ma xili ratinma.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Kɔnɔ i tan Sɛniyɛntɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">i xa kibanyi rabilinxi Isirayila xa tantui ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Muxu benbae bara danxaniya i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">I bara e rakisi e xa danxaniya saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />E to i xili, i naxa e xɔrɛya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">E bara danxaniya i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">I mu e lu yaagi kui.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Kɔnɔ n tan bara findi mixi xuri ra alɔ dondoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">alɔ mixi mu na n tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">Adamadie n nayaagima, mixie n mayelema.<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Mixi naxan birin n toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">e yoma n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">E dɛ pɛtɛsima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">e e bɛlɛxɛsole tima n ma a ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />E naxɛ, «I ya ti Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">A i rakisima, a i ratangama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">barima i rafan a ma!»<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Ee Ala, i bara n namini n nga tɛɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">i bara n sa a kanke ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />N xaxili tixi i ra kafi n bari tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">I findixi n Marigi Ala ra kafi n baxi foye tode.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />I naxa i makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">barima kɔntɔfili bara wuya n xun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">Malila yo mu na n fɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Sɛnbɛmae bara n nabilin alɔ Basan tuurae.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />E dɛ rabixi alɔ yɛtɛ xaaɲɛe.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />N nii na bafe n fate, n xɔrie na bafe e radɔxɔdee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">N bɔɲɛ mu sama, limaniya bara ba n yi.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />N sɛnbɛ doloxi alɔ boora.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">N nɛnyi bara kankan n kɔn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">I na n mafindife bɛndɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Mixi ɲaaxi gali bara n nabilin alɔ baree.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">E bara n bɛlɛxɛ nun n sanyi tunba.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />N xɔri birin saxi kɛnɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">E ya banbanxi n na.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />E n ma dugie itaxunma e bore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">E n ma dugi fanyi matoma a lanma a xa lu naxan bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Alatala, i naxa i makuya n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">N ma sɛnbɛma nan i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">I xa i xulun n malide.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />I xa n nii rakisi santidɛgɛma ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">I xa n natanga na baree ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />I xa n nakisi na yɛtɛe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">I xa n nakisi na tuurae ferie ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />N i xili masenma nɛ n ma mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">n i matɔxɔma nɛ ɲama tagi.<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Wo tan naxan gaaxuma Alatala ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">wo xa a tantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Wo tan naxan kelixi wo benba Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">wo xa a matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Wo tan naxan kelima Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">wo xa gaaxu a ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Ala mu yoma misikiinɛ xa tɔɔrɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">A mu a yɛtɛ nɔxunma a ma xɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">a a xa maxandi suxuma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Ala, n i matɔxɔma ɲama xungbe ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">N fama n ma laayidi rakamalide mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">naxee gaaxuma Ala ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Mixi magoroxie fama e dɛgede, han e wasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">Naxee Alatala fenma, e fama a matɔxɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">Ala xa simaya fi wo ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Duniɲa birin fama ratude Alatala xa fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">e man birin e ya rafindima a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">Si birin fama e magorode a bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />barima birin na Alatala xa mangɛya nan bun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">A si birin yamarima.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Duniɲa sɛnbɛmae na gɛ e dɛgede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">e birin fama e magorode Ala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">Naxee birin findima bɛndɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">e fama e xun sinde Ala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">E mu nɔma e yɛtɛ nii ratangade.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Adamadie birin fama Ala batude.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">E e Marigi xa fe falama e bore bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 22:32" />Ala fama a xa tinxinyi masende</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:32">mixi birin bɛ naxee fama baride.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:32">Ala bara na ragiri.<verse eid="PSA 22:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala n mɛɛnima</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Alatala n mɛɛnima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">alɔ xuruse kantɛ a xa xuruse mɛɛnima ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">Se birin na n yi ra n hayi na naxan ma.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Alatala n xaninma fe fanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">alɔ xuruse kantɛ xurusee xaninma ɲooge fanyi ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">alɔ a e xun tima ye raxaraxi ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />A sɛnbɛ fima n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">A n tima kira tinxinxi xɔn, barima Alatala nan a ra.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Hali n ɲɛrɛ dimi kui, n mu gaaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">barima i na n sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">I n kantama, i n xun tima yire fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />I donse rafalama n bɛ n yaxuie ya xɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">I se xiri ɲɔxunmɛ sama n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">I n ma pɔɔti rafema minse ra a fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Hɛɛri nun hinnɛnteya birama n fɔxɔ ra n ma duniɲɛigiri kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">N luma nɛ Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">han n ma duniɲɛigiri ɲɔn.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Nde soma Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui?</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Alatala nan gbe na bɔxi nun a isee birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">duniɲa nun adamadi birin.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />A tan nan bɔxi dɔxɔxi baae nun xuree tagi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Nde nɔma tede Alatala xa geya fari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Nde nɔma sode a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Naxan xa wali fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">naxan bɔɲɛ sɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">naxan mu birama fe fufafu fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">naxan mu wule falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">na kanyi nan soma Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Alatala barakɛ sama a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">a rakisima Ala a sare ragbilenma a ma.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Yi mixi mɔɔli nan Ala fenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">Yaxuba xa mixie wama Ala kolonfe. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Tɛtɛ naadɛe xa rabi, hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ forie fan xa rabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">Nɔrɛ Kanyi na sofe.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Nde na yi Nɔrɛ Kanyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Alatala sɛnbɛma nan a ra, Alatala, naxan sɛnbɛ gbo gere kui.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Tɛtɛ naadɛe xa rabi, hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ forie fan xa rabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">Nɔrɛ Kanyi na sofe.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Nde na yi Nɔrɛ Kanyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Mangɛ Alatala nan Nɔrɛ Kanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ala, hinnɛ n na</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />N xaxili tixi i tan Alatala nan na.<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />N Marigi Ala, n bara n yɛtɛ taxu i ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">alako yaagi naxa n sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">alako n yaxuie naxa n mayele.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Naxan yo la i ra, na kanyi mu yaagi sɔtɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">kɔnɔ yanfante tan, yaagi sɔtɔma nɛ a fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Alatala, i xa kira masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">n xaran i xa kira ra.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />N naɲɛrɛ i xa nɔndi kira xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">i man xa n matinkan i xa kira ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">barima i tan Ala nan n nakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">N xaxili tixi i ra lɔxɔɛ birin.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Alatala, i maɲɔxun i xa marafanyi nun i xa fonisireya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">barima e na na kabi duniɲa fɔlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />I naxa i maɲɔxun n ma yunubi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">n naxan nabaxi n ma sɛgɛtalaya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">n i raxɔnɔxi tɛmui naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">Alatala, i maɲɔxun n ma i xa fonisireya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">barima i fan.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Alatala fan, a tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">Na nan a toxi a kira masenma yunubitɔɛe bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />A tan nan mixi magoroxi raɲɛrɛma tinxinyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">A e matinkanma a xa kira ra.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Alatala xa fonisireya nun tinxinyi na mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">naxee a xa saatɛ nun a xa yaamari mabanbanma.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Alatala, n ma yunubie xafari i xili xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">barima e mu xurun.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Nde gaaxuma Alatala ya ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Alatala kira masenma na kanyi bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">a lanma a xa ɲɛrɛ naxan ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />A aligiyama lima nɛ sɛɛwɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">A bɔnsɔɛ fan fama sabatide yi bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Alatala a xa gundo masenma mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">naxee gaaxu a ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">A a xa saatɛ masenma nɛ e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />N xaxili tixi Alatala ra lɔxɔɛ birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">barima a tan nan n natangama fe ɲaaxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Alatala, yandi, hinnɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">barima tɔɔrɔmixi nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">n malima fan mu na.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />N bɔɲɛ bara tɔɔrɔ. N namini na tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />I ya rasiga n ma sunnunyi nun n ma ɲaxankatɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">i xa diɲɛ n ma yunubi birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />I xa a mato n yaxuie wuyaxi ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">E n xɔnxi a ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />N nii makanta, i xa n natanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">alako yaagi naxa n sɔtɔ i xa niini bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Sɛriyɛ nun tinxinyi xa n kanta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">barima n xaxili tixi i tan na.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Ala, Isirayila xunsara a xa tɔɔrɛ birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Tinxintɔɛ ɲɛrɛ ki</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Alatala, i xa n ma kiiti sa, barima n ɲɛrɛ ki tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">N bara n yɛtɛ taxu i ra, n mu birama.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Alatala, n bɔɲɛ mato, n sondonyi makiiti,<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />barima n laxi i xa hinnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">n man n ɲɛrɛma i xa sɛriyɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />N mu luma wule falɛe ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">n mu ɲɛrɛma filankafuie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Fe kobi rabae mu rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">n tan nun mixi ɲaaxie mu luma yire keren.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Alatala, n nan n ɲɛrɛ ki rasɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">n man luma nɛ i xa sɛrɛxɛbade.<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />N tantui bɛɛti bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">n i xa kaabanakoe masenma.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Alatala, i xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi rafan n ma, i xa nɔrɛ na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />I naxa n nii ba alɔ yunubitɔɛe nun faxatie.<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />E fe ɲaaxie rabama, e kɔbiri rasuxuma tinxintareya ra.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Kɔnɔ n tan luma tinxinyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">N xun sara, i xa diɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />N ɲɛrɛ ki tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">N Alatala tantuma nɛ malanyie kui.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s1">I xaxili ti Alatala ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Alatala nan na n ma naiyalanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">N nakisima na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">N lan n xa gaaxu nde ya ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">N ma duniɲɛigiri na Alatala nan ma niini bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">N lan n xa gaaxu nde ya ra?<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />N gerefae nun n yaxui naxee fe ɲaaxi rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">e na fa n nahalakide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">e tan nan birama.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Hali sɔɔri gaali n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">n bɔɲɛ mu sɛrɛnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">Hali sɔɔri gaali fa n gerede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">n bɔɲɛ suusama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />N fe keren nan maxɔrin Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">n na na nan fenfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">N wama lufe Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nan kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">n ma duniɲɛigiri birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">alako n xaxili xa ti Alatala xa fe fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">n man xa nɔ a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi matode.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />A n natangama nɛ tɔɔrɛ ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">A n nɔxunma nɛ na niini bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">A n natema nɛ geya fari.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />A n xun nakelima nɛ n yaxuie ya xɔri naxee n nabilinxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">N sɛrɛxɛ bama nɛ a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui ɲɛlɛxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">N suuki ba, n bɛɛti ba Alatala bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Alatala, i tuli mati n xui ra, n na i maxandife.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">Hinnɛ n na, i man xa n yaabi.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />N bɔɲɛ wama i fenfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Alatala, n i fenma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />I naxa i kobe ti n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">I naxa mɛɛ i xa konyi ra xɔnɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">I tan nan na n malima ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">N ma marakisima Ala, i naxa n nabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">i naxa n nabɛɲin.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Xa n nga nun n ba n nabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">Alatala tan a makɔrɛma nɛ n na.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Alatala, i xa kira masen n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">N xun ti kira tinxinxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">alako n yaxuie naxa n suxu.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />I naxa n nabolo n yaxuie xa e sago raba n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">barima e bara findi tɔɔɲɛgɛlae ra n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">Fe kobi rabae nan lanxi e ma.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />N laxi a ra n Alatala xa fe fanyi toma nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />I xaxili ti Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">I sɛnbɛ xun xa masa, i xa limaniya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">I xaxili ti Alatala ra.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ala ɲɛngi dɔxɔxi a xa mixie xɔn ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Alatala, n bara i xili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">I xa sɛnbɛ luma n bɛ alɔ fanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">I tuli mati n na, xa na mu a ra n luma alɔ faxa mixi.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />N na n bɛlɛxɛ ite i bɛ i xa yire sɛniyɛnxi mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">i xa n ma maxandi xui ramɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />I naxa n lu alɔ mixi ɲaaxie nun tinxintaree.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">E e boore yanfama, e bɔɲɛ mu fan.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />E xa wali kobi sare ragbilen e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">E naxan nabaxi mixie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">i xa na raba e fan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">A lanma e xa na mɔɔli sɔtɔ,<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />barima e mu Alatala xa wali kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">A fama e rabirade, e mu keli sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Alatala tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">a bara n ma dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Alatala nan na n sɛnbɛ nun n kantama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">N xaxili tixi a tan nan na naxan n malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">N bɔɲɛ sɛɛwama nɛ, n fa bɛɛti ba a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Alatala nan a xa ɲama sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">a findi a xa mixi sugandixi kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />I xa ɲama rakisi, i xa barakɛ ragoro e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">Mɛɛni e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi mɛɛnima a xa gɔɔrɛ ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">I ɲɛngi dɔxɔ e xɔn ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala xui magaaxuxi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Malekɛe, wo Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">a xa binyɛ nun a sɛnbɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">wo xa a batu a nɔrɛ sɛniyɛnxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Alatala xui mɛma baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Ala Binyɛ Kanyi xui luma alɔ galanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">a a xui rasigama baa xungbee ma.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Alatala xui sɛnbɛ gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">a magaaxu.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Alatala xui wuri bili xungbee igirama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">alɔ naxee na Liban bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Alatala Liban wuri bilie ituganma alɔ ninge di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">a Siriyon geya ituganma alɔ sɛxɛ i ninge.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Alatala xui tɛ rayensenma alɔ seyamakɔnyi.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Alatala xui Kadesi gbengberenyi rasɛrɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Alatala xui a niyama xelie nun sie xa bari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">Ɲama birin e xui itema a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">a a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">«Matɔxɔɛ na Ala bɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Alatala nu na a xa kibanyi kui duniɲa banbaran yɛ tɛmui naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">A xa mangɛya mu ɲɔnma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Alatala nan sɛnbɛ fima a xa ɲama ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">a barakɛ nun bɔɲɛsa fima e ma.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa xɔnɛ mu buma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti a naxan sɛbɛ Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />N bara i matɔxɔ Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">barima i bara n nakeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">I mu tin n yaxuie xa xunnakeli sɔtɔ n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />N Marigi Alatala, n to i xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">i naxa n nayalan.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Alatala, i naxa n nii rakisi saya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">i mu tin n xa goro gaburi kui.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Danxaniyatɔɛe, wo xa bɛɛti ba Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">wo xa a xili matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />A xa xɔnɛ mu buma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">kɔnɔ a hinnɛma i ra i xa simaya birin kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">Nunmare, mixie wama, kɔnɔ gɛɛsɛgɛ e fa ɲɛlɛxin.<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />N bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔ tɛmui naxɛ n naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">«N mu nɔma birade.»<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Alatala, tɛmui dangixi i naxa n sɛnbɛ lu alɔ geya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">kɔnɔ yakɔsi i bara i nɔxun n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">N bɔɲɛ bara ifu.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />Alatala, n naxa i xili, n naxa i maxandi.<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />N naxa a fala i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">«N ma faxɛ findima geeni mundun na i bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Xa n bara goro gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">na nɔma findide matɔxɔɛ ra i bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Na nɔma i xa lanlanteya masende duniɲa bɛ?»<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Alatala, i tuli mati n na, i xa kinikini n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">Alatala, n mali.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />I bara n ma nimisɛ masara sɛɛwɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">I bara n ma sunnun donma masara ɲɛlɛxin donma ra.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 30:13" />N Marigi Alatala, na na a ra n mu dunduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:13">n tantui bɛɛti bama nɛ i bɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 30:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Lafe Ala ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi nun Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Alatala, n bara n xaxili ti i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">I naxa tin n xa lu yaagi kui, i xa kiiti fanyi sa n ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />I xa i tuli mati n na, n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">I xa lu n bɛ alɔ fanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">alɔ yire makantaxi alako n xa kisi.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />N ma sɛnbɛma nun n ma kantama nan i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">I xa n xun ti kira fanyi xɔn i xili fanyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />N yaxuie bara yɛlɛ itala n ya ra, kɔnɔ i fama n natangade na ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />N bara n xaxili ti i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">Alatala Nɔndi Marigi, i bara n nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Kuye batui mu rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">n tan, nan n taxuma Alatala nan na.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />N sɛɛwama nɛ i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">barima i bara n ma tɔɔrɛe to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">n sondonyi na ɲaxankata, i na kolon.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />I mu n soxi n yaxuie yi ra, i bara n xɔrɛya.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Alatala, hinnɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">barima n na tɔɔrɔfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">N fate birin bara ba n ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />N ma simaya na ɲɔnfe tɔɔrɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">N ma duniɲɛigiri xɔrɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">N sɛnbɛ bara ɲɔn n ma yunubi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">N fate bara kana <verse eid="PSA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />n yaxuie xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">N bara yaagi n dɔxɔbooree xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">N booree, xa na mu a ra naxee n toma taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">e e gima nɛ n ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />E birin bara nɛɛmu n ma alɔ n ɲan bara faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">N luxi alɔ se lɔɛxi.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />N bara n yaxuie xui mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">Gbaloe na n nabilinyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">E bara lan a ma e xa n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Kɔnɔ n tan bara n taxu i ra, i tan n Marigi Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />N na i sagoe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">N natanga n yaxuie ma naxee wama n ɲaxankatafe.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />I xa i xa konyi to, n nakisi i xa hinnɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Alatala, n na i xili, i naxa n lu yaagi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">Ala xa mixi ɲaaxie rayaagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">Ala xa e rasabari faxɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Ala xa e xui radundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">barima yi wule falɛe e yɛtɛ igboma, e yo tinxintɔɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />I xa hinnɛ gbo, i naxan nagataxi i yaragaaxuie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">naxee i xa kantari fenma.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />I bara e yigiya alako fe kobi rabae naxa e suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">I bara e ratanga wule falɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Alatala tantu, barima a bara hinnɛ n na n ma tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />N ma gaaxui kui, n nu bara a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">«I bara i nɔxun n ma,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">kɔnɔ i bara n ma maxandi suxu.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Danxaniyatɔɛe, wo xa Alatala xanu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">Alatala togondiyatɔɛe rakisima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">kɔnɔ a yɛtɛ igboe ɲaxankatama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 31:25" />Wo tan naxee wo xaxili tixi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:25">wo wo sɛnbɛ so, wo xa limaniya.<verse eid="PSA 31:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ala yunubi xafarife</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa lɔnni bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">naxan xa yunubi bara ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">naxan xa fe kobi bara xafari.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">Alatala bara diɲɛ naxan ma fe kobi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">a nun maifui mu na naxan xaxili ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Danmi n dunduxi, n mu nɔma minide tɔɔrɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">N nu tɔɔrɔma nɛ yanyi birin na.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Kɔɛ nun yanyi i xa tɔɔrɛ na n fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">N sɛnbɛ bara kana, a bara lu alɔ gbengberen yire.<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />N bara n ma yunubi masen i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">n mu n ma yunubi nɔxunxi fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">N bara a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">«Fo n xa n ma yunubi ya xaran Alatala bɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">I tan Alatala bara n ma yunubi ba n ma.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Mixi tinxinxi birin xa i maxandi a waxati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">Xa tɔɔrɛ gbo alɔ banbaranyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">a mu sese niyama a ra.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />N ma kantari lanxi i tan nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">I man sunnunyi bama n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">N i tantuma nɛ i xa maratangɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />N wo xaranma nɛ kira ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">wo lan wo xa bira naxan fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">N wo rasima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">n nan n ɲɛngi sama nɛ wo xa fe xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Wo naxa lu alɔ soe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">xa na mu a ra sofale xaxilitare,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">naxan mu raɲɛrɛma fo karafoe ra.<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Fe xɔnɛ gbegbe ragataxi mixi ɲaaxi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">kɔnɔ naxan a xaxili tixi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">Ala xa fonisireya na kanyi rabilinma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Mixi tinxinxie, wo sɛɛwa Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">wo man xa ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">Wo Ala tantu ɲɛlɛxinyi kui wo xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">wo tan mixi tinxinxie birin.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Ala na wɔyɛn, a fe ragirima nɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Tinxintɔɛe, wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ wo xui itexi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">Tinxintɔɛe lan e xa Ala matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Wo xa Alatala tantu kɔra ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">wo xa bɛɛti ba kɔra ra luuti fu daaxi.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Wo xa bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ ba a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">wo xa na raba maxasee ra wo xui itexi ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Alatala xa masenyi tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">a a xa wali birin nabama sɔɔbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Tinxinyi nun sɛriyɛ rafan a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">duniɲa birin nafexi Alatala xa hinnɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Alatala naxa koore daa a xa wɔyɛnyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">A to wɔyɛn keren fala, tunbuie naxa mini keren na.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />A naxa baa fan malan yire keren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">a xa ye ragata.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Bɔxi birin xa gaaxu Alatala ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">Duniɲa mixi birin xa a binya.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />A na wɔyɛn, a fe ragirima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">A na yaamari fi, a rabama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Alatala sie xa natɛe kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">A mu e xa wali sɔɔnɛyama.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Kɔnɔ Alatala xa fe ragirixie buma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">A waxɔnfe sɔɔnɛyama nɛ waxati birin.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na si bɛ naxan marigi findixi Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">Ɲɛlɛxinyi na bɔnsɔɛ bɛ Alatala naxan sugandixi.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Alatala a ya ragoroma duniɲa ma kelife ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">a mixi birin mato.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Kelife a xɔnyi, a duniɲa mixi birin matoma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Naxan adamadie bɔɲɛ daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">a a ɲɛngi sama e xa walie xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Mangɛ yo mu kisima a xa sɔɔrie saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">Sɔɔri fan mu kisima a yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Sɔɔri ɲɔxɔ a ma a xa soe nɔma a rakiside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">kɔnɔ na tan mu findima kisi ra a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Alatala nan mɛɛnima mixie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">naxee gaaxuma a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">naxee e xaxili tima a xa hinnɛ ra,<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />alako e nii naxa laaxira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">alako e xa balo kaamɛ waxati.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Won xaxili tixi Alatala nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">A tan nan won malima ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">a tan nan won kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Won bɔɲɛe sɛɛwaxi a tan nan ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">barima won bara la a xili sɛniyɛnxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Alatala, i xa hinnɛ muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">barima muxu xaxili tixi i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ala yaragaaxuie sare</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Dawuda to a yɛtɛ findi daxui ra Abimeleki ya i alako a xa a bɛɲin, a naxa yi bɛɛti sɛbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />N Alatala tantuma waxati birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">A xa matɔxɔɛ mu bama n dɛ i.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />N Alatala matɔxɔma n bɔɲɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">Tɔɔrɔmixie fama nɛ na mɛde, e fa sɛɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Won birin xa Alatala binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">won xa a xili matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />N to Alatala maxandi, a naxa n yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">a n ma gaaxui birin ba n yi.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Naxan na a ya ti Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">a sɛɛwama nɛ, a mu yaagima.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Xa tɔɔrɔmixi a xui ramini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">Alatala a mɛma nɛ, a fa a rakisi a xa tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Alatala xa malekɛ Ala yaragaaxuie rabilinma nɛ, a e kanta.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Wo a mato, Alatala fan de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama bɛ naxan xaxili tixi a ra.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Sɛniyɛntɔɛe, wo xa gaaxu Alatala ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">alako wo hayi birin xa fan.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Kaamɛ yɛtɛe suxuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">kɔnɔ Alatala fenmae hayi birin fanma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />N ma die, wo fa, wo xa fa wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">N xa Alatala yaragaaxui masen wo bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Nde wama simaya xɔnkuye xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">Nde wama lufe sɛɛwɛ kui tɛmui birin?<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Xa wo wama na xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">wɔyɛn ɲaaxie naxa mini wo dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">wo naxa wule yo fala.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Wo xa fe ɲaaxi lu na, wo xa fe fanyi raba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">Wo xa wo tunnabɛxi bɔɲɛsa fenfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Alatala tinxintɔɛe toma nɛ, a a tuli matima e wa xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Alatala a kobe soma fe kobi rabae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">alako e xili xa nɛɛmu duniɲa ra.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Tinxintɔɛe na e mawa Alatala bɛ, a a tuli matima nɛ e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">a e ba e xa tɔɔrɛe kui.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Alatala luma mixi fɛ ma naxan sunnunxi a bɔɲɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">a mixi rakisima naxan xaxili bara ifu.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Tɔɔrɛ gbegbe tinxintɔɛ lima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">kɔnɔ Alatala a rakisima na birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Alatala mɛɛnima nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">sese mu a toma.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Fe ɲaaxi nan mixi ɲaaxi faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">Tinxintɔɛ yaxuie fama ɲaxankatade.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 34:23" />Alatala a xa konyie xun sarama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:23">Naxan a xaxili tima Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:23">na mu kiiti ɲaaxi sɔtɔma.<verse eid="PSA 34:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Mixi ɲaaxi sare</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Alatala, i xa mixi tɔɔrɔ naxan wama n tɔɔrɔfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">Naxan wama n gerefe, na kanyi gere.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Keli, i xa n mali i xa geresose ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />I xa xali nun tanbɛ xa ite n yaxuie xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">A fala n bɛ, a i tan nan n ma marakisima ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Ala xa n yaxuie rayaagi, a xa e xaxili ifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">naxee wama n faxafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Naxee fe ɲaaxie maxirima n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Ala xa e rayaagi, a xa e keri.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />E xa lu alɔ maale lagi foye naxan nayensenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">Alatala xa malekɛ xa e keri.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Ala xa e lu dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">Ala xa e xa kira masalaxun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">Alatala xa malekɛ xa e keri.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />E bara yɛlɛ itala n ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">e bara yili ge n birama dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">alako e xa n faxa hali n mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi e ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Ala xa na sare ragbilen e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">Ala xa e suxu yɛlɛ kui, Ala xa e rabira yili kui.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Na tɛmui n bɔɲɛ ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">N sɛɛwama nɛ a xa marakisi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />N bɔɲɛ a falama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">«Alatala, i maniyɛ mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Nde nɔma tɔɔrɔmixi ratangade sɛnbɛma ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Nde nɔma setare ratangade muɲɛtie ma?»<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Wule falɛe n tɔɔɲɛgɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">e nu fe fala e mu naxan kolon.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />E n ma fe fanyi sare ragbilenma fe ɲaaxie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">Mixi birin bara n nabolo.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Kɔnɔ e tan nu furaxi tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">n nu luma sunnun na e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">n nu fa sunyi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">n Ala maxandi e bɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />N sunnunxi e bɛ alɔ n sunnunma n boore bɛ ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">xa na mu a ra n ngaxakerenyi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">N kinikinixi e bɛ alɔ n kinikinima n nga bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Kɔnɔ tɔɔrɛ to n tan li, e birin naxa ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">E naxa kafu e bore ma n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">e xa n ɲaxankata, e xa n nahalaki.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Mixi ɲaaxie nun konbitie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">e birin n ma fe xɔnxi, e nu yele.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />N Marigi, munfe ra i tinma na mɔɔli xa raba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">N nii ratanga e xa gere ma, n nii rakisi yi yɛtɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Na kui n i tantuma nɛ malanyi xungbe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">N i matɔxɔma ɲama gbegbe tagi.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Ala xa n natanga n yaxuie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">naxee wama yofe n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">Ala xa n natanga n xɔnmixie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">naxee wama n konbife hali n mu fe yo rabaxi e ra.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />E mu wɔyɛn fanyi yo falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">e mixi fanyi madaxuma tun.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />E n tɔɔɲɛgɛma a falafe ra, «Muxu bara a to.»<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Alatala, i bara na birin to. I naxa dundu de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">N Marigi, i naxa i makuya n na.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />N Marigi Ala, keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">i xa n xun magere so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">i xa n xun mafala.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />N Marigi Alatala, i xa n ma kiiti sa i xa tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">alako n yaxuie naxa n mayele.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />I naxa tin e xa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">«Muxu bara nɔ a ra, muxu bara a masɔtɔ.»<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Ala xa n xɔnmixie rayaagi, n yaxuie xaxili xa ifu.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Ala xa n xanuntenyie rasɛɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">naxee a falama e xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">«Tantui na Alatala bɛ naxan a xa konyi luma bɔɲɛsa kui.»<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />N i xa tinxinyi masenma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">n i tantuma nɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Adama xa ɲaaxuɲa nun Ala xa hinnɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Alatala xa konyi Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />N bara mixi ɲaaxi xa matandi maɲɔxun n bɔɲɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">A mu a kolon a lanma a xa gaaxu Ala ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />A a yɛtɛ igboma han a mu nɔma a xa yunubi tode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">a mu nɔma a ɲɛrɛ ki xɔnde.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />A xa wɔyɛnyi ɲaaxu, a nu mixi madaxu tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">A mu fe fanyi yo kolon.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />A fe ɲaaxi maɲɔxunma kɔɛ ra, a fa kira ɲaaxi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">barima a mu tondima fe kobi lude.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Alatala, i xa hinnɛ koore lima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">i xa dugutɛgɛɲa sigama han nuxui.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />I xa tinxinyi gbo alɔ geyae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">I xa kiiti tilin alɔ baa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">I tan nan adamadie nun subee rakisima.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Ala, i xa hinnɛ fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">Adamadie birin yigiya sɔtɔma nɛ i yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">alɔ tɔxɔɛ yɔrɛe luma e nga gabutenyie bun ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />E wasama i xa nɛmɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">i xa fe fanyi luma e bɛ alɔ ye xinbeli.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />I tan nan gbansan nɔma adama rabalode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">I xa naiyalanyi bara muxu xa kira iyalan.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />I xa hinnɛ i kolonmae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">i xa i xa tinxinyi masen tinxintɔɛe bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />I xa n natanga yɛtɛ igboee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">i naxa a lu mixi ɲaaxie xa n keri.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 36:13" />Tinxintaree birama nɛ, e mu nɔma kelide sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Mixi ɲaaxi nun mixi fanyi masundi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />I naxa kɔntɔfili mixi ɲaaxie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">I naxa tin lude alɔ e tan.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />E lisima nɛ mafuren alɔ ɲooge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">e faxama nɛ alɔ sansie.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />I xa i taxu Alatala ra, i xa fe fanyi rabatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">I xa lu yi bɔxi ma, nɔndi xa findi i xa baloe ra.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Alatala xa findi i waxɔnfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">Na kui a i waxɔnfe ragirima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />I i xaxili ti Alatala ra, a birin taxu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">A tan nan fe ragirima.<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Ala fama i xa nɔndi makɛnɛnde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">alɔ a soge raminima ki naxɛ gɛɛsɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">A i xa xunnakeli makɛnɛnma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">alɔ soge naxan yanbama yanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />I bɔɲɛ raxara Alatala ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">i xa mamɛ ti, Ala na na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">I naxa mixi ɲaaxi tɔɔnɛ hali a xa fe birin sɔɔnɛyaxi.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />I naxa xɔnɔ, i i bɔɲɛ magoro.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">Na tɔɔnɛ lu na, a mu fee sɔɔnɛyama i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Ala fama mixi ɲaaxie raɲɔnde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">kɔnɔ naxee e xaxili tixi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">e fama yi bɔxi sɔtɔde kɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />A mu buma mixi ɲaaxie xa lɔɛ duniɲa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">E mu toma dɛdɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Naxee bɔɲɛe magoroxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">e tan nan fama yi bɔxi sɔtɔde kɛ ra, e lu bɔɲɛsa kui.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Tinxintare tinxintɔɛ yanfama, a xɔnɔ a ma.<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />Kɔnɔ Marigi yelema na mixi ɲaaxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">barima a a kolon a fama naxan sɔtɔde.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Mixi ɲaaxie santidɛgɛma bama a tɛɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">e xali fan suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">alako e xa misikiinɛ nun setare tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">e xa tinxintɔɛ kɔn naxaba.<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Kɔnɔ e tan nan fama faxade e yɛtɛ xa santidɛgɛma saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">E xa xalie fama girade.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Se xuri naxan na tinxintɔɛ yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">a fisa mixi ɲaaxie xa bannaya bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />barima Alatala e sɛnbɛ kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">a fa tinxintɔɛ mali.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Alatala ɲɛngi saxi mixi fanyi xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">E kɛ buma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />E mu yaagima tɔɔrɛ tɛmui, e lugama nɛ kaamɛ waxati.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxie faxama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">Alatala yaxuie luma nɛ alɔ fiili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">naxan sɛxɛ lisima, a fa gan.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Mixi ɲaaxi doni tongoma nɛ, kɔnɔ e mu a fima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">Mixi fanyi tan mixie kima a xa fonisireya kui.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Alatala xa barakatɔɛe yi bɔxi sɔtɔma nɛ kɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">kɔnɔ Ala naxan dankama, na kanyi fama halakide.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Naxan ɲɛrɛ ki rafan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">a na kanyi malima nɛ a xa duniɲɛigiri kui.<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />Hali a sa dinkon, a mu birama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">barima a bɛlɛxɛ na Alatala yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui, han n xɛmɔxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">n mu tinxintɔɛ keren toxi Ala naxan nabɛɲinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">naxan xa die taami makulama.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Tinxintɔɛ ki tima, a mixie donima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">A xa die barakɛ sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />I xa fe kobi lu na, i xa fe fanyi raba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">Na kui i simaya xɔnkuye sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Sɛriyɛ rafan Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">A mu a xa hinnɛntee rabɛɲinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">A e kantama nɛ abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">Kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxie bɔnsɔɛ fama nɛ halakide.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Tinxintɔɛe fama nɛ yi bɔxi sɔtɔde kɛ ra, e lu be abadan.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Tinxintɔɛ lɔnni nan masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">sɛriyɛ nan minima a dɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />A Marigi Ala xa sɛriyɛ na a bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">a mu birama kira xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Mixi ɲaaxi tinxintɔɛ yanfama, a xa a faxa.<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />Kɔnɔ Alatala mu tinxintɔɛ luma a yaxuie sagoe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">A mu tinma e xa a tɔɔɲɛgɛ kiiti tɛmui.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />I xaxili ti Alatala ra, a xa kira suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">alako a xa i rakeli, i xa yi bɔxi sɔtɔ kɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">Na tɛmui i mixi ɲaaxie toma nɛ e halakixi.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Tɛmui dangixi n bara sɛnbɛma ɲaaxi nde to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">A xungbo alɔ wuri tofanyi.<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Kɔnɔ n to dangi a yire a firin nde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">n naxa a li a xa fe xuben.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">N naxa a fen, kɔnɔ n mu a to.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />I xa mixi fanyi nan mato, tinxintɔɛ nan igbɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">Na mixi mɔɔli findima barakatɔɛ nan na.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Kɔnɔ yunubitɔɛe tan fama nɛ sɔntɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">e bɔnsɔɛ birin fa halaki.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Alatala tinxintɔɛe rakisima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">a findi e xa makantama ra e xa tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />A e malima nɛ, a e ratanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">A e ratanga mixi ɲaaxie ma, a e rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">barima e yigiyaxi a tan nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s1">N sɛnbɛ bara kana</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Dawuda xa maxandi bɛɛti<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Alatala, i naxa n ɲaxankata i xa xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">i naxa n halaki i xa bɔɲɛte kui.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />I bara n maxɔnɔ i xa tanbɛ ra, i bara n nabira.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Yalanyi yo mu na n bɛ i xa xɔnɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">N ma yunubi bara a niya n fate birin xa tɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />N ma yunubie bara gbo n xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">Na kote bara binya, n mu a nɔma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />N ma fie bara gbo, e xiri bara ɲaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">Na birin fatanxi n ma xaxilitareɲa nan na.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />N bɔɲɛ bara kana, xunnakeli mu na n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">N luma fɛɛɲɛn na sunnunyi nan kui.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />N fate birin wolenxi, yalanyi yo mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />N sɛnbɛ bara kana, n fate birin bara ba n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">N bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔxi tun.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />N Marigi, i n waxɔnfe kolon, n ma tɔɔrɛ mu nɔxunxi i ma.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />N bɔɲɛ mu saxi, n sɛnbɛ bara ɲɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">N ya mu naiyalanyi toma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />N xanuntenyie nun n booree bara keli n xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">n ma fure xa fe ra, n ngaxakerenyie bara e makuya n na.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Naxee wama n faxafe, e bara yɛlɛ itala n ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">Naxee wama n tɔɔrɔfe, e bara n konbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">e n tɔɔɲɛgɛma tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Kɔnɔ n mu n tuli mati na wɔyɛnyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">n mu n dɛ rabi n xa e yaabi.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />N luma alɔ tuli xɔri, n luma alɔ boboe.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Alatala, n xaxili tixi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">N Marigi Ala, i tan nan gbansan nɔma n yaabide.<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />N naxɛ, «I naxa tin n yaxuie xa yo n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">e xa ɲɛlɛxin n ma tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra.»<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />A gbe mu luxi n xa bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">n na tɔɔrɔfe tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />N bara n ti n ma yunubi rabaxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">n yangoe naxee rabaxi, na fe bara n kɔntɔfili.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />N yaxuie tan kɛndɛ, e sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">N xɔnmixie bara wuya, hali nɔndi mu na e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Naxee fe fanyi masarama fe ɲaaxi ra, e n tɔɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">barima n tan birama fe fanyi nan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Alatala, i naxa n nabɛɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">N Marigi Ala, i naxa i makuya n na.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 38:23" />N Marigi, i xa fa mafuren n malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:23">N Marigi, n ma marakisima nan i ra.<verse eid="PSA 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Adama luma alɔ foye</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ Yedutun bɛ<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />N bara a fala, «N fe birin nabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">alako n naxa yunubi raba n dɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">N fe birin nabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">alako n naxa na wɔyɛnyi mɔɔli fala mixi ɲaaxie ya xɔri.»<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />N ma tɔɔrɛ xungbe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">n naxa dundu, n mu sese fala, n naxa n sabari tun.<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />N bɔɲɛ nu satunma, n ma tɔɔrɛ naxa lu alɔ tɛ dɛxɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">Na bara a niya n xa yi wɔyɛnyi fala,<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />«Alatala, a masen n bɛ n faxama tɛmui mundun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">n ma simaya sigama han minden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">alako n xa n sɛnbɛ xa xurunyi kolon.<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />I bara n ma simaya radunke, a xɔn mu kuya sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">Adama luma alɔ foye naxan dangima.» <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Adama luxi nɛ alɔ niini, naxan minima, a fa dangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">A naafuli malanma, kɔnɔ naxan fama a sɔtɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">a mu na kolon.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />N Marigi, n fa n xaxili tima nde ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">I tan nan gbansan nɔma n malide.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />N nakisi n ma yunubie birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">I naxa n nayaagi daxuie ya xɔri.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />N bara dundu, n mu sese falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">barima i tan nan na walife.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />I xa fure ba n ma, beenu i xa n naɲɔn tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />I mixi ɲaxankatama a xa yunubi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Naxan nafan adama ma, i na bama a yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Na fe luma nɛ alɔ kuli naxan bogise fanyi xun nakanama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">beenu mixi xa a matongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Adamadi misaalixi foye nan na naxan dangima. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Alatala, n ma dubɛ suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">i xa i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">I xa n wa xui mɛ, barima i xa xɔɲɛ nan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">N luma alɔ n benbae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">n mu buma yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 39:14" />I xa i xa ɲaxankatɛ ragbilen n fɔxɔ ra sinden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:14">xa na mu a ra n faxama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s1">N mu nɔma dundude</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi nun Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />N bara n xaxili ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">a bara a tuli mati n na.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />A bara n ba boora xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">a n sanyi radiki fanye ra.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />A bara bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ sa n bɔɲɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">naxan findixi tantui ra Ala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">Mixi gbegbe na na mɛ, e gaaxuma nɛ Ala ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">e e yɛtɛ taxu Alatala ra.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama nan bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naxan a xaxili tixi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naxan mu a kobe ratoxi yɛtɛ igboe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naxan mu a kobe ratoxi kuye batufe ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />N Marigi Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">i bara i xa fe fanyi gbegbe masen muxu bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">I maniyɛ mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">N wama na birin tagi rabafe mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">kɔnɔ i xa fe fanyi wuya han a bara dangi a i.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />I mu wama sɛrɛxɛ tun xa xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">I bara n tuli rabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">I mu wama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">i mu wama sɛrɛxɛ yunubi xafari daaxi fan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />N bara fa kitaabui makuntanxi ra naxan sɛbɛxi n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />N Marigi Ala, n bara tin i waxɔnfe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">I xa sɛriyɛ na n sondonyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />N tinxinyi masenma ɲama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">I xa a kolon Alatala, n mu fama dundude i xa fe ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />N mu nɔma dundude i xa nɔndi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">N i xa fe fanyi nun i xa marakisi fe falama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">N mu i xa fonisireya nun i xa nɔndi nɔxunma ɲama ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />I tan Alatala, i mu fama tondide n bɛ i xa marafanyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">I xa fonisireya nun i xa nɔndi n kantama nɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Tɔɔrɛ gbegbe bara n nabilin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">N ma yunubi fan bara gbo han a bara dangi a i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">E bara wuya dangife n xunsɛxɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">Limaniya bara ba n yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Alatala, yandi, n natanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">Alatala, yandi, n mali.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Naxee wama n nii bafe, naxee wama n ma fe ɲaaxi xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">e birin xa makuya n na yaagi kui.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Naxee n mayelema, yaagi xa e dɛ ixara.<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Naxee birin biraxi i fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">e xa sɛɛwa, e xa ɲɛlɛxin i xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Naxee wama i xa kisi xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">e xa a fala tɛmui birin, «Tantui na Alatala bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 40:18" />Setare nun misikiinɛ nan na n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">kɔnɔ Marigi bara ratu n ma fe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">I tan nan na n ma malima ra a nun n nakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">N Marigi Alatala, i naxa dugundi!<verse eid="PSA 40:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Furema Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na mixi bɛ naxan hinnɛma tɔɔrɔmixi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Alatala a ratangama nɛ a xa tɔɔrɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Alatala a ratangama nɛ, a a rabalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">A ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ duniɲa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">I mu a luma a yaxuie sagoe.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Alatala a malima nɛ a fura tɛmui, a a rayalan.<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />N a falama a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">«Alatala, hinnɛ n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">N nayalan barima n bara yunubi raba i ra.»<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />N yaxuie wɔyɛn ɲaaxie falama, e naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">«A faxama mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">A xili lɔɛma mun lɔxɔɛ?»<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Naxan fama n xɛɛbude a filankafui wɔyɛnyi falama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">Fe ɲaaxi gbo a bɔɲɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">A na keli n xun ma, a na mɔɔli falama.<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />N xɔnmixie n ma fe makɔlikɔlima e boore bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">e xa n tɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />E naxɛ, «Fure ɲaaxi bara a suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">a bara tagan, a mu kelima sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Hali n dɛfanboore, n nu laxi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">muxu nun naxan nu muxu dɛgema yire keren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">na bara a kobe ti n na.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Alatala, hinnɛ n na, i xa n nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">alako n xa n yaxuie sare ragbilen e ma.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />N a kolon n nafan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">barima i mu n luma n yaxuie sagoe.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />I n malima nɛ barima n tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">I bara tin n xa lu i sɛɛti ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 41:14" />Tantui na Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:14">Amina. Amina.<verse eid="PSA 41:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="s1">N sondonyi nimisaxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Kora xa die xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Ala, n wama lufe i yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">N i fenma alɔ xeli ye fenma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />N hayi na Ala ɲiɲɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">N a yire lima mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Yakɔsi n wama kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">n wama yanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">Mixi n maxɔrinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">«I Marigi Ala na minden?»<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />N na ratu yi fe ma, n bɔɲɛ sɛɛwama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Singe n nu ɲama raɲɛrɛma Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">e nu bɛɛti bafe ɲɛlɛxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">e tantui rasiga Ala ma.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Munfe ra n sondonyi nimisaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">Munfe ra n bɔɲɛ sunnunxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">N xa n xaxili ti Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">n man xa a tantu a xa kisi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />N Marigi Ala, n bɔɲɛ nimisaxi n yɛtɛ kan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">Na na a ra n nan n natuma i ma Yurudɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">n na dɛnnaxɛ yi tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">Xerimon nun Misari geyae na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />N ma tɔɔrɛ xun nan tun masafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">A luma alɔ susui ye naxan sinma xure ye xun.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Alatala hinnɛma n na yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">n fan bɛɛti bama a bɛ kɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">N Ala maxandima naxan n nabaloma.<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />N bara a fala Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">naxan sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ fanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">«I nɛɛmuxi n ma munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">I n luxi tɔɔrɛ kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">n yaxuie xa nɔɛ bun ma munfe ra?»<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />N yaxuie n tɔɔrɔma konbi ra lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">E n maxɔrinma, «I Marigi Ala na minden?»<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 42:12" />N sondonyi nimisaxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">N bɔɲɛ sunnunxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">N xa n xaxili ti Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">n man xa a tantu a xa kisi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">N Marigi nan na n ma marakisima ra.<verse eid="PSA 42:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s1">N bɔɲɛ sunnunxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Ala, i xa n ma kiiti sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">I xa n xun mafala ɲama danxaniyatare xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">I xa n natanga yanfantee nun wule falɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Ala n ma kantama na i tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">i n nabɛɲinxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">I n luxi tɔɔrɛ kui n yaxuie xa nɔɛ bun ma munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />I xa n ma kira iyalan i xa nɔndi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">i xa n xun ti sigafe ra i yire i xa geya sɛniyɛnxi fari.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />N nan n makɔrɛma nɛ Ala xa sɛrɛxɛbade ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">Ala naxan findixi n ma sɛɛwɛ nun n ma ɲɛlɛxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">N bɛɛti bama n Marigi Ala bɛ kɔra ra.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />N sondonyi nimisaxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">N bɔɲɛ sunnunxi munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">N xa n xaxili ti Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">n man xa a tantu a xa kisi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Muxu mu i xa saatɛ kanama</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Kora xa die xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Ala, muxu bara a mɛ muxu benbae saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">i wali naxan nabaxi tɛmui dangixi.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />I bara sie keri be</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">alako muxu benbae xa sabati yi bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />E mu be sɔtɔ e xa santidɛgɛma xa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">e mu kisi sɔtɔ e yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ xa ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">I tan nan sɛnbɛ bara e rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">i tan nan xa hinnɛ bara findi na saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Ala, i tan nan findi n ma mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">Yandi, i xa Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Muxu fama muxu yaxuie ragbilende i tan nan saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">muxu fama e ragorode i xili ra.<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />N mu n xaxili tixi n ma xali xa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">n ma santidɛgɛma mu nɔma n nakiside.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Kɔnɔ i tan nan muxu ratangama muxu yaxuie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">i tan nan muxu xɔnmixie rayaagima.<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Muxu Ala nan matɔxɔma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">muxu i tan nan xili tantuma abadan. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi i bara muxu rabɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">i bara muxu rayaagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">I mu muxu xa sɔɔrie malima sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />I bara muxu ragi muxu yaxuie ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">naxee muxu xɔnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">nee bara muxu harige birin ba muxu yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />I bara muxu rabɛɲin alako e xa muxu faxa alɔ xurusee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">i bara muxu rayensen ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />I bara i xa ɲama mati sare xuri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">naxan mu findima geeni ra i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />I bara muxu rayaagi muxu dɔxɔbooree xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">Muxu rabilinyie yoma muxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />I bara a niya si gbɛtɛe xa muxu mayele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">e nu e xunyie lintan muxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />N xaxili ifuxi tɛmui birin, n bara yaagi.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Naxee n xɔnxi, nee n mayelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">e n konbima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">E wama e gbeɲɔxɔfe.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Hali yi birin to rabaxi muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">muxu mu nɛɛmuxi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">muxu mu i xa saatɛ kanaxi.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Muxu bɔɲɛ mu gbilenxi i fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">muxu mu muxu makuyaxi i xa kira ra,<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />naxan a niyama i xa muxu lu wulabaree tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">muxu xa faxa.<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />Xa muxu sa nɛɛmu muxu Marigi Ala xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">xa na mu a ra muxu naxa ala gbɛtɛe batu,<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Ala mu a kolonma xɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">A mu mixi gundo birin kolon?<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Kɔnɔ mixie na muxu faxafe alɔ xurusee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">E na rabama tɛmui birin i tan nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />N Marigi, xunu. I xife munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">Keli, i naxa mɛɛ muxu ra tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />I yatagi nɔxunma muxu ma munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">I nɛɛmuxi muxu xa tɔɔrɛ nun yaagi ma munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Muxu bira nɛ bɔxi, muxu mu nɔma kelide sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 44:27" />Yandi, keli, fa muxu mali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:27">I xa muxu xun sara i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 44:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Mangɛ xa futi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Kora xa die xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «Fuge tofanyie.» Xanunteya sigi.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Wɔyɛn fanyie bara n bɔɲɛ rafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">N xa yi wali raba mangɛ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">N nɛnyi luma nɛ alɔ sɛbɛliti fanyi xa kale.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />I tofan adamadi birin bɛ, i fata wɔyɛn ɲɔxunmɛ tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">barima Ala barakɛ sama i xa fe ma tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />I xa i xa santidɛgɛma xiri i tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">alako i xa xunnakeli nun i xa binyɛ xa kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">Sɔɔri sɛnbɛma nan i ra.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />I sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">Te i xa sɔɔri ragise fari, nɔndi, magoroe, nun tinxinyi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">I xa fe xungbe raba.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />I xa tanbɛe magaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">E fama i yaxuie sondonyi sɔxɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">sie birama nɛ i sanyie bun.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />«Ala, i xa mangɛ kibanyi buma nɛ abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">Tinxinyi nan findixi i xa mangɛya tɔnxuma ra.»<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Tinxinyi nan nafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">Ɲaaxuiɲa mu rafan i ma fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">Na nan a toxi i Marigi Ala bara i sugandi sɛɛwɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">Fisamante nan i ra dangife i booree ra.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Labundɛ nun se xiri ɲɔxunmɛ na i xa dugi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">Xulunyi tima i xa mangɛ banxi tofanyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">Kɔrae ɲɛlɛxinyi xui raminima i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Mangɛe xa di ginɛe luma i sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">i xa ginɛ fan na i fɛ ma, a maxirixi xɛɛma tofanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />N ma di ginɛ, i tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">I naxa kankan i bɔnsɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">xa na mu a ra i xa denbaya nun i baba ma.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />I xa i igoro mangɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">naxan findixi i marigi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">I tofan, i rafan a ma ki fanyi.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Tirekae fama bunsee ra i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">naafuli kanyie fan fanma i binyade.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Mangɛ xa di ginɛ soma banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">a maxirixi dugi tofanyi ra, xɛɛma na a ma.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />A xa konyi ginɛe a matima mangɛ xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">Mangɛ fan maxirixi dugi tofanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Ginɛ so tɛmui, mixi birin ɲɛlɛxinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">e xulunyi tima.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />I xa die fama lude alɔ i benbae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">e findi mangɛe ra bɔxi birin xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 45:18" />N i tan findima xili kanyi nan na abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:18">Bɔnsɔɛ birin i matɔxɔma nɛ waxati yo waxati.<verse eid="PSA 45:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Won mu gaaxuma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ ginɛdimɛdi xui daaxi<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Ala, won kantama nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">Won ma kantari na a yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">A won malima won ma tɔɔrɛ birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />Xa bɔxi sa sɛrɛn, won mu gaaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">Xa geya sa bira baa ma, won mu gaaxuma.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Xa mɔrɔnyie sa xaaɲɛ, won mu gaaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">Xa geya sa a imaxa, a sɛrɛn, won mu gaaxuma.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Xure nan a ra, naxan salonyie Ala xa taa rasɛɛwama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi xa hɔrɔmɔlingira sɛniyɛnxi na mɛnni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Ala na na taa kui, na taa mu a ramaxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">a a malima subaxɛ nɛfɛ a li.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Sie sɔnxɔɛ ratema, mangɛyae birama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Ala nɛfɛ a xui ramini, duniɲa birin xununma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Mangɛ Alatala na won sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">Won ma kantari na Yaxuba Marigi Ala yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Wo fa Alatala xa wali mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">a gbaloe naxan luxi bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />A tan nan gere ɲɔnma duniɲa birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">A xali girama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">A tanbɛ kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">a makantase gan.<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />«Wo wo raxara, wo xa a kolon Ala na n tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">N si birin yamarima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">N ma yaamari na duniɲa birin ma.»<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 46:12" />Alatala na won sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:12">Won ma kantari na Yaxuba Marigi Ala yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 46:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Ala fisamante mangɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Wo tan sie birin, wo wo bɛlɛxɛ bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">wo sɔnxɔ, wo xui ite ɲɛlɛxinyi kui Ala bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Alatala Xili Xungbe Kanyi magaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">Mangɛ xungbe nan a ra duniɲa birin xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />A bara sie ragoro won bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">e xa lu won sagoe.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />A bara bɔxi fi won ma kɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">naxan findixi Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ xa xunnakeli ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">A won xanu. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Ala tema ɲɛlɛxin xui nan tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">a fama sarae fe xui ma.<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Wo bɛɛti ba Ala bɛ, wo bɛɛti ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">Wo bɛɛti ba won ma mangɛ bɛ, wo bɛɛti ba!<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Ala nan mangɛ ra duniɲa birin xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">wo xa lɔnni bɛɛti ba.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Ala magoroxi mangɛ kibanyi sɛniyɛnxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">si birin mangɛ nan a ra.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 47:10" />Sie xa mangɛe kafuma Iburahima Marigi Ala xa ɲama ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">barima Ala nan a ragiri mangɛe xa duniɲa kanta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">Ala na se birin xun.<verse eid="PSA 47:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa taa Siyon</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti. Sigi sɛniyɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Alatala gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">A lanma won xa a matɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">a xa taa kui a xa geya sɛniyɛnxi fari.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Ala xa geya Siyon tofan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">a rafan duniɲa birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">Na findi Mangɛ Xungbe xa taa nan na.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Ala a ɲɛngi sama a xa taa makantaxi xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">a bara a yɛtɛ findi a kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Mangɛe to e malan Siyon gere xili ma,<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />e naxa kaaba na tofe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">E naxa gaaxu, e fa e gi.<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />E to gaaxu na ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">e naxa sɛrɛn alɔ ginɛ naxan na di barife,<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />xa na mara alɔ Tarasisi xa kunkuie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">foye xungbe naxee imaxama.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Won Marigi Ala kaabanako naxan nabaxi a xa taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">won bara na mɛ, won bara na to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">Mangɛ Alatala na taa rakisima tɛmui birin. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Ala, muxu na so i xa Hɔrɔmɔlingira kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">muxu ratuma i xa hinnɛ nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">i xili tantuma nɛ duniɲa yire birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">I xa mangɛya tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Ɲama ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ Siyon geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">Yudakae sɛɛwama nɛ i xa kiiti xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Wo xa Siyon mabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">wo xa a xa sɔɔri tidee kɔnti.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Wo xa a tɛtɛ nun a yire makantaxie mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">alako wo xa na fala wo xa die bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 48:15" />Ala nan na won Marigi Ala ra abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:15">A won naɲɛrɛma han aligiyama.<verse eid="PSA 48:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Aligiyama sigafe mu kanama</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />Wo wo tuli mati yi ra, wo tan ɲama birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">Duniɲa ɲama birin, wo wo tuli mati n na.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Tide xuri kanyi, tide xungbe kanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">setare a nun se kanyi, wo birin xa wo tuli mati.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />N fama wɔyɛnyi hagigɛ nan falade wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">n bɔɲɛ xaxili fanyi naxan maɲɔxunxi.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />N nan n tuli tixi taali ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">n fama na tagi rabade wo bɛ kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />Munfera n fa gaaxuma gbaloe lɔxɔɛ ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">n yaxuie xa fe kobi n nabilinma tɛmui naxɛ?<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />E laxi e xa bannaya nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">e nu fa e yɛtɛ matɔxɔ e harige xa gboe ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />E mu nɔma e bore xunsarade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">E mu nɔma e xunsare fide Ala ma.<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />E nii xunsare xɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">e mu nɔma a fide abadan.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />E tan mu faxama? E mu sigama aligiyama?<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Won a toma, lɔnnilae faxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">lɔnnitaree fan faxama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">E fa e harige lu mixi gbɛtɛe yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Mixi naxee e xilie saxi bɔxie xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">e maɲɔxunxi nɛ e xa banxie luma nɛ naa abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">e xɔnyi mu kanama keli lanfanmae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">a sa dɔxɔ lanfanma gbɛtɛe ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Hali mixi xungbe, a mu buma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">A faxama nɛ alɔ subee.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Mixi naxee laxi e yɛtɛ ra, e xa kira nan ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">E xui rafan naxee ma, nee birama nɛ e fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />E aligiyama lima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Faxɛ e ralɔɛma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Mixi tinxinxie e maboronma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">E xa tofanyi kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Aligiyama findima nɛ e xɔnyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Kɔnɔ Ala n nii xunsarama nɛ aligiyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">a n xanin. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Mixi na findi banna ra, a harige na gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">i naxa gaaxu,<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />barima a mu sese xaninma aligiyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">A harige mu birama a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />A ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ a harige ra a xa duniɲɛigiri kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">barima birin a matɔxɔma na xa fe ra,<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />kɔnɔ a fa siga aligiyama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">a a benbae li na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">naxee mu duniɲa toma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 49:21" />Xa banna mixi xaxili mu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:21">a luxi nɛ alɔ sube naxee faxama.<verse eid="PSA 49:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Sɛrɛxɛ naxan nafan Ala ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Asafi xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Alatala na wɔyɛnfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">A na duniɲa birin xilife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">keli sogetede han sogegorode.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Kelife Siyon, Ala xa tofanyi yanbama.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Won Marigi Ala na fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">a mu dunduxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">Tɛ belebele na a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">foye xungbe fan na a rabilinyi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />A xui tema koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">a xui goroma bɔxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">kiiti sade a xa mixie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />«N batulae, naxee laayidi tongoxi n bɛ sɛrɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">wo xa wo malan.»<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Ala xa masenyi tinxinxi kelima koore nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">barima kiitisa nan na Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />«N ma mixie, wo wo tuli mati, n xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Isirayila, n bara wo kalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Ala nan n na, wo Marigi Ala.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />N mu xɔnɔxi wo xa sɛrɛxɛe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">Wo sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie bama n bɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />N mu tuura tongoma wo xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">N mu si kontonyi fan tongoma wo xa kulɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />N gbe nan na sube birin na wula i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">N gbe nan na sube birin na geyae ma.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />N gbe nan na xɔni birin na koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">N gbe nan na sube birin na fiili ma.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Xa kaamɛ n suxuma nu, n ma falama wo tan bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">N gbe nan na duniɲa birin na.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />N tan tuura sube donma? Ade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">N tan si kontonyi wuli minma? Ade.<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />A lanma wo xa tantui rasiga n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">na xa findi wo xa sɛrɛxɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">Wo xa wo xa laayidie rakamali n bɛ, n tan Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Wo xa n xili wo xa tɔɔrɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">N fama wo ratangade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">wo fan fama n matɔxɔde.»<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Ala xa masenyi nan ya, mixi ɲaaxie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">«wo na n ma yaamari nun n ma saatɛ durusife munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />N ma sɛriyɛ mu rafan wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">Wo mu n ma wɔyɛnyi danxunma.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Wo nun muɲɛtie na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">Wo nun yɛnɛ rabae na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Fe ɲaaxi nan tun minima wo dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">wo wule nan tun falama.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Wo nun naxan nga keren a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">wo na tɔɔɲɛgɛma.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Wo naxan nabaxi, na nan ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Han yakɔsi n bara n sabari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Wo ɲɔxɔ a ma a n na wo sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">kɔnɔ n fama xaaɲɛde wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">n fama a birin ya bade wo bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />Wo xa yi fe mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">wo tan naxee nɛɛmuxi Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">xa na mara n wo xa fe kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">Mixi yo mu wo ratangama.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Naxan tantui sɛrɛxɛ bama n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">na mixi bara n matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">Mixi naxan a ɲɛrɛ ki matoma a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">n fama n tan Ala xa marakisi masende a bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda xa yunubi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Annabi Natan wɔyɛnfe Dawuda bɛ a yunubi raba Batiseba ra tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Ala, hinnɛ n na alɔ i darixi a ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">Diɲɛ n ma fe ɲaaxi ma i xa bɔɲɛ fanyi saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />I xa n nasɛniyɛn n ma fe kobi birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">I xa n ma yunubi xafari.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />N bara n ma yunubi kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">N mu nɔma nɛɛmude na ma.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />N na fe ɲaaxi rabaxi i keren nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">N naxan nabaxi a mu rafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">I na n makiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">nɔndi luma nɛ i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />N barixi yunubi fe nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">kabi nga furi ba nɛɛnɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Kɔnɔ nɔndi na lu mixi bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">na nan nafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">Na lɔnni masen n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />N sɛniyɛn hisopi burɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">alako n xa fiixɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">N sɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">alako n xa fiixɛ fɔɛn alɔ xiɲɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi nun sɛɛwɛ fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">alako n bɔɲɛ xa sa.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />I kobe ti n ma yunubi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">i xa n ma fe kobi birin ba n ma.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />N Marigi Ala, n bɔɲɛ mafindi bɔɲɛ sɛniyɛnxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">xaxili fanyi fi n ma.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />I naxa n makuya i ya tode ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">I naxa i Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ba n yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Kisi sɛɛwɛ nun limaniya fi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">naxan n malima.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />N i xa kira masenma nɛ i matandilae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">alako e man xa bira i fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />N nakisima Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">n bara mixi faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">Yandi, n xunsara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">alako n xa i xa fe fanyi masen.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />N Marigi, na niya n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">n xa i tantu.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Sɛrɛxɛ mu rafan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">xa na mu a ra n na bama nɛ i bɛ nu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">I mu wama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Sɛrɛxɛ fanyi findixi yɛtɛ magoroe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">Ala wama yi sɛrɛxɛ mɔɔli nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 51:20" />I xa hinnɛ Siyoni ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:20">i xa Darisalamu tɛtɛ rakeli.<verse eid="PSA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 51:21" />Na tɛmui i ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ sɛrɛxɛ tinxinxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">nun sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">Na tɛmui tuurae nan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra i xa sɛrɛxɛbade.<verse eid="PSA 51:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Dɛ ɲaaxi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Dawuda xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Masenyi nan ya Dowege Edonka xa fe ra, naxan a fala Sɔlu bɛ a Dawuda na Aximeleki xɔnyi.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />I i yɛtɛ igboma fe kobi rabafe ra munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">Ala xa hinnɛ buma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />I dɛ luma alɔ finɛ naxan fe ɲaaxi rabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">Yanfante nan i ra.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Fe ɲaaxi rafan i ma dangife fe fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">Wule rafan i ma dangife nɔndi ra. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />I wɔyɛn xui xaaɲɛ, i dɛ mu fan.<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />Na kui Ala fama i rahalakide tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">A i suxuma nɛ, a i keri i xa banxi kui, a i keri duniɲa ma. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Tinxintɔɛ naxee findima seedee ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">e fama yelede na kanyi ma yi ki nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />«Wo na mixi mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">naxan mu nu a xaxili tixi Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">A naxa la a xa naafuli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">a a yɛtɛ kanta a xa yanfanteya ra.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 52:10" />Kɔnɔ, n tan naxan laxi Ala xa hinnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:10">n ma fe birin na sɔɔnɛyafe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:10">alɔ Oliwi wuri tofanyi naxan na Ala xɔnyi.»<verse eid="PSA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 52:11" />N i tantuma nɛ abadan i xa wali xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">N xaxili tixi i xili fanyi nan na i xa danxaniyatɔɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">barima i fan.<verse eid="PSA 52:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s1">Xaxilitare xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Dawuda xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba xule xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Xaxilitare a falama a bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">«Ala mu na.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">E fe haramuxie rabama, e mu tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">Mixi yo mu na naxan fe fanyi rabama.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Ala a ya ragoroma adamadie ma kelife ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">a xa e mato xa xaxilima nde na na naxan Ala fenma.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Kɔnɔ birin bara makuya Ala ra, e nu fe ɲaaxi raba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Hali mixi keren mu na naxan fe fanyi rabama.<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Tinxintaree xaxili mu na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">E nu n ma ɲama tɔɔrɔ tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">E mu Ala xilima feo.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />E fama sɛrɛnde gaaxui ra na nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">barima Ala fama na mixi mɔɔlie rayensende, naxee wama wo tɔɔrɔfe.<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 53:7" />Nde kelima Siyon a xa Isirayila rakisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Ala na a xa ɲama ramini konyiya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛwama nɛ, Isirayila ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 53:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s1">N Marigi tima n bun ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Dawuda xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra xui ra. <verse eid="PSA 54:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Sifikae to a fala Sɔlu bɛ a Dawuda a nɔxunxi e xɔnyi, Dawuda naxa yi bɛɛti ba.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Ala, n nakisi i xili ra, n ma kiiti sa i sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Ala, n ma dubɛ suxu, i tuli mati n ma wɔyɛnyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Xɔɲɛ ndee bara keli n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">mixi kobi naxee wama n faxafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">E mu Ala kolon fefe ma. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Ala n malima, n Marigi tima n bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />A n yaxuie xa kobiɲa sare ragbilenma e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">I xa e halaki i xa dugutɛgɛɲa kui.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 54:8" />N bara a ɲanige n xa sɛrɛxɛ ba i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:8">Alatala, n i xili tantuma nɛ barima i fan,<verse eid="PSA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 54:9" />i man n nakisima n ma tɔɔrɛ kui, n fa nɔ n yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 54:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Yanfantee</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Dawuda xa lɔnni bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Ala, n ma dubɛ suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">i naxa i nɔxun n ma maxandi ma.<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />I tuli mati n na, i xa n yaabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Xanmɛri nun gaaxui bara gɛ n suxude<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />n yaxuie xa wɔyɛnyi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">a nun mixi ɲaaxie xa wali kobi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">E wama n tɔɔrɔfe, e n tɔɔɲɛgɛma xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />N bɔɲɛ bara sɛrɛn, n sondonyi bara gaaxu faxɛ ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Gaaxui nun sɛrɛnyi bara n suxu a ɲaaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">Na bara n natagan.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Xa gabutenyi nan nu na n bɛ nu alɔ ganbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">n nu bara siga yigiya fende nu,<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />n nu n gima nɛ, n siga yire makuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">n sigama wula i nɛ nu. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />N xa n gi mafuren, alɔ foye xungbe.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />N Marigi, fe kobi rabae rayensen yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">I naxa e lu e xa lan fe kobi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">barima kobiɲa nun gere bara gbo taa kui.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Kɔɛ nun yanyi ra fe kobi rabae taa rabilinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">e xa fe ɲaaxi nun tinxintareya raba taa kui.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />E bara fe birin kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">Gbɛsɛnxɔnnɛya nun maifui bara gbo taa kui.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Xa yaxui nan tun n konbima nu, n diɲɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">Xa n xɔnmixi nan tun kelima n xili ma nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">n nan n nɔxunma nɛ a ma nu.<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Kɔnɔ i tan n lanfanma nan i ra, n xanuntenyi, n dɛfanboore.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Won dɛ fan, won birin sigama Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />E xa e tɛrɛnna faxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">e xa goro gaburi kui e ɲiɲɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">barima e e ɲɛrɛma fe ɲaaxie nan tun kui.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Kɔnɔ n bara Ala xili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">Alatala n nakisima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />N gbelegbelema kɔɛ a nun yanyi ra. A bara n xui mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />N yaxuie to wuya, a bara n natanga na gere ma.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Ala naxan na a xa kibanyi kui kabi a fɔlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">a a tuli matima n na, a fa n yaxuie rabira, <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">barima e tondixi tuubide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">E mu gaaxu Ala ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Yi mixie bara e bore gere, e saatɛ kana.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />E dɛ iɲɔxun alɔ xiɲɛ, kɔnɔ gere na e bɔɲɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">E xa wɔyɛnyi salaxun alɔ ture,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">kɔnɔ e mixi tɔɔrɔma alɔ santidɛgɛma naxan baxi a tɛɛ i.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />I xa i xaxili ti Alatala ra, a i malima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">A mu tinma tinxintɔɛ xa bira.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 55:24" />Ala, yi geresoe nun yi yanfantee xanin aligiyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">I naxa e xa simaya kɔnti rakamali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">Ala, n bara n taxu i ra.<verse eid="PSA 55:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s1">N mu gaaxuma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi nun Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Dawuda xa suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili, «Ganbɛ na wuri makuye fari.» A a ba Filisitakae a suxu tɛmui naxɛ Gati.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Ala, hinnɛ n na barima mixie na n gerefe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">E gere tima n bɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />N yaxuie fɛɛɲɛnma gere ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">Ala Xungbe, n gerefae bara wuya.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />N na gaaxu tɛmui naxɛ, n nan n xaxili tima i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />N Ala xa masenyi matɔxɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">N mu gaaxuma sɔnɔn, barima n bara la Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">Ibunadama gbansan nɔma munse rabade n na?<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Tɛmui birin n yaxuie wama n tɔɔrɔfe e xa wɔyɛnyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">N ma fefe mu rafanxi e ma.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />E lanxi n ma ɲaxankatɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">e bira n fɔxɔ ra yire birin alako e xa n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />I naxa tin e xa ratanga e xa fe ɲaaxie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Ala, i xa xɔnɛ xa e rabira.<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />I n ma duniɲɛigiri kolon, i n yaye toxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">N ma tɔɔrɛ birin sɛbɛxi i yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />N na i xili tɛmui naxɛ, n yaxuie gbilenma nɛ n fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">N a kolon n nun Ala na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />N Ala xa wɔyɛnyi matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">n Alatala xa masenyi matɔxɔma.<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />N mu gaaxuma sɔnɔn, barima n bara la Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">Ibunadama gbansan nɔma munse rabade n na?<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Ala, n xa n ma laayidi rakamali i bɛ, n ma tantui sɛrɛxɛe ra,<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 56:14" />barima i bara n natanga faxɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">I mu tin n xa bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">alako n xa ɲɛrɛ i xa kira xɔn ma yi bɛndɛ fuɲi fari.<verse eid="PSA 56:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s1">N bara limaniya sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Dawuda xa suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «I naxa halaki ti.» Dawuda naxa yi ba a to a gi Sɔlu ma, a sa so fɔnmɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Ala, hinnɛ n na, yandi i xa hinnɛ n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">N maratangɛ fenma i yire</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">alɔ tɔxɛyɔrɛ a fenma a nga gabutenyi bun ma ki naxɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">han fe xɔrɔxɔɛ xa dangi.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />N bara Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi maxandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">naxan n ma fe birin sɔɔnɛyama.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />N xɔnmixie n ɲaxankatama tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">Ala n nakisima nɛ kelife ariyanna, <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">a hinnɛ nun nɔndi ragoroma n ma.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Yɛtɛe bara n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">n saxi e tagi, e tan naxee adamadie faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">E ɲinyie luxi alɔ tanbɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">e nɛnyie luxi alɔ santidɛgɛma naxan baxi a tɛɛ i.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Ala, i xa i xa binyɛ masen koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">i xa a masen bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />E bara yɛlɛ ti n ya ra, a gbe mu luxi n xa so a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">E bara yili ge n ya ra, kɔnɔ e tan nan biraxi a kui. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Ala, n bɔɲɛ bara limaniya, n bara limaniya sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">N bɛɛti bama nɛ, n i tantuma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />N bɔɲɛ bara keli n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">n xa n ma kɔrae tongo, n xa bɛɛti ba han subaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Marigi, n i tantuma nɛ sie tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">N bɛɛti bama nɛ i bɛ bɔnsɔɛe tagi.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />I xa hinnɛ koore lima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">i xa tinxinyi tema nɛ han nuxuie.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 57:12" />Ala, i xa i xa binyɛ masen koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:12">i xa a masen bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 57:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Adamadie sare</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Dawuda xa suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «I naxa kasarɛ ti».<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Wo xa wɔyɛnyi mu tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">Adamadie, wo nɔma kiiti sade nɔndi ra?<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Ade, wo fe ɲaaxi rabama wo bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">wo fe ɲaaxi rabama yi bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">wo mixi ratantanma duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Kafi e bari tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">e findixi mixi ɲaaxi nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">Wule falɛe bara lɔɛ kabi e bari lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />E xa xɔnɛ luxi nɛ alɔ bɔximase xɔnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">alɔ bɔximase naxan mu bɔximase suxui xui ramɛma.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Hali bɔximase suxui fanyi, a mu nɔma a suxude.<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Ala, i xa e ɲinyi kana e dɛ i, barima e luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">Alatala, i xa e dɛ wanwan.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />E ɲɔnma nɛ alɔ ye naxan ifilima bɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">E xa tanbɛ mu ɲɛrɛma sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />A luma alɔ boe naxan fate lɔɛma lingi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">A luma alɔ di naxan baxi a nga fate i, a mu foye to.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Beenun tunde xa fura yege malinsinxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">xa na mu a ra yege xare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">Ala e kɔma nɛ, a e wɔlɛ a i.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Mixi tinxinxi fama ɲɛlɛxinde barima a fama gbeɲɔxɔɛ sɔtɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">A fama a sanyi maxade mixi ɲaaxi wuli ra.<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 58:12" />Adamadie fama a falade, «Iyo, Ala mixi tinxinxi sare fima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:12">Iyo, Ala kiiti sama nɛ duniɲa ma.»<verse eid="PSA 58:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Bare xaaɲɛe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Dawuda xa suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «I naxa halaki ti». A naxa a ba Sɔlu to sɔɔrie xɛɛ e xa Dawuda faxa a xa banxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />N Marigi Ala, n natanga n yaxuie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">N ma fe xa te dangife n yaxuie xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />N natanga tinxintaree ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">N nakisi faxɛtie ma,<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />barima e wama n faxafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Sɛnbɛmae na e malanfe n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">hali n mu findi fe kobi raba ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">hali n mu yunubi yo raba Alatala ra.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Hali n mu na fe ɲaaxi rabafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">e e gima n fɔxɔ ra, e xa n gere.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Keli, i fa n mali! Yandi n ma fe mato.<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Isirayila Marigi Alatala, Mangɛ Ala, keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">i xa si danxaniyataree ratɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">I naxa diɲɛ yi yanfante tinxintaree ma. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />E fama kɔɛ ra alɔ bare xaaɲɛe e fa taa rabilin.<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />E dɛ luma alɔ bare dɛ xunfɛ minima naxan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">E xa wɔyɛnyi mixi tɔɔrɔma alɔ santidɛgɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">E naxɛ, «Nde nɔma won ma wɔyɛnyi mɛde?»<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Kɔnɔ Alatala, i tan nan yelema e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">I si danxaniyataree birin mayelema.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />N nan n yɛtɛ ratangama e sɛnbɛ ma i tan nan saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">Ala nan na n ma kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />N Marigi Ala, naxan xa hinnɛ gbo, i xa ti n ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">i xa n yaxuie rabira.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />N Marigi, n ma kantama, i naxa e faxa keren na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">I xa e rabira alako n ma ɲama naxa nɛɛmu i sɛnbɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />E yunubi rabama e xa wɔyɛnyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">I xa e suxu e xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">E dankɛe nun wulee nan tun falama.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />I xa e raɲɔn i xa xɔnɛ ra, alako e naxa to sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">alako e xa a kolon Ala nan Mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ nun duniɲa birin xun ma. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />E fama kɔɛ ra alɔ bare xaaɲɛe e fa taa rabilin.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Baree donse fenma yire birin kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">kɔnɔ e mu lugama.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />N i sɛnbɛ matɔxɔma bɛɛti ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">N i xa hinnɛ matɔxɔma gɛɛsɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">barima n ma kantama nan i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">i n kantama n ma tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 59:18" />N ma sɛnbɛma, n bɛɛti bama i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">N Marigi Ala nan n kantama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">n Marigi Ala nan n hinnɛma n na.<verse eid="PSA 59:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Ala fama xunnakeli ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Dawuda xa lɔnni suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «Fuge tofanyi alɔ Ala xa saatɛ.» <verse eid="PSA 60:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Isirayila to Sirenikae gere, e yi bɛɛti ba na tɛmui nɛ. E nu kelixi Mesopotamiya nun Soba bɔxi ma. Yowaba naxa Edonka wulu fu nun firin faxa fole kui fɔxɔɛ na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Ala, i bara muxu ralɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">i bara nde ba muxu xa gali ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">i bara xɔnɔ muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">kɔnɔ yakɔsi, i xa sɛnbɛ fi muxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />I bara bɔxi rasɛrɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">i bara a ibɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">I xa na yailan muxu bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">barima bɔxi wama kanafe.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />I bara fe xɔrɔxɔɛe dɔxɔ i xa mixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">han e bara lu alɔ siisila.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Kɔnɔ naxee gaaxuxi i ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">i bara tɔnxuma so e yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">e xa nɔ e yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />I xa i xanuntenyie rakisi i sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">i xa muxu xa dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Ala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">a naxan falaxi hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">«N Sikemi taa fima nɛ wo ma xunnakeli kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">n Sukɔti geya lanbanyi fan fi wo ma.<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Galadi bɔxi, n gbe. Manasi bɔxi, n gbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Efiramikae nan findima n ma geresoe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">N mangɛ dɔxɔma nɛ Yudaya.<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Mowabakae findima n ma konyie nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">Edon findi n ma bɔxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">N gere xui ratema nɛ Filisita.»<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Ala, nde nɔma n xaninde na taa makantaxi kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">Nde nɔma n xaninde han Edon bɔxi ma?<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />I tan gbansan, i tan naxan muxu ralɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">i tan naxan mu nu na muxu xa sɔɔrie sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 60:13" />Muxu mali muxu yaxuie gerede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:13">Adamadi xa mali, sese mu a ra,<verse eid="PSA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 60:14" />kɔnɔ Ala xa mali tan fama muxu yaxui birin halakide.<verse eid="PSA 60:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Kelife yire makuye</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Ala, i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">N ma maxandi ramɛ.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />N i maxandima kelife ra bɔxi makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">N bɔɲɛ mu saxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">N xanin geya fari naxan ite dangife n na.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />I findixi n bɛ yire nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">n kantaxi dɛnnaxɛ n yaxuie ya i.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />N wama lufe i xɔnyi tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">N wama lufe i xa kantari kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">alɔ xɔni yɔrɛ luma a nga gabutenyi bun ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />N Marigi Ala, i bara i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">I bara kɛ fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">nun mixi birin ma naxee gaaxuxi i xili ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Mangɛ xa simaya xunmasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">alako a xa bu a gbegbe ra.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />A xa mangɛya xa bu i ya i tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">I xa hinnɛ a ra, i xa findi a dugutɛgɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 61:9" />Iyo, n mu taganma bɛɛti bafe ra i xili binye bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:9">barima i n ma maxandi yaabima tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 61:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa bɔɲɛsa</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ Yedutun bɛ<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />N bɔɲɛ saxi Ala nan saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">n ma kisi fatanxi a tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />A luxi n bɛ alɔ fanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">n ma marakisima nun n makantama nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">N mu nɔma birade sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Wo dutunma mixie ma han mun tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">wo xa e rabira, alɔ banxi nun tɛtɛ fori?<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />E wule falama alako e xa mixie ba yire fanyi e nu dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">E dubɛ tima e dɛ ra, kɔnɔ e dankɛ tan tima e bɔɲɛ ra. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />N bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔma Ala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">barima n xaxili tixi a tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />A luxi alɔ fanye na a ra n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">n ma marakisima nun n ma makantama nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">N mu nɔma birade sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />N ma kisi nun n ma binyɛ na Ala nan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Ala n makantama nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">n yigi tide nan a ra.<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Ɲama, wo xa wo taxu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wo xa wo xa kɔntɔfili masen a bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">A tan nan nɔma won malide. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Adamadie luma alɔ foye naxan dangima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">Mixi xungbe findima mixi xuri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">Xa e xa fe bara maniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">a yelebu alɔ foye.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Wo naxa harige fen fe kobi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">wo naxa a fen muɲɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">Xa wo xa naafuli sa gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">wo naxa wo xaxili ti na ra.<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />Ala bara fe firin fala n naxee mɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">Keren, sɛnbɛ na Ala bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 62:13" />A firin nde, n Marigi nan hinnɛnte ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:13">barima a mixie sare ragbilenma e ma.<verse eid="PSA 62:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa hinnɛ fan simaya bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti, a naxan ba Yudaya, a to nu gbengberenyi ma tɛmui naxɛ<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Ala nan n Marigi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">Ala n i fenma, barima n hayi na i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">alɔ fate hayi to na ye ma gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />N luma i xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">alako n xa i sɛnbɛ nun i xa binyɛ to.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />I xa hinnɛ fan simaya bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">N bara i matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />N i tantuma n ma simaya birin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">n nan n bɛlɛxɛe itema i mabiri.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />N bɔnsɔɛ wasama nɛ i tantufe ra sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />N na n sa n i xa fe maɲɔxunma kɔɛ birin,<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />barima i tan nan n malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">N sɛɛwama nɛ i niini bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />N nii bara fatu i ma, i bɛlɛxɛ luma nɛ n bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Naxee katama n faxade, e tan nan faxama.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Santidɛgɛma fama nɛ e sɔxɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">wulai baree fa e ibɔɔde.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 63:12" />Mangɛ sɛɛwama nɛ Ala xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">Naxee e kalima Ala xili ra, nee fama nɛ a matɔxɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">Kɔnɔ wule falɛe dɛe balanma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s1">Adama xa maɲɔxunyi tilin</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Ala, i tuli mati n wa xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">N natanga n yaxuie ma.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />N nɔxun mixi ɲaaxie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">naxee wama n tɔɔrɔfe tinxintareya kui.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />E dɛ xaaɲɛ alɔ santidɛgɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">e xa wɔyɛn ɲaaxie luma alɔ tanbɛe.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />E mu gaaxuma tinxintɔɛ ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">e luma a ɲaxankata ra tun.<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />E dɛ kobi, e yɛlɛ italama mixi ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">E naxɛ, «Nde na kolonma?»<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />E yanfanteya yailanma, e a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">«Won xa keli a yanfa xili ma. A sɔɔnɛyama nɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">Adama xa maɲɔxunyi tilin.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Kɔnɔ Ala na tanbɛe woli, e e lima nɛ keren na.<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />E bara wule fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">Naxee e toma, e e gima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Na gaaxui adama birin suxuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">E Ala xa wali masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">e a xa wali kolonma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 64:11" />Tinxintɔɛ sɛɛwama nɛ Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:11">a fa lu a niini bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:11">Sondon fanyi kanyi ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Saabui fanyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Matɔxɔɛ na i tan Ala bɛ Siyoni geya fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">Muxu laayidi naxan tongoxi i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">muxu na birin nakamalima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Ala, i muxu xa maxandi birin mɛma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">Duniɲa birin fama nɛ birade i fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Tantanyi to nɔ muxu ra, i bara muxu xa yunubi xafari.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />I naxan sugandima a xa makɔrɛ i xa salide ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">na ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ barima a buma nɛ i xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">Muxu bara wasa i xa fe fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">fe sɛniyɛnxi naxan kelixi i xa hɔrɔmɔlingira.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />I muxu xa maxandi yaabima kaabanako nun tinxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">Ala, i bara findi muxu rakisima ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">Duniɲa yire birin xaxili tixi i ra.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />I bara geya daa i sɛnbɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">barima sɛnbɛma nan i ra.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />I bara baa xui radundu, mɔrɔnyi xui mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">I bara ɲama fan masabari.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Duniɲa birin gaaxuma nɛ i xa kaabanakoe ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Kelife sogetede han sogegorode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">e birin e ɲɛlɛxin xui raminima nɛ i xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />I bɔxi mɛɛni, a a rafe fe fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">I xure rafema ye ra alako mixie xa baloe sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />I tunɛ ye sama bɔxi ma alako bɔxi xa bɔrɔxɔ sansi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">I barakɛ sama xɛ ma, a xa fan.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Xɛ xaba tɛmui i fe fanyi raminima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">I xa sansi sase rafema nɛ, han a fili a ma.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Gbengberenyi fiilie nun geyae fanma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 65:14" />Xurusee yiriwama nɛ fiili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">Sansi yiriwama nɛ geya bunyie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">Na birin, Ala xa fe fanyi nan masenma won bɛ sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 65:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa kaabanakoe magaaxu</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Bɛɛti nun suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Adamadie birin xui xa ite sɛɛwɛ ra Ala bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Wo xa a xili binya bɛɛti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">wo xa a binya matɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Wo xa a fala Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">«I xa kaabanakoe magaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">I sɛnbɛ gbo han. Hali i yaxuie sɛrɛnma i ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Duniɲa birin i batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">e i binya bɛɛti ra, e i xili matɔxɔ.» <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Wo fa Ala xa wali matode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">A na fe raba adamadie tagi, na magaaxu.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />A baa findi xare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">a mixi ragiri xure ma e sanyi xaraxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Na kui, won ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ a ra.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />A duniɲa yamarima sɛnbɛ ra abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">A ya tixi sie ra, matandilae mu nɔma kelide sɔnɔn. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Sie, wo xa won Marigi Ala tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">wo xa wo xui ramini a matɔxɔfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />A bara simaya fi won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">a mu tin won xa bira,<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />barima Ala won bɔɲɛ kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">A bara won mato alɔ mixi gbeti matoma ki naxɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">a a raxunu alako a gbi xa ba.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />I bara muxu xun ti yɛlɛ kui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">i man bara kote dɔxɔ muxu xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />I bara a lu mixie xa nɔ muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">muxu xa tɔɔrɔ ye nun tɛ xɔɔra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">Kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi, i bara muxu xun ti daxamui yire ra.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />N fama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra i xa banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">n nan n ma laayidi rakamalima nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />n naxee fala n dɛ ra n nu tɔɔrɛ kui tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />N xuruse turaxie bama nɛ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">alɔ yɛxɛɛ kontonyie, tuurae, nun si donbie. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Wo fa, wo xa wo tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">wo tan naxee gaaxuma Ala ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">N xa a masen Ala naxan nabaxi n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />N bara a xili, n bara a matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Xa yanfanteya nu na n bɔɲɛ kui nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">n Marigi mu nu a tuli matima n na.<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Kɔnɔ Ala bara n xui ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">a n ma dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Tantui na Ala bɛ naxan bara n ma maxandi xui mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">a man bara hinnɛ n na.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s1">Si birin xa Ala xa marakisi kolon</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Bɛɛti nun suuki bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />Ala xa hinnɛ won na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">Ala xa barakɛ ragoro won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">Ala xa naiyalanyi xa yanba won ma, <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate</char><verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />alako a xa kirae xa kolon duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">alako si birin xa a xa marakisi kolon.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Ala, sie xa i tantu, si birin xa i tantu.<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />E xa bɛɛti ba ɲɛlɛxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">barima i sie makiitima nɔndi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">i tan nan e raɲɛrɛma yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Ala, sie xa i tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">si birin xa i tantu.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Bɔxi bara daxamui ramini won bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">tantui na won Marigi Ala bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 67:8" />Ala xa barakɛ sa won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:8">duniɲa birin xa gaaxu a ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 67:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s1">Ala nan duniɲa mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Ala xa keli, a yaxuie xa yensen yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">Naxee a xɔnma, e xa e gi a ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />I i yaxuie ralɔɛma nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">alɔ foye tɛ tuuri ralɔɛma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">Kaafiri lɔɛma nɛ Ala ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">alɔ ture xunuma tɛ i ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Kɔnɔ mixi tinxinxi ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">e e sɛɛwɛ xui itema nɛ Ala ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">E tan luma na ɲɛlɛxinyi nan kui.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Won xa bɛɛti ba Ala bɛ, won xa a xili matɔxɔ bɛɛti ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">Naxan ɲɛrɛma nuxui fari, won xa a rasɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">A xili Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">Won xa won sɛɛwɛ xui rate a ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Ala, misikiinɛ baba nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">Ala, kaaɲɛ makantɛ nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">Ala xɔnyi sɛniyɛn.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Ala denbaya fima denbayatare ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">Ala xɔrɛya fima geelimanie ma, e ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">Kɔnɔ Ala matandie luma nɛ gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />Ala, i nu na i xa ɲama ya ra wula i tɛmui naxɛ,<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />bɔxi birin nu sɛrɛnma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">Tunɛ ye nu goroma Ala ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">Isirayila Marigi Ala, naxan na Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Ala nu tunɛ ye ragoroma bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">a xa sɛnbɛ fi a xa bɔxi taganxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />I bara i xa ɲama rasabati naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">I bara tɔɔrɔmixi mali naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">I na birin nabaxi nɛ barima i fan.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />Marigi masenyi fanyi soma a xa xɛɛrae yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">Gali belebele nan e ra. E naxɛ,<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />«Geresoe mangɛe na e gife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">e na e gife wo ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">Wo xa ginɛe naxee luxi banxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">e fama yi gere naafuli itaxunde.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Wo fama wo malabude wo xa xurusee fɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">Ala mɛɛnima nɛ a xa ɲama ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">alɔ a mɛɛnima ganbɛe ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">E gabutenyi luma alɔ gbeti nun xɛɛma nan na e ma.»<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi bara mangɛe rayensen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">Salamon geya ma balabalanyi saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Basan geya, Ala naxan daaxi, konde wuyaxi naxan bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />wo na Ala xa geya sugandixi matofe tɔɔnɛ ra munfe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">a bara a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ti dɛnnaxɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Ala luma nɛ mɛnni tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Alatala xa geresoe xa gisee wuya dangi wulu fu ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">A xa geresoe fan dangi wulu wulue ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Ala na e ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Sinayi geya na yire sɛniyɛnxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />N Marigi Alatala, i bara te koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">I bara geelimanie xanin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Adamadie bara i buɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">matandilae fan bara wa sofe i xɔnyi.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Tantui na i bɛ lɔxɔɛ birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">a won ma kote xaninfe lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">Won ma marakisima na Ala nan na.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Won Marigi Alatala won nakelima nɛ faxɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">Won ma marakisima na Ala nan na.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Ala a yaxuie xunyi kanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">Naxee ɲɛrɛ kira ɲaaxi xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">a nee fan xun xɔri bɔɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />Marigi naxɛ, «N fama nɛ e ra kelife Basan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">n fa e ra kelife baa ma,<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />alako wo xa fa e wuli to wo sanlaabe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">Wo xa baree fan e donma nɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Ala, muxu bara i to fa ra ɲama ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">Ala nun a xa mangɛ sugandixi na sofe hɔrɔmɔlingira kui.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Bɛɛtibae na yare, kɔra bɔnbɔɛe na e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">ginɛe na maxase ramaxafe e rabilinyi.<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Wo xa Ala tantu malanyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">Isirayila xa die, wo xa Alatala tantu.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Bunyamin nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">naxan barixi dɔnxɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">A tan nan findixi e xa mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">Yudaya mangɛe nan ya, e nun e xa mixie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">Sabulon mangɛe nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">Nafatali mangɛe nan ya.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />Ala, i xa masenyi ti sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">I xa i sɛnbɛ masen alɔ tɛmui dangixi.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />I xa banxi na Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Mangɛe fama i buɲade naa.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />I xa xaaɲɛ Misira ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">naxan maniyɛ mali xungbe ra naxan na ye xɔɔra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">A luma alɔ tuura gali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">ninge yɔrɛe biraxi naxee fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Na ninge yɔrɛe luma alɔ si gbɛtɛe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">naxee duuti fima Misira ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Si gbɛtɛe naxee wama gere xɔn, i</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">xa e rayensen yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Misira xɛɛrae, a nun Kusi xɛɛrae, xa fa duuti ra Ala bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />Mangɛ naxee birin na duniɲa, nun a rabilinyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">wo xa bɛɛti ba Ala bɛ, wo xa Alatala tantu,<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />naxan ɲɛrɛma nuxui fari koore ma kabi a rakuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">naxan galanyi xui raminima sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Wo xa a kolon, Ala sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">A Isirayila yamarima a sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">sɛnbɛ naxan kelima koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 68:36" />Ala, i na i xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Ala, i magaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Isirayila Marigi Ala sɛnbɛ fima nɛ a xa ɲama ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Ala tantu!<verse eid="PSA 68:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s1">N na birife</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili, «Fuge tofanyie.»<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Ala, n nakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Ye bara te han n kɔnyi.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />N na birife boora tilinxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">n sanyi mu tide yo sɔtɔfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">N na madulafe ye xɔɔra.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />N bara i xili han n bara tagan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">n xui yo mu na sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">n ya bara n xɔnɔ i fenfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />N xɔnmixie bara wuya dangi n xunsɛxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">Sɛnbɛmae nan e ra naxee wama n faxafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">E findi n yaxuie ra hali n mu fefe rabaxi e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">N mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">kɔnɔ e wama n xa sare nde fi.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Ala, i n ma tantanyi kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">n ma yunubie mu nɔxunxi i ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Mangɛ Alatala, i naxa a lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">danxaniyatɔɛe xa yaagi n ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">Isirayila Marigi Ala, i naxa a lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">i fenmae xa ifu n ma fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />E n konbima i tan nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">N bara yaagi han.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />N xunyae mu n kolon sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">n bara lu n taarae bɛ alɔ xɔɲɛ nde.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />N wama i waxɔnfe rabafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">I konbimae bara findi n yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />N wama, n sunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">Na birin man kui, mixie n konbima.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />N sunnun donma ragoroma n ma, e n mayelema.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Naxee dɔxɔxi taa sode dɛ ra, nee n mafalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">siisilae n mayelema sigi ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Kɔnɔ Alatala, n bara i maxandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">Ala i xa hinnɛ n na barima i xa hinnɛ gbo.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />N nakisi alako n naxa biri boora xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">n natanga n xɔnmixie ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />I naxa tin n xa madula, ye naxa n nalɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">n naxa goro aligiyama.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Alatala, n xui ratin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">i tan naxan fan, naxan xa hinnɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">I xa kinikini n ma, i xa n mali.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />I naxa i nɔxun i xa konyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">N na tɔɔrɛ kui, yandi n mali.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />I xa i makɔrɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">i xa n xunsara, i xa n nakisi n yaxuie ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />I bara n ma tɔɔrɛ nun n ma yaagi kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">n yaxuie birin na i ya i.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Konbi bara n bɔɲɛ kana han n bara fura.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">N hayi na kinikini ma, kɔnɔ a mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">N hayi na mixi madundumae ma, kɔnɔ e mu toma.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />E pɔsɔnɛ sama n ma donse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">e minse xɔnɛ soma n yi ra, ye ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />E xa teebili xa findi gantanyi ra e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">e xa naafuli xa findi yɛlɛ ra naxan e suxuma.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />E ya xa ifɔɔrɔ, e xa dɔnxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">E tagi xa e xɔnɔ han e xa bira.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />I xa xɔnɔ e ma, e xa na tɛ kolon.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />E xa gɔɔrɛ xa ɲɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">adamadie naxa lu e xɔnyi sɔnɔn,<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />barima e tɔɔrɔmixie xa tɔɔrɛ xun masama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">i naxee ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">E mixie mayelema, i naxee halaki.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />I xa e xa yunubi birin to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">alako e naxa i xa kisi sɔtɔ sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />E xilie xa ba simaya sɛbɛli kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">e naxa lu tinxintɔɛe ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />N tan na tɔɔrɔfe yi tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">Ala, i xa n nakisi, i xa n nakeli.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />N fama Ala xili matɔxɔde bɛɛti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">n fama tantui rasigade a ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Na rafan Alatala ma dangife sɛrɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">hali ninge kamalixi na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">hali tuura feri kanyi na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">toree na naxan bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Tɔɔrɔmixie sɛɛwama nɛ na tofe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">Naxee Ala fenma, e simaya xɔnkuye sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Alatala a tuli matima setaree ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">a mu nɛɛmuma a xa mixie ma e xa tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Koore nun bɔxi xa a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">baa nun yɛxɛɛe xa a binya.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Ala fama Siyoni rakiside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">a Yuda taae tima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">A man ɲama sabati naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">naa xa findi e gbe ra.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 69:37" />Na findima a xa konyie xa mamadie kɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:37">Ala xanuntenyie fama nɛ lude naa.<verse eid="PSA 69:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s1">Ala fenmae xa sɛɛwa</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Dawuda xa maxandi bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Ala, n nakisi! Alatala, fa n mali mafuren.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Ala xa mixie rayaagi naxee wama n faxafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">Ala xa e keri, Ala xa e ya ifu, naxee wama n tɔɔrɔfe.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Ala xa e keri yaagi kui, naxee a falama n bɛ, «I xa tɔɔrɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />I fenmae xa sɛɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Naxee wama i xa kisi xɔn, e xa Ala matɔxɔ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 70:6" />Ala, n findixi misikiinɛ nun tɔɔrɔmixi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">fa n mali, i naxa dugundi.<verse eid="PSA 70:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s1">Fori xa maxandi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Alatala, n kantama na i tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">i naxa tin n xa lu yaagi kui.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />I xa n nakisi, i xa n mali i xa tinxinyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">I tuli mati n na, i n nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />I xa n kanta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">I bara a fala n bɛ n xa lu i xa niini bun ma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">alako n xa kisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">N kantama na i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />N Marigi Ala, n natanga mixi ɲaaxie sɛnbɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">n natanga xɔnnante tinxintaree ma.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />N Marigi Alatala, n xaxili tixi i tan nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui,<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />kabi n nu na n nga tɛɛgɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">I tan nan a niya n xa bari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">N i matɔxɔma tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />N findixi misaali nan na mixi wuyaxi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">barima n kantama sɛnbɛma na i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />N i matɔxɔma tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />I naxa mɛɛ n na n ma foriɲa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">i naxa n nabɛɲin n ma sɛnbɛtareya kui.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />N yaxuie n mafalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">e wɔyɛnma e bora ra alako e xa n faxa.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />E naxɛ, «Ala bara a rabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">won xa bira a fɔxɔ ra, won xa a suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">Mixi yo mu nɔma a ratangade.»<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Ala, i naxa i makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">N Marigi Ala, fa n mali mafuren.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Ala xa e rayaagi, a xa e raɲɔn, naxee n tɔɔɲɛgɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">Ala xa e rayaagi, a xa e ya ifu, naxee wama n tɔɔrɔfe.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />N xaxili tixi i ra kudɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">N luma i matɔxɔ ra tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />N i xa tinxinyi nun i xa kisi tantuma lɔxɔɛ birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">barima e wuya han n ɲan mu nɔma e birin kolonde.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />N i xa kaabanako rabaxie matɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">N Marigi Alatala, n fama i xa tinxinyi gbansan masende.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Ala, i na n xaranfe kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">Han ya n i xa kaabanakoe matɔxɔma.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Ala, i naxa n nabɛɲin yakɔsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">n bara fori, n xunsɛxɛ fan bara fuga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">I naxa n nabɛɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">alako n xa i sɛnbɛ masen to nun tina mixie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Ala, i xa tinxinyi gbo alɔ geya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">I xa kaabanako wuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">I maniyɛ na minden?<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Hali i to bara a niya muxu xa tɔɔrɔ, muxu xa halaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">i fama muxu rakiside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">i fama muxu rakelide gaburi tilinxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />I xa n xun nakeli, i xa n madundu.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />N Marigi Ala, na kui n i tantuma nɛ kɔra ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">i xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ, n bɛɛti bama i bɛ kɔra ra.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />N bɛɛti bama nɛ i bɛ, n i matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">barima i bara n xun sara.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />N i xa tinxinyi matɔxɔma nɛ tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">barima naxee nu wama n tɔɔrɔfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">e bara lu yaagi kui.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayila mangɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Sulemani gbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Ala, i xa a niya mangɛ xa kiiti tinxinxi sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">I xa tinxinyi xa lu mangɛ xa di dɛ i.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Na kui a xa i xa ɲama makiiti nɔndi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">a xa tinxin tɔɔrɔmixie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Masenyi xa ti geyae fari, ɲama bɔɲɛ saxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">xibaarui xa yensen bɔxi ma, tinxinyi nan ɲama yamarima.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Mangɛ xa sɛriyɛ raba tɔɔrɔmixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">a xa setare xa die rakisi, a xa e gerefae rayensen.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Mixie xa gaaxu i ya ra abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">danmi soge nun kike yanbama.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Mangɛ xa lu alɔ tunɛ naxan birama xɛe ma, naxan bɔxi rafanma.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Tinxintɔɛ xa fe fanma na waxati nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">danmi kike yanbama, bɔɲɛsa gboma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />A xa mangɛya gboma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">sa fɔlɔ sogetede han a sa dɔxɔ sogegorode ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">a fɔlɔ Efirati xure ma han sa dɔxɔ bɔxi danyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Mixi naxee na wula i, e xinbi sinma nɛ a bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">a yaxuie lu a sanyi bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Tarasisi mangɛe nun Suri mangɛe fama nɛ buɲae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">Seeba nun Seba mangɛe fan duuti fima nɛ a ma.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Mangɛ birin e xinbi sinma nɛ a bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">sie birin lu a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Na kui setaree fama nɛ a xilide marakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">A misikiinɛ sɛnbɛtare malima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />A kinikinima nɛ sɛnbɛtaree nun setaree ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">a tɔɔrɔmixie rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />A e xɔrɛyama nɛ maifui nun fe kobie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">barima e findixi a xanuntenyie nan na.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />A xa mangɛya xa bu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">A Seeba bɔxi xa xɛɛma sɔtɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Mixie xa Ala maxandi a bɛ tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">e naxa tagan dubade a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Ala donse yiriwama nɛ bɔxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Geyae rafema nɛ sansie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">e bogie lu alɔ sansi bogi naxee na Liban.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">Mixie gboma nɛ taa kui alɔ bɔxi sɛxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Mangɛ Ala xili gbo abadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Dan mu na a xili ma soge bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Si birin barakɛ sɔtɔma nɛ a saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">e fa a matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Isirayila Marigi Alatala tantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">A keren nan kaabanakoe rabama.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />A xili xungbe xa tantu abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Duniɲa birin xa a xa binyɛ kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Yisayi xa di Dawuda xa maxandie raɲɔnyi nan na ki.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="s1">Ɲaaxuɲa sare</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">Nɔndi hagigɛ nan ya: Ala fan Isirayila bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">a fan mixie bɛ naxee sondonyi sɛniyɛnxi.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />A gbe mu nu luxi n tan yati xa ba kira ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">n sanyie xa bira kira gbɛtɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />N nu yɛtɛ igboe tɔɔnɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">n to a to mixi ɲaaxie findixi naafuli kanyie ra.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Sese mu e ifuma han e xa faxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">e fate yalanxi tun.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />E mu adamadie xa tɔɔrɛ kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">e mu ɲaxankataxi alɔ booree.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Yɛtɛ igboɲa findixi xunmase nan na e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">e mixi tɔɔrɔma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />E e ya tima se birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">e waxɔnfe bara dangi a i.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />E yoma mixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">e fe ɲaaxi ɲanigema yɛtɛ igboɲa kui.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />E Ala fe maberema, e dɛ mu dikima sese falafe ra duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Na nan a ra, Ala xa ɲama a xun tima e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">e la e xa wɔyɛnyie ra.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />E naxɛ, «Ala tan won ɲɛrɛ ki kolonma di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Fahaamui mundun na a bɛ?»<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Mixi ɲaaxie na na ki nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">E bɔɲɛ saxi naafuli yiriwafe kui.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />N ɲɔxɔ a ma, «N nan n bɔɲɛ rasɛniyɛnxi nɛ fu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">N gbilenfe fe kobie fɔxɔ ra, na mu fanxi n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />N ɲaxankataxi tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ nde sama n ma kote xun.»<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Xa n sa na mɔɔli fala nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">n bara yanfanteya raba i xa die ra nu.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Awa, n naxa fahaamui fen yi fe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">Na nu xɔrɔxɔ n bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />han n so lɔxɔɛ Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">n fa a maɲɔxun fe naxan fe kobi rabae lima.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />I e tima kira salaxunxi nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">i fa e xun nakana.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />E xa fe ɲɔnma kerenyi nan na, fe magaaxuxi e xaninma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Marigi, alɔ xiye dangima ki naxɛ mixi xunu tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">i na keli, e fan xa fe bama i ya i na ki nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />N bɔɲɛ to nu maɲaaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">a nu luxi nɛ n bɛ alɔ tanbɛ nan n sɔxɔma.<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />Daxui nan nu n na, n mu nu sese fahaamuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">N nu luxi nɛ alɔ xuruse xaxilitare i ya i.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Kɔnɔ han ya n na i sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">n yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ suxuxi i yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />I n naɲɛrɛma i xa marasi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">i man n nasɛnɛma nɛ i xa nɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Nde gbɛtɛ na n yi ra koore ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Ba i tan na, sese gbɛtɛ xɔli mu n ma yi duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />N fate nun n xaxili taganma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">kɔnɔ Ala n bɔɲɛ sama nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Naxee e makuyama i ra, bɔnɔ mixi nan e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">I mixie dɛ balanma, naxee birin i finsiriwalima.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Kɔnɔ n ma hɛɛri findixi n masofe nan na Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">N bara Marigi Alatala sugandi n xun taxude ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">alako n xa i xa wali fanyie birin masen duniɲa bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kanaxi xa fe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Asafi xa lɔnni bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Ala, munfe ra i muxu rabɛɲinxi kerenyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Munfe ra i xa xɔnɛ turuma i xa ɲama xili ma i naxan nabalofe?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />I xa ratu i xa ɲama ma i naxan xun saraxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">i kɛ fima naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">i sabatixi naxan ya ma Siyon geya ma.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />I xa a yire mato a yaxuie naxan kanaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">i xa i xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi to e naxan kasaraxi.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />I yaxuie bara e xui ite i xa naralan banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">e bara e xa fɛlɛkie rate naa.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />E nu luxi alɔ beera kanyi naxee fɔtɔnyi sɛgɛma.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />E bara hɔrɔmɔlingira xunmasee kana beera nun dɛrɛmae ra,<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />e naa gan tɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">E bara na yire mabere i xili sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />E nu a falama nɛ e bɔɲɛ ma, «Won xa e sɔntɔ!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">E bara Ala xa batudee birin gan.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />I xa kaabanakoe mu toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">namiɲɔnmɛe fan mu na muxu ya ma kɔrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">Muxu mu a kolon yi fe buma han tɛmui mundun.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Ee Ala, yaxui mayele tima han tɛmui mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Danyi mu na e xa konbie ma?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Munfe ra i mu i sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi masen e bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">I xa keli, i xa e sɔntɔ!<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye, Ala nan na n ma mangɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">a tan naxan findixi xunnakeli saabui ra duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />I tan nan baa ibɔɔ i sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">i daalise magaaxuxie xunyie ibutuxun naa.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />I tan nan e xunyie ibutuxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">i e fi donse ra wulai subee ma.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />I tan nan dulonyie nun xuree rabɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">i tan nan dabonyie raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">naxee mu darixi xɔri ra.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Yanyi nun kɔɛ findixi i gbe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">kike nun soge, i tan nan e daaxi.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />I tan nan bɔxie naaninyie birin saxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">I tan nan sogofure nun ɲɛmɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />I xa ratu a ma a muxu yaxuie na i tan Alatala nan maberefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">ɲama xaxilitare na i xili bɛxufe!<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Yandi, i naxa i xa ɲama xanuxi rabolo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">alɔ ganbɛ di raboloma sɛgɛ yi ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">I naxa nɛɛmu i xa misikiinɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />I xa i ɲɔxɔ sa i xa saatɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">barima fe kobie bara gbo yi bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">han a bara dangi a i.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />I naxa tɔɔrɔmixie lu e xa yaagi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">Misikiinɛe nun setaree xa i xili matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Ala, i xa keli i xili xunmafalafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">I xa ratu xaxilitare xa mabere ma.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />I naxa nɛɛmu i yaxuie xa wɔyɛnyie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">i naxa nɛɛmu i gerefae xa sɔnxɔɛ ma naxan mu ɲɔnma.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa kiiti</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «I naxa kasarɛ ti.»<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Muxu Marigi Ala, muxu bara i matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">Matɔxɔɛ na i bɛ, i tan naxan na muxu sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">i tan naxan xa kaabanakoe falama yire birin.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />I naxɛ, «N ma waxati sugandixi na a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">n tan nan kiiti sama tinxinyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Duniɲa nun a xa mixie fama xunude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">kɔnɔ n tan nan a kinkie sɛnbɛ soma.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />N a falama yɛtɛ igboe nun mixi kobie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">‹Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ igbo, wo naxa wo xunyi ite.<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Wo naxa wo xunyi ite koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">wo ba yɛtɛ igboɲa wɔyɛnyi falafe ra.›»<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Wo xa a kolon xunnakeli mu kelima sogetede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">a mu kelima sogegorode, a mu kelima gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Ala nan kiiti sama, a mixi nde xa fe ragoro, a mixi nde xa fe ite.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Tɔnbili nde na Alatala xɔnyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">wɛni xaaɲɛ rafalaxi na naxan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">A na soma duniɲa mixi ɲaaxie nan yi, e a min han a ɲɔn.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />N na masenyi tima tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">n Yaxuba Marigi Ala matɔxɔma bɛɛti ra.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 75:11" />«N mixi ɲaaxie xa yɛtɛ igboɲa xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:11">n tinxintɔɛe xun nakeli.»<verse eid="PSA 75:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa xunnakeli</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Ala kolonxi Yudaya bɔxi ma, a xili gbo Isirayila.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />A xɔnyi na Salamu, a xa banxi na Siyon.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />A geresosee alɔ xalie, wure lefae, nun santidɛgɛmae kana mɛnni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />I xa nɔrɛ gbo alɔ koyinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">naxan gbilen kelife geyae ma, subee wuya dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />I bara nɔ sɛnbɛmae ra, naxee mu xunuma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">naxee mu nɔ gere tide i kanke.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />I tan Yaxuba Marigi Ala to keli e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">e xa soe ragie nun e xa soe naxa halaki.<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />I magaaxu! I xa xɔnɛ kui, nde suusama i ya ra?<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />I to kiiti sa koore ma, duniɲa naxa sabari gaaxui kui.<verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />I xa kiiti naxa tɔɔrɔmixie rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />I xa xɔnɛ ibunadama mabiri findixi i matɔxɔɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">I xa bɔɲɛte luxi nɛ alɔ bɛlɛti i i tagi ixirima naxan na gere kui.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Wo xa wo xa daakan nakamali wo Marigi Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">wo xa fa sɛrɛxɛe ra a xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">wo tan naxee birin a rabilinxi.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 76:13" />A tan nan ɲɛngi bama sɛnbɛmae fate i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:13">a magaaxu duniɲa mangɛe bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa maratangɛ mu masarama</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ Yedutun bɛ<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />N nan n xui ratefe Ala nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">A a tuli matima nɛ n xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Lɔxɔ xɔrɔxɔɛe na fa n ma, n nan n Marigi xilima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">Kɔɛ ra, n nan n bɛlɛxɛ itala a bɛ, kɔnɔ n mu madundui sɔtɔma.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />N nan n natu Ala ma, n wa n bɔɲɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">N nan n maɲɔxun a ma, limaniya ba n yi.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />I mu tinma n xa xi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">N xaxili ifuxi, ɲan n mu nɔma wɔyɛnde.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />N nan n maɲɔxunma waxati dangixie ma.<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />N nan n natuma nee ma n ma bɛɛtie saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">N nan n yɛtɛ maxɔrin,<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />«N Marigi mɛɛma nɛ ibunadama ra abadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">A mu hinnɛma mixie ra sɔnɔn?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Danyi na a xa fanyi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">A tondima a xa laayidie kamalide?<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />A bara nɛɛmu a xa hinnɛ ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">A xa xɔnɛ bara nɔ a xa kinikini ra?<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />N ma tɔɔrɛ kui a luma n bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">alɔ Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi na masarafe.»<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />A lanma n xa ratu Alatala xa walie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">a xa kaabanakoe a naxee rabaxi tɛmui dangixi.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />N nan n xaxili rasigama nɛ i xa kɛwali birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">n nan n maɲɔxunma nɛ i xa walie ma.<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Ala, i xa kira sɛniyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">Ala gbɛtɛ mu na, i maniyɛ mu na!<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />I tan Ala nan kaabanakoe rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">i fe magaaxuxie masen ɲamanɛe tagi.<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />I i xa ɲama xun saraxi i sɛnbɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">Yaxuba nun Yusufu xa mamadie.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Ala, baa xungbe to i to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">a dulonyi naxa sɛrɛn.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Nuxuie naxa ye gbegbe ragoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">galanyi naxa bula koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">seyamakɔnyie naxa lu alɔ tanbɛ wolixie.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />I xa sarinyi xui naxa bula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">seyamakɔnyi naxa duniɲa iyalan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">bɔxi naxa a imaxa, a sɛrɛn.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />I naxa kira rabɔɔ baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">i dangi ye xungbe tagi, kɔnɔ i fɔxi mu to.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 77:21" />I naxa i xa ɲama raɲɛrɛ alɔ xuruse gɔɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:21">Annabi Munsa nun Haruna saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 77:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s1">Ala nun Isirayila</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Asafi xa lɔnni bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">N ma ɲama, wo wo tuli mati n ma xaranyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">wo wo, tuli mati n ma masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />N misaali nde falama wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">n fe dangixie madɔxɔ,<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />muxu fe naxee mɛ, muxu fe naxee kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">muxu babae saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Muxu mu nee nɔxunma e bɔnsɔɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">muxu Alatala xa matɔxɔɛ falama nɛ e xanbiratie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">muxu a sɛnbɛ nun a xa kaabanakoe masenma nɛ e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Ala bara yaamarie masen Yaxuba bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">a sɛriyɛ sa Isirayila bɔxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">a won benbae yamari e xa na masen e xa die bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />alako di naxee fama tina, nee xa nɔ a kolonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">e fan xa a masen e gbe die bɛ e fama naxee baride.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Na kui e fama e xa lanlanteya sade Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">e mu nɛɛmuma a xa wali xungbee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">e e ɲɔxɔ sama nɛ a xa yaamarie xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />E mu luma alɔ e benbae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">naxee tuli xɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">naxee findi matandilae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">naxee tun mu rabɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">naxee xaxili mu tixi Ala keren na.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Efiramikae xali kanyie naxa e kobe so gere ra,<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />e mu Ala xa saatɛ rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">e mu bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />E naxa nɛɛmu a xa wali magaaxuxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">a nun a xa kaabanakoe ra a naxee masen e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />A kaabanako raba nɛ e benbae ya xɔri Misira, Sowan fiili ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />A naxa baa ibɔɔ, a e ragiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">a ye rati alɔ bilixi.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />A naxa e raɲɛrɛ nuxui saabui ra yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">a naxa e raɲɛrɛ tɛ yanbɛ ra kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />A naxa fanye ibɔɔ gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">a ye gbegbe ramini na kui alɔ dabonyi.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />A naxa ye ramini gɛmɛ longori ra, a lu alɔ xure.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Kɔnɔ e mu gbilen e xa yunubi rabafe fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">e fa Ala matandi gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />E naxa Ala mato donsee maxɔrinfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />E naxa Ala mabere a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">«Ala nɔma won nabalode yi gbengberenyi kui?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />A bara ye ramini fanye kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">kɔnɔ a nɔma taami fan fide e ma?»<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Ala to na mɛ, a naxa xɔnɔ ki fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">a fa tɛ radɛxɛ Yaxuba xa ɲama xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">a fa xɔnɔ Isirayila ɲama ma,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />barima e mu nu laxi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">e mu e xaxili tixi a xa kisi ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Na kui Ala naxa yaamari fi koore naadɛe xa rabi,<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />«mana» xa goro e ma baloe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">naxan findi koore taami ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Birin naxa na sɛnbɛmae xa taami don, e fa wasa na ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Ala naxa foye rafa keli sogetede biri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">a foye rafa a sɛnbɛ ra keli yirefanyi ma,<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />naxan a niya xɔnie xa goro e ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">a gbegbe ra alɔ xube nun baa dɛ mɛyɛnyi.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />A naxa e gbegbe rayolon e yonkinde tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">e xa kiri banxie rabilinyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />E naxa na don han e wasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">Ala nu bara e hayi li.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Kɔnɔ hali e to nu bara donse sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">a mu bu <verse eid="PSA 78:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />Ala xa xɔnɛ man naxa goro e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">a Isirayila sɛnbɛmae nun e fonike faxa.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Hali na birin to raba, ɲama mu tin gbilende e xa yunubie fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">E mu la Ala xa kaabanakoe ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Na kui a naxa e lu e xa fuyante kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">han e xa fe naxa raɲɔn gaaxui kui.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Fo faxɛ na dutun e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">e fa so Ala fenfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">e e yɛtɛ ragbilen a ma,<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />e e ratu a Ala nan e sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">a Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi nan e rakisima ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Kɔnɔ e nu wama a madaxufe e xa wɔyɛnyie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">e wule fala a bɛ e dɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />A xa fe mu nu na e bɔɲɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">e mu nu birama a xa saatɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Kɔnɔ Ala to findi hinnɛnte ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">a naxa e xa yunubie xafari, a e ɲaxankatafe lu naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">A naxa diɲɛ e ma sanya wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">a mu tin a xa xɔnɛ birin xa mini.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />A nu a kolon a bɛndɛ nan tun lanxi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">e ɲɛngi na dan, a mu gbilen sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Sanmaya yeri e murutama a ma gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">sanmaya yeri e a raxɔnɔma na yire maxare ma?<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />E nu luma Ala mato ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">e nu ti Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ kanke.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />E mu e ratu a sɛnbɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">E nɛɛmu a ma a e rakisi e gerefae ma tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />E nɛɛmu a xa tɔnxumae ma a naxee masen Misira bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">E nɛɛmu a xa kaabanakoe ma a naxee raba Sowan fiili ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />A naxa e xa Nili xure nun a salonyie findi wuli ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">han e mu nɔ na ye minde.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />A naxa xɛɛrie radin e ma e halakife ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">A naxa lanxansarimae malan mɛnni e kasarafe ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />A naxa tugumie radin e xa xɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">katoe naxa xɛ bogi don gbiki.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />A naxa e xa wɛni sansie kana balabalanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">a naxa e xa sikomoro bilie tuxunsan tunɛ xinbeli ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Balabalanyi naxa e xa xurusee faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">galanyi naxa e xa gɔɔrɛe sɔntɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />A naxa a xa xɔnɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ ramini e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">a bɔɲɛ naxa te e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">han a naxa malekɛ kasaratie ragoro e xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />A naxa a xa xɔnɛ fulun e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">a mu e nii ratanga faxɛ ma, a fe xɔrɔxɔɛe radin e ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />A naxa Misira di singe birin faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">e Hami bɔnsɔɛe fonike birin faxa.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Na nan a ra a naxa a xa ɲama ramini alɔ yɛxɛɛ gɔɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">a naxa e raɲɛrɛ alɔ xurusee gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />A naxa e xanin bɔɲɛsa kui gaaxui yo mu e sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">kɔnɔ a naxa e yaxuie madula baa ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Na ki, a naxa e xanin a xa bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">a xa geya a naxan sɔtɔ a sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />A naxa bɔnsɔɛe keri e ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">a fa na bɔxie itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma kɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">a mɛnni findi e sabatide ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Kɔnɔ e man naxa geregiri Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">e tondi a xa yaamarie rabatude.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />E naxa e makuya Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">e findi yanfante ra alɔ e benbae a rabaxi ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">e lu alɔ xali kanaxi.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />E naxa a raxɔnɔ e xa kuye batudee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">e a ratɔɔnɛ e xa wuri masolixie ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Ala to na fe mɛ, a naxa xɔnɔ ki fanyi, a Isirayila rabolo.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />A naxa a xa lingira rabɛɲin Silo, a nu naxan tixi mixie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />A naxa a xa saatɛ kankira lu yaxui sagoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">e kankan a xa nɔrɛ xa tɔnxuma ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />A to xɔnɔ a xa ɲama Isirayila ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">a naxa a niya e xa sɔntɔ santidɛgɛma ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />E xa fonikee naxa gan tɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">e xa ginɛdimɛdie mu matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ,<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />e xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa faxa santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">e xa kaaɲɛ ginɛe fan mu wa.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Marigi naxa keli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">alɔ mixi naxan kelixi xi xɔli ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">alɔ sɔɔri naxan nɔma a xa siisi ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />A naxa a yaxuie bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">a e lu yaagi kui naxan mu ɲɔnma.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />A naxa Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ rabɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">a tondi Efirami bɔnsɔɛ sugandide.<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />A naxa Yuda bɔnsɔɛ sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">a nun Siyon geya naxan nu rafanxi a ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />A naxa a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira ti alɔ yire itexi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">alɔ a duniɲa tixi ki naxɛ, a xa bu xɔnkuye ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />A naxa a xa konyi Dawuda sugandi, a a tongo gɔɔrɛ ya ma,<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />a nu mɛɛnife yɛxɛɛ ma dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">alako a xa mɛɛni Ala xa ɲama ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">naxan findixi Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ Isirayila ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Dawuda naxa mɛɛni e ma a bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">a e masuxu xaxilimaya ra.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s1">Ala gbeɲɔxɔfe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">Ala, sie bara so i xa bɔxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">e i xa hɔrɔmɔlingira findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">e Darisalamu kana.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />E bara i xa konyie furee findi xɔnie xa baloe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">e bara i xanuntenyie so wulai sube yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />E bara e sɔntɔ Darisalamu rabilinyi, e mu ragata.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Si naxee na muxu rabilinyi e muxu konbima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">e yoma muxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Alatala, i xɔnɔma nɛ muxu ma abadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">I xa tɔɔnɛ danma mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />I xa xɔnɔ ɲamanɛe ma naxee mu i kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">i xa xɔnɔ mangɛyae ma naxee mu i batuma,<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />barima e bara Isirayila xun nakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">e bara a xa lingira rabira.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />I naxa ratu muxu xa yunubi dangixie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">I xa hinnɛ muxu ra mafuren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">barima sɛnbɛ yo mu na muxu bɛ sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Kafu muxu ma, muxu rakisima Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">i xili xa nɔrɛ xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">I xa muxu rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">i xa muxu xa yunubie xafari i xili xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Munfe ra ɲamanɛe a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">«E Marigi Ala na minden?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">E xa a kolon i fama i xa konyie wuli gbeɲɔxɔde muxu ya xɔri.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />I xa i tuli mati geelimanie wa xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">i sɛnbɛ xa nee rakisi naxee xa kiitisae wama e faxafe.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />N Marigi, i xa sare dɔxɔ solofere ragbilen na sie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">naxee bara i bɛxu.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Na kui, muxu tan i xa ɲama fan fama nɛ i batude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">muxu tan i xa xurusee fama nɛ i xa matɔxɔɛ masende muxu bɔnsɔɛ bɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s1">Ala mɛɛnife a xa sansie ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba alɔ bɛɛti naxan xili «Fuge tofanyie alɔ Ala xa saatɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />Isirayila kantama, i i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">i tan naxan Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ raɲɛrɛma alɔ xuruse gɔɔrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">I xa i xa nɔrɛ masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">i tan naxan magoroxi malekɛ masolixie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />I sɛnbɛ ramini Efirami, Bunyamin, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">i xa muxu rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Ala, i xa muxu ragbilen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">i xa hinnɛ muxu ra alako muxu xa kisi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Mangɛ Ala, i tondima i xa ɲama xa maxandi suxude</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">i xa xɔnɛ xa fe ra han mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />I e rabaloma e yaye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">i e yaye fima e ma minse ra han mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />I bara lantareya raso muxu nun muxu dɔxɔbooree tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">e yoma muxu ma.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Mangɛ Ala, i xa muxu ragbilen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">i xa hinnɛ muxu ra alako muxu xa kisi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />I wɛni bili nde tala nɛ Misira naxan findixi i xa ɲama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">I naxa sie ndee keri yire nde, i fa a tan si naa.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />I to na yire yailan a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">a naxa a sankee masɔrɔn, a bɔxi rafe.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Geyae naxa lu a xa niini bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">a salonyie nu xungbo alɔ sɛdiri wurie.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />A salonyie nu kuya ra han e baa nun xure dɛ li.<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Kɔnɔ i tan bara a xa tɛtɛ kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">dangi mixie fa a bogi ba.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Wulai xɔsɛe naa yegelenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">buurunyi subee fan baloma a bogie ra. Munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />Mangɛ Ala yandi, i xa gbilen fa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">i ya ragoro muxu ma keli koore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">i muxu mato, kinikini na wɛni bili ma,<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />i naxan si i yɛtɛ bɛ i bɛlɛxɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Yakɔsi a bara gan, a sɛgɛ i xa xɔnɛ saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />I bɛlɛxɛ xa lu Adama xa Di ma, naxan na i yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">i naxan xun nakelixi.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Muxu mu muxu makuyama i ra sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">I xa kisi fi muxu ma alako muxu man xa i batu.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 80:20" />Mangɛ Ala, i xa muxu ragbilen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:20">i xa hinnɛ muxu ra alako muxu xa kisi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s1">Tuli matife Ala ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba maxase luuti daaxi xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Wo xa sɛɛwa xui rate Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">naxan findixi won sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">Wo wo xui rasiga Yaxuba Marigi Ala ma.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Wo xa bɛɛti ba maxase nun kɔra xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Wo xa feri fe kike nɛɛnɛ te tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">won ma sali lɔxɔɛ na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Na findixi Ala xa sɛriyɛ nan na Isirayila bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">Yaxuba Marigi Ala xa yaamari na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />Yaamari na a ra Ala naxan so Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">a to mini Misira bɔxi xili ma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 81:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">N naxa xui nde mɛ n mu naxan kolon, a naxɛ,<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />«N bara kote ba e xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">n bara debe binye ba e bɛlɛxɛe.<verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Wo to n xili wo xa ɲaxankatɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">n naxa wo rakisi, n naxa wo yaabi kelife sesarinyi yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">n naxa wo mato Meriba ye yire.<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />N ma ɲama Isirayila, wo wo tuli mati n ma marasi ra.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Wo naxa Ala gbɛtɛ batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">wo naxa wo xinbi sin Ala gbɛtɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />N tan nan na wo Marigi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">naxan wo ramini Misira bɔxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Wo wo dɛ rabi a belebele ra, n a rafema nɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />«Kɔnɔ n ma ɲama mu a tuli matixi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">Isirayila mu n xui ratinmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Na kui n naxa e lu e xa bɔɲɛ xɔrɔxɔya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">e xa ɲɛrɛ e yɛtɛ xaxili ma.<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />Xa a sa li nu n ma ɲama naxa a tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">xa Isirayila sa tin n ma kira ra nu,<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />n fama nɛ a yaxui birin nayaagide keren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">n e ragoro tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Alatala yaxuie fama gaaxude a ya ra, e halaki abadan.<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 81:17" />Kɔnɔ n wo tan baloma nɛ donse fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:17">n kumi raminima nɛ gɛmɛ kui wo bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 81:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa kiiti a xa sɛnbɛmae bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">Ala tixi a xa malanyi ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">a kiiti safe koore sɛnbɛmae ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />«Wo kiiti sama kobiɲa ra han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">Wo nɔndi fima mixi ɲaaxie ma munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Wo xa misikiinɛe nun kiridie xa kiiti sa sɛriyɛ ki ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">Wo xa setaree nun fuxarilae ratanga kiiti ɲaaxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Wo xa setaree nun tɔɔrɔmixie rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">Wo xa e ba mixi kobie bɛlɛxɛe i.»<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Kɔnɔ e mu fahaamui sɔtɔ na fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">E e ɲɛrɛma dimi nan kui tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">Duniɲa sanbunyi birin sɛrɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />N a fala nɛ, «Koore sɛnbɛmae nan wo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi xa die nan wo birin na,<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />kɔnɔ wo faxama nɛ alɔ adamadie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">wo birama nɛ alɔ duniɲa mangɛe.»<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />I tan Ala, keli, i xa duniɲa makiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">barima i tan nan gbe na sie birin na.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayila yaxuie</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Asafi xa bɛɛti<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Ee Ala, i naxa i sabari!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">Ala, i naxa lu dundui kui,<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />barima i yaxuie mu e raxaraxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">i xɔnmae bara e xunyie ikeli.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />E na yanfɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ maxirife i xa ɲama xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">e na e boore bɔɲɛ ratefe i xanuntenyie xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />E naxɛ, «Won xa e xili ɲɔn sie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">alako birin xa nɛɛmu Isirayila xili ma.»<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />E bara lan e boore ma i xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Edonkae, Sumayila bɔnsɔɛ, Mowabakae, Hagarikae,<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Gebalakae, Amonikae, Amalɛkikae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">Filisitakae, Tirekae,<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />nun Asiriyakae birin bara kafu Loti bɔnsɔɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />I xa e bɔnbɔ alɔ i a raba Madiyankae ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">I xa e bɔnbɔ alɔ i a raba mangɛ Yabini na ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">a nun a xa sɔɔri mangɛ Sisera ra ki naxɛ Kison xure yire.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />E sɔntɔ nɛ Endori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">e fure naxa lu bɔxi ma, e mu ragata.<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />I xa fe xɔrɔxɔɛ raba e xa kuntigie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">alɔ i raba Orebi nun Seebi ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">E xa yareratie xa lu alɔ Sɛba nun Salamuna, naxee a fala,<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />«Won xa Ala xa ɲama xa bɔxi findi won gbe ra.»<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />N Marigi Ala, i xa na mixie lu alɔ sɛxɛ, foye naxan xaninma.<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />I xa e xun nakana alɔ tɛ fɔtɔnyi ganma ki naxɛ geyae fari.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />I xa bira e fɔxɔ ra xɔnɛ kui alɔ turunnaadɛ magaaxuxi.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Marigi, i xa e rayaagi alako e xa gbilen i ma.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Yaagi nun gaaxui xa lu e bɔɲɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">i xa e bɔnsɔɛ raɲɔn abadan.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 83:19" />E xa a kolon a i tan nan xili Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:19">a Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi na i tan nan na duniɲa xun na.<verse eid="PSA 83:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s1">Sigafe ra salide xungbe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba maxase luuti daaxi xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Mangɛ Alatala, i xa lingira tofan!<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />N wama sofe i xa tɛtɛ kui n bɔɲɛ birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">Na waxɔnyi minima n dɛ i i tan Ala nan bɛ, i tan naxan ɲiɲɛ a ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Hali xɔni xunxurie alɔ turunna nun debelinyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">e tɛɛ sama i xa sɛrɛxɛbade sɛɛti ma e xa die luma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">I tan Alatala Sɛnbɛma, n ma Mangɛ nun n Marigi,<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee sabatixi i xa banxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">E luma i matɔxɔ ra dɛnnaxɛ abadan. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee sɛnbɛ lanxi i tan Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">naxee kira suxuxi sigafe ra salide xungbe.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />E Baka gulunba igirima tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">e ye dulonyie to nɛ, tunɛ ye gbegbe bara naa rafe.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />E keli yire fanyi nde, e siga yire fanyi gbɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">E na birin to nɛ kira xɔn sigafe ra Ala yire</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">e e yɛtɛ masen a bɛ dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />N Marigi Alatala Sɛnbɛma, n ma dubɛ suxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">Yaxuba Marigi Ala, i n ma maxandi ramɛ. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Ala, hinnɛ i xa mixi sugandixi ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">naxan findixi muxu xa wure lefa ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Xi keren nadangife i xa banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">na ɲɔxun dangife xi wulu wulu ra yire gbɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">N lufe i xa banxi dɛ ra, na fan lufe ra tinxintaree xɔnyi,<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />barima Ala Xungbe findixi won ma kantari nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">a hinnɛ nun binyɛ fima nɛ won ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">A mu tondima tinxintaree kide hɛɛri ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 84:13" />Marigi Sɛnbɛma, hɛɛri na mixi bɛ naxan a yɛtɛ taxuma i ra.<verse eid="PSA 84:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa hinnɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Marigi, i xanunteya masenma i xa ɲama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">i Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ xun nakelima.<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />I diɲɛma i xa ɲama xa fe ɲaaxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">i a xa yunubie birin xafarima. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />I i xa xɔnɛ ragbilenma a fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">i diɲɛma a ma.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Ala, i man xa muxu rakisi, i man xa hinnɛ muxu ra.<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />I xɔnɔma nɛ muxu ma abadan?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">Na xɔnɛ mu bama muxu xa yi waxati kui?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />I mu nɔma diɲɛde mu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">i xa ɲama xa kisi, e xa sɛɛwa?<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Alatala, i xa dugutɛgɛɲa masen muxu bɛ, i xa muxu rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />N nan n tuli matima nɛ n Marigi Ala xa masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">barima a bɔɲɛsa nan fima a xa ɲama tinxinxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">Ala xa e mali gbilenfe ra e xa daxuɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />A kisi yati yati nan fima mixie ma naxee gaaxuma a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">alako a xa nɔrɛ xa sabati won ma bɔxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Dugutɛgɛɲa nun nɔndi na yire keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">Tinxinyi nun bɔɲɛsa ɲɛrɛma kira keren xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Nɔndi kelima lanbanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">tinxinyi kelima koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Alatala hɛri fima nɛ won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">alako won ma bɔxi xa daxamui ramini.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 85:14" />Tinxinyi ɲɛrɛma a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:14">a findi sanyi fɔxi ra kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 85:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s1">N hayi na Ala ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Dawuda xa Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">Marigi, i i tuli mati n na, i xa n yaabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">Misikiinɛ fuxarixi na n na.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />I xa n makanta, i dugutɛgɛ na n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">N Marigi Ala, i xa i xa konyi di rakisi naxan a taxuxi i ra.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Kinikini n ma, n Marigi, barima n i xilima lɔxɔɛ birin.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />I xa sɛɛwɛ fi i xa konyi di ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">n xaxili tixi i tan nan na, n Marigi.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />I tan Marigi, i fan, i kinikini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">i xa dugutɛgɛɲa gbo mixie bɛ naxee birin i xilima.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Marigi, i xa i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra, i xa n ma dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />N i xilima n ma tɔɔrɛ kui, barima i n natinma.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />N Marigi, i maniyɛ mu na alae tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">i xa kaabanakoee dangi wali birin na.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />I si naxee daa duniɲa ma, nee fama nɛ e xinbi sinde i bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">e i xili matɔxɔ,<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />barima i gbo, i man kaabanakoe rabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">I tan keren peti na nan Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />N Marigi, i xa i xa kira masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">n xa n ɲɛrɛ i xa nɔndi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">Bɔɲɛ fanyi fi n ma, alako n xa gaaxu i xili ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />N i matɔxɔma n bɔɲɛ fiixɛ birin na, n Marigi Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">N i xili matɔxɔma nɛ abadan,<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />barima i xa hinnɛ tilin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">I bara n nii ratanga faxɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Ee Ala, yɛtɛ igboe ndee bara keli n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">gbalotɔɛe wama n faxafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">E mu i kolon feo.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Kɔnɔ n Marigi, i tan nan findixi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">naxan kinikinima, naxan hinnɛma ibunadama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">naxan bɔɲɛ mu tema mafuren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">naxan mu taganma dugutɛgɛɲa nun xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />I xa i ya rafindi n ma, i xa hinnɛ n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">I xa sɛnbɛ fi i xa konyi di ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">i xa i xa konyi ginɛ xa di rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Tɔnxuma nde ramini n bɛ seede ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">alako naxee n xɔnxi, e xa a to, e xa yaagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">i xa mali nun i xa madundui xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s1">Barife Siyoni</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:1">Alatala xa taa tixi geya sɛniyɛnxie fari.<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Siyoni naadɛe rafan Marigi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">dangi Yaxuba xa lingira birin na.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Mixie Ala xa taa matɔxɔma a fanyi ra <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />«N xa a fala Raxabi nun Babilɔn n kolonma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">a nun Filisita, Tire, nun Kusi.<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />A falaxi Siyonikae xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">‹E to barixi naa, Marigi Ala e makantama nɛ.›»<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Alatala bara a sɛbɛ sie xa buki kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">«Yi tan barixi naa.» <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Bɛɛtibae a falama e xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">«N ma saabui birin na i tan nɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s1">Saya kira</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Kora xa die xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ. A xa ba xule ra. Heman Esiraka xa lɔnni bɛɛti.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Marigi, n nakisima Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">n i xilima yanyi nun kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />I xa n ma maxandi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">i xa n ma dubɛ tongo.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />N bara tɔɔrɔ n ma duniɲɛigiri kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">yakɔsi n bara makɔrɛ saya ra.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />N na mixie ya ma naxee na saya kira xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">N sɛnbɛ yo mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />A luxi nɛ alɔ n ɲan saxi furee tagi gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">i mu ratuxi naxee xa fe ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">naxee bara makuya i xa hinnɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />I bara n na so yili tilinxi kui dimi xɔɔra.<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />I xa xɔnɛ bara dutun n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">a n makoto alɔ baa mɔrɔnyi mixi makotoma ki naxɛ. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />I bara n dɛfanbooree makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">i bara e bɔɲɛe raɲaaxu e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">N luma banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">n mu minima fefe ma.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />N Marigi, n i xilima lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ yaye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">n na n bɛlɛxɛe tixi i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />I kaabanakoe rabama mixi faxaxie nan bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">E nɔma kelide, e i matɔxɔ?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />I xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe falama gaburi kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">I xa xanunteya masenma naa?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />I xa kaabanako toma aligiyama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">I xa tinxinyi kolonma yire dɛnnaxɛ xa fe bara nɛɛmu mixi ra?<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />N Marigi, n tan i xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">gɛɛsɛgɛ yo gɛɛsɛgɛ n i maxandima.<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Marigi, i tondima n bɛ munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">I i kobe soma n na munfe ra?<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />N na tɔɔrɛ kui kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">N gaaxuxi, xaxilisa birin bara ba n yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />I xa xɔnɛ sɛnbɛ bara dangi a i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">i xa fe magaaxuxie bara nɔ n na.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />E n nabilinxi alɔ banbaranyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">e dusu n xun na.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 88:19" />I bara n xanuntenyie birin makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:19">n dɔxɔboore bara keli n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 88:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa saatɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Etani Esiraka xa lɔnni bɛɛti<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />N bɛɛti bama n Marigi xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">N na masenma nɛ bɔnsɔɛ birin bɛ, a falafe ra,<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />«I xa dugutɛgɛɲa mabanbanxi koore ma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">I xa hinnɛ mu kanama.»<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />«N bara saatɛ xiri n nun n ma mixi sugandixi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">n bara yi kɛrɛ tongo n ma konyi di Dawuda bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />‹N i bɔnsɔɛ rasabatima nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">n i xa kibanyi ti tɛmui birin.›» <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />N Marigi, naxee na koore ma e i matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">malekɛe i tantuma i xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Nde na koore ma naxan maniyama Marigi Ala ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">Nde luxi alɔ Marigi Ala malekɛe ya ma?<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Ala magaaxu a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe xa malanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">e birin e magoro a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Marigi Ala, nde sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ i tan Mangɛ Ala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">I xa dugutɛgɛɲa na yire birin.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />I tan nan baa yamarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">i a mɔrɔnyie raxara.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />I tan nan nɔ Misira ra, i a sɔntɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">I i yaxuie rayensen i sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />I tan nan gbe koore ra, i tan nan gbe bɔxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">I tan nan duniɲa birin daa.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Se naxan na kɔɔla ma, se naxan na yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">i tan nan a birin daaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">Taboro nun Xerimon geyae i xili matɔxɔma.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />I sɛnbɛ gbo.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Tinxinyi nun nɔndi nan na i xa kibanyi sanbunyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">xanunteya nun dugutɛgɛɲa fan tixi i ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Marigi, sɛɛwɛ na ɲama bɛ naxan i xili matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">e e ɲɛrɛma i xa naiyalanyi nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />E sɛɛwama i xili xa fe ra, e xun nakelima i xa tinxinyi saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />I tan nan findixi e xa naiyalanyi nun e sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">Muxu sɛnbɛ gbo i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Muxu Marigi nan na muxu kantama nun muxu xa mangɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />I wɔyɛn nɛ i xa ɲama bɛ laamatunyi ra, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">«N bara sɛnbɛ fi geresoe nde ma, n naxan xun nakelixi ɲama tagi.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />N bara n ma konyi Dawuda to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">n ture sɛniyɛnxi surusuru a xunyi ma sugandi ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />N na n bɛlɛxɛ rasoma a bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">n sɛnbɛ fima nɛ a ma a fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />A yaxui mu a tɛrɛnnama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">tinxintare mu a tɔɔrɔma.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />N a yaxuie ibutuxunma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">n a xɔnmae bɔnbɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />N xanunteya nun n ma dugutɛgɛɲa luma nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">a sɛnbɛ gboma n xili nan saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Baae nun xuree birin sama nɛ a xa mangɛya bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />A a falama nɛ n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">‹N Baba nan i ra, n Marigi Ala, n ma marakisima.›<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />N a findima nɛ n ma di singe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">naxan xungbo duniɲa mangɛe birin bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />N na n ma dugutɛgɛɲa mabanbanma nɛ a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">muxu saatɛ naxan xirixi, a mu kanama abadan.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />N a bɔnsɔɛ rasabatima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">n a xa mangɛ kibanyi mabanbanma nɛ fanni koore na.<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />A xa die na n ma sɛriyɛ rabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">e mu e ɲɛrɛ n ma yaamari bun ma,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />e n xui matandi, e mu n waxɔnfe suxu,<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />n e bɔnbɔma luxusinyi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">n e ɲaxankatama fure ɲaaxie ra.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Kɔnɔ n mu n ma dugutɛgɛɲa bama a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">N mu n xui yanfama,<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />n mu n ma saatɛ kanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">n man mu n xui masarama.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />N na n kalixi n ma sɛniyɛnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">n mu Annabi Dawuda yanfama.<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />A bɔnsɔɛ kisima nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">a xa kibanyi luma nɛ n ya i alɔ soge,<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />a rasabatima nɛ alɔ kike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">naxan findima seedeɲɔxɔya ra abadan.» <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Kɔnɔ i tan bara i xa mixi sugandixi makuya i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">i bara mɛɛ a ra, i xɔnɔ a ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />I bara i xa saatɛ kana i xa konyi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">i a ba a xa kibanyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />I bara a xa tɛtɛ bɔɔ, i bara a makantade kana.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Mixi naxee dangima, e harige bama naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">A dɔxɔbooree yoma a ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />I bara a yaxuie sɛnbɛ so, han e bara sɛɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />I mu a xa santidɛgɛma wali rasɔɔnɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">i mu a malixi gere kui.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />I bara a xa fe raxuben,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">i bara a xa kibanyi woli bɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />I bara nde ba a xa fonikeya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">i yaagi dusu a xun na. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Alatala, i i nɔxunma n ma han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">I xa xɔnɛ dɛxɛma alɔ tɛ han mun lɔxɔɛ?<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />I xa ratu a ma n ma simaya dunke ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">I ibunadama daaxi fuyan nan na?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Nde baloxi naxan mu faxama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">Nde nɔma a yɛtɛ bade saya kira xɔn ma?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />N Marigi, i xa dugutɛgɛɲa singe na minden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">i i kali naxan na Dawuda bɛ i xa tinxinyi kui?<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />N Marigi, i xa i ɲɔxɔ sa i xa konyie xa yaagi xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">I xa na kote to mixi wuyaxie naxan dɔxɔ n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />N Marigi, i xa i ratu a ma i yaxuie n maberema ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">n tan i xa mixi sugandixi.<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 89:53" />Tantui na Marigi bɛ abadan. Amina. Amina.<verse eid="PSA 89:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="s1">Adama birin faxama nɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Ala xa mixi Munsa xa Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">N Marigi, i tan findixi muxu kantama nan na abadan.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Beenun geyae nun duniɲa xa daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">i tan nan nu na Ala ra abadan.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />I ibunadama ragbilenma bɛndɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">I na nan fala, «Adamadi xa gbilen bɛndɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Ɲɛ wulu keren luxi nɛ i bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">alɔ lɔxɔ keren naxan bara dangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">alɔ waxati keren naxan bara dangi kɔɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />I a niya adamadi mu keli a xa xixɔli ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">A luxi alɔ ɲooge naxan minima a yɛtɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />A keli subaxɛ ma, a fuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">nunmare tɛmui a ɲan bara lisi, a xara.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />I xa xɔnɛ muxu ɲɔnma nɛ, a muxu magaaxu.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />I muxu xa yunubi birin kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">hali muxu xa fe ɲaaxi naxee findixi gundo ra.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Muxu xa simaya birin luma i xa xɔnɛ bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">Muxu xa duniɲɛigiri xa bui birin, ɲɛngi rate keren.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Muxu xa simaya buma ɲɛ tongo solofere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ɲɛ tongo solomasaxan xa a sɔɔnɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">kɔnɔ na birin findixi tɔɔrɛ nun ɲaxankatɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">Simaya dangima nɛ mafuren mafuren, a muxu lu dimi kui.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Nde i xa xɔnɛ sɛnbɛ kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Nde gaaxuma na ya ra?<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />A muxu ratu simaya raɲɔnyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">alako muxu xa xaxili sɔtɔ muxu xa duniɲɛigiri kui.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />N Marigi, i xa i ya rafindi muxu ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">I xa xɔnɛ buma han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Kinikini i xa konyi die ma.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Kuye na iba, i xa muxu rawasa i xa dugutɛgɛɲa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">alako muxu xa sɛɛwa muxu xa simaya birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />I tɔɔrɛ xasabi naxan dɔxɔ muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">i yaagi xasabi naxan sa muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">i man xa muxu rasɛɛwa na xasabi ra.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />I xa i xa kaabanakoe masen muxu bɛ, i xa konyie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">I xa nɔrɛ xa mini muxu xa die ma.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Muxu Marigi Ala xa tofanyi xa lu muxu ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">A xa muxu xa wali sɔɔnɛya, a xa baraka sa muxu xa wali ma!<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s1">Gaaxutareɲa</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Naxan luma Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi xa kantari bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">a a malabuma nɛ Ala xa kantɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />N na a masenma Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">«I tan nan na n ma kantari nun n makantade ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">i tan n Marigi Ala, n laxi naxan na.»<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />A tan nan i ratangama gantanyie ma naxee tema i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">a i ratanga wuganyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />A i makantama nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">alɔ tɔxɔɛ a xa die makantama ki naxɛ a gabutenyi bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">A xa dugutɛgɛɲa luma nɛ alɔ sɔɔri xa wure lefa.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />I mu gaaxuma gbaloe ra kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">i mu gaaxuma xalie ra yanyi ra,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />i mu gaaxuma wuganyi ra dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">i mu gaaxuma fure ɲaaxi ra soge bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Mixi wulu nɔma nɛ birade i kɔɔla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">mixi wulu fu nɔma birade i yirefanyi ma, kɔnɔ sese mu i toma.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />I na birin toma nɛ i ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">i findi seede ra tinxintare xa ɲaxankatɛ ma,<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />barima i bara la i Marigi ra, a bara findi i xa kantari ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">Ala Xili Xungbe kanyi findixi i xa makantade nan na.<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />Sese mu i lima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">wuganyi yo mu soma i xɔnyi,<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />barima a a xa malekɛe yamarima e xa i makanta yire birin.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />E i tongoma nɛ e bɛlɛxɛe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">alako i naxa i sanyi radin gɛmɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />I nɔma yɛtɛe nun bɔximasee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">i sɛnbɛ dangi baratɛe nun biidae ra.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">«A to laxi n na, n a rakisima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">N a makantama nɛ barima a n xili kolon.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />A na n xili, n a yaabima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">Tɔɔrɛ na a li, n luma nɛ a sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">N a rakisima nɛ, n a xun nakeli.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />N simaya xɔnkuye fima nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">n na n ma kisi masen a bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s1">Simaya kamalixi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Bɛɛti naxan bama malabui lɔxɔɛ<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />Marigi batufe fe fanyi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi, a lanma i xili xa matɔxɔ bɛɛti ra.<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />Kuye iba, a lanma i xa xanunteya xa matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">kɔɛ kui, muxu xa i tantu i xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Matɔxɔɛ xa ba kɔra luuti fu daaxi xui ra nun adamadi xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Marigi, n ɲɛlɛxinma i xa kaabanakoe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">n nan n sɛɛwɛ xui itema i xa wali xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Marigi, i naxan nabama, a makaaba, i xaxili tilin.<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />Xaxilitare mu sese kolonma na kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">a mu fahaamui sɔtɔma i xa fe ma.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Ala kolontaree luma alɔ sansi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">naxan bulama fiili ma, a fuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">kɔnɔ na dangi xanbi, a ɲɔn abadan.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Kɔnɔ i tan Marigi, matɔxɔɛ na i bɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />N Marigi, i yaxuie halakima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">i fe kobi rabae birin nayensen yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />I sɛnbɛ fima nɛ n ma alɔ sɛxɛ ninge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">i ture fanyi sa n ma.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />N yae a toma n gerefae xun goroma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">n tuli e gi xui mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />Tinxintɔɛe xa fe fanma nɛ alɔ tugi bili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">e xa fe te alɔ sɛdiri wuri bili naxee na Liban.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />E sabatixi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">e xa fe fanma nɛ won Marigi Ala ya i.<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Hali e forixi e xunsɛxɛ fiixɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">sɛnbɛ na e bɛ fe fanyi rabafe ra,<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 92:16" />alako e xa a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:16">«Alatala tinxin, n tixi a xa sɛriyɛ nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:16">tinxintareya yo mu na a ma.»<verse eid="PSA 92:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s1">Mangɛ Ala</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Marigi Alatala nan na mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Xunnakeli na a yi, a sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">A xa duniɲa xanxi, a mu sɛrɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />I xa mangɛya fɔlɛ mu na, a dan mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">I tan nan na Ala ra abadan.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Marigi, baa mɔrɔnyi rawunduma alɔ galanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">galanyi naxan goroma, a bula.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />I sɛnbɛ gbo na xui bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">i xa xunnakeli dangi baa mɔrɔnyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">Marigi sɛnbɛ gbo koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />I xa sɛriyɛ xanxi, sɛniyɛntɔɛ nan lanxi i ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />N Marigi Ala naxan a gbeɲɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">i xa i makɛnɛn i xa nɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />I tan naxan duniɲa kiiti sama, i xa keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">i xa yɛtɛ igboe xa walie ragbilen e ma.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />N Marigi, a lanma mixi kobie xun xa rakeli han mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />A lanma mixi ɲaaxie xa e yɛtɛ matɔxɔ tun e xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kui?<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Alatala, e i xa ɲama tɔɔrɔma, e i xa mixie halakima.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />E kaaɲɛ ginɛe nun xɔɲɛ faxama, e kiridie nii bama.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />E nu fa a fala, «Alatala mu yi fee toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Yaxuba Marigi Ala mu yi rakɔrɔsima.»<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Wo tan xaxilitaree, naxee luma ɲama tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">wo xaxili sɔtɔma mun tɛmui?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Naxan tuli daaxi, na luma a mu fe mɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Naxan ya daaxi, na luma a mu se to?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Naxan ɲamanɛe xuruma, na mu e ɲaxankatama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">A tan nan xaxili fima ibunadama ma.<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Alatala a kolon a adamadie xa maɲɔxunyie na nɛ fufafu.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Alatala, Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ i naxan matinxinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">i naxan matinxinma i xa sɛriyɛ ra,<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />alako a xaxili xa sa tɔɔrɛ lɔxɔɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">han mixi ɲaaxie e gbe ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔma tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Alatala mu a xa ɲama raboloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">a mu a xa mixie rabɛɲinma.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Kiiti tinxinxi fama nɛ sade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">tinxintɔɛe bɔɲɛ birama nɛ na fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Nde n xun mafalama mixi ɲaaxie xɔn ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Nde tima n bɛ mixi kobie xili ma?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Xa n Marigi mu findi n malima ra nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">n ma fe danma nɛ gaburi kui nu.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />N Marigi, n na maɲɔxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">a n sanyi mu tima sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">i xa dugutɛgɛɲa n dɛmɛnma.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />N ma kɔntɔfilie na wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">i e bama n ma, i fa n nasɛɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />I nɔma tinde mangɛya tinxintare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">naxan yaamari tima fe kobi ra?<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />E kafuma e bore ma tinxintɔɛ faxafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">e mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛ kiiti kui.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Kɔnɔ Marigi nan na n kantama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">a luma alɔ fanye n sabatima naxan fari.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />A e xa wali kobie ragbilenma nɛ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">a e xun nakana e xa ɲaaxuɲa ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Muxu Marigi Ala e sɔntɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s1">Mangɛ Ala matofe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Won xa bɛɛti ba Marigi bɛ sɛɛwɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">won xa won xui ite won nakisima sɛnbɛma bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Won xa a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">won xa a matɔxɔɛ ba a bɛ bɛɛtie ra,<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />barima Alatala, Ala xungbe na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">naxan findixi mangɛ xungbe ra sɛnbɛmae birin xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Yire tilinxi na a bɛlɛxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">Geya xuntagie findixi a gbe nan na,<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />alɔ baa nun bɔxi a naxee daaxi a bɛlɛxɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Wo fa, won xa suyidi, won xa won igoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">won xa won xinbi sin Alatala ya i naxan won daa,<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />barima a tan nan won Marigi Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Won findixi a xa ɲama nan na a naxan dɛmadonma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi mɛɛnima gɔɔrɛ ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Wo xa a xui mɛ to.<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />Wo naxa wo bɔɲɛe raxɔrɔxɔ alɔ naxan nabaxi Meriba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">alɔ naxan nabaxi Masa gbengberenyi ma tɛmui dangixi.<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />Wo benbae n mato nɛ na lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">hali e to nu bara n wali fɔxi to.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Na bɔnsɔɛ xa fe naxa raɲaaxu n ma ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">N naxa a fala, «Ɲama xurutare nan yi ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">naxan mu n waxɔnfe kolon.»<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Na kui n naxa n kali n ma xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">«E mu soma n ma malabude kui fefe ma!»<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s1">Kiitisa na fafe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Wo bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ nde ba Alatala bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Duniɲa birin xa bɛɛti ba Alatala bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Wo bɛɛti ba Marigi bɛ, wo a xili matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">Wo xa a xa kisi masen mixie bɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Wo xa a xa nɔrɛ fala si birin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">wo a xa kaabanakoe masen ɲama birin tagi.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Marigi Ala gbo, a lanma won xa a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">naxan dangi sɛnbɛmae birin na.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Sie birama ala naxee fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">e findixi kuyee fufafu gbansan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">kɔnɔ Alatala nan koore daa.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Nɔrɛ nun naiyalanyi kelima a tan nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">sɛnbɛ nun naiyalanyi luma nɛ a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Bɔnsɔɛ birin, wo xa tantui rasiga Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">wo Alatala matɔxɔ a xunnakeli nun a xa sɛnbɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Wo xa a xili binya alɔ a lanma wo xa a raba ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">Wo xa fa hadiya ra, wo xa a raso a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Wo xa suyidi Marigi bɛ a xa nɔrɛ ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">Duniɲa birin xa sɛrɛn a ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Wo xa a fala si birin bɛ, «Alatala nan na Mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Duniɲa xanxi, a mu a imaxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Ala ɲamae makiitima tinxinyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Koore xa sɛɛwa, bɔxi xa ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">Baa nun a kui isee xa wundu sɛɛwɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Xɛe nun e xa bogi see xui xa ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">wondi wuri bilie xa e sɛɛwa xui ite<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />Alatala ya ra naxan fafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">A fafe duniɲa makiitide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">A duniɲa makiitima tinxinyi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">a ɲamae makiiti nɔndi ra.»<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s1">Mangɛ Ala magaaxu</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Alatala nan na mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">Duniɲa xa ɲɛlɛxin, surie xa sɛɛwa.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Nuxui nun kuye ifɔɔrɔxi a rabilinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">A xa kibanyi dɔxɔxi tinxinyi nun nɔndi fari.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Tɛ tixi a ya ra, a a yaxuie birin ganma a rabilinyi.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />A duniɲa iyalanma a xa seyamakɔnyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">duniɲa mixie na a to, e sɛrɛnma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Geyae xunuma duniɲa Marigi Alatala ya ra alɔ kumi dole.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Koore a xa tinxinyi masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">si birin a xa nɔrɛ toma.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Kuye batue fama nɛ yaagide a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">sɛnbɛmae e felenma nɛ a bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Siyonikae na a xui mɛ, e sɛɛwama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">Yudayakae ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ i tan Alatala xa kiiti ra,<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />barima i tan Marigi xun nakelixi sɛnbɛmae birin bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Alatala xanuntenyi xa fe ɲaaxi xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">Alatala a batulae makantama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">a e ba mixi kobie bɛlɛxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Naiyalanyi na tinxintɔɛe nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee bɔɲɛ fiixɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Tinxintɔɛe, wo sɛɛwa Marigi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">wo xa tantui rasiga a xili sɛniyɛnxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ bama Alatala bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">Wo bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ ba Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">barima a bara kaabanakoe raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">a bɛlɛxɛ sɛnbɛma bara xunnakeli sɔtɔ a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Marigi bara a xa kisi masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">a bara a xa tinxinyi sa kɛnɛ ma ɲamanɛe ya i.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />A mu nɛɛmu a xa dugutɛgɛɲa nun a xa xanunteya ma Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Duniɲa birin bara won Marigi Ala xa kisi to.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Duniɲa birin xa Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">e xa bɛɛti ba sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ kɔra xui nun bɛɛti ra,<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />wo xa sarae fe sɛɛwɛ ra wo Mangɛ Alatala ya i.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Baa nun duniɲa xa e xui ramini,<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />xuree xa e bɛlɛxɛe bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">geyae xa e xui ite sɛɛwɛ ra <verse eid="PSA 98:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />Alatala ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">barima a fafe duniɲa makiitide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">A duniɲa makiitima tinxinyi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">a ɲamae makiitima nɔndi ra.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s1">Mangɛ Alatala sɛniyɛn</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Ala dɔxɔxi a xa kibanyi kui kerubimi malekɛe tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">A xa ɲama tixi gaaxui kui, bɔxi na sɛrɛnfe.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Alatala gbo Siyoni, a tixi sie birin xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />E xa i xili xungbe magaaxuxi matɔxɔ a xa sɛniyɛnyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Mangɛ sɛnbɛ xa matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">tinxinyi rafan a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">a kiiti sama nɔndi ra Yaxuba xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Wo Marigi Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">wo wo magoro a bun ma a xa sɛniyɛnyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Munsa nun Haruna nu na a xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Annabi Samuweli nu na mixie ya ma naxee a maxandima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">E to a xili, a naxa e yaabi.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />A to sɛriyɛ nun yaamari masen e bɛ nuxui kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">e naxa a xui suxu.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Muxu Marigi Alatala, i bara e xa maxandi suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">I to Isirayila ɲaxankata e xa yunubi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">i man bara diɲɛ e ma.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">wo xa wo xinbi sin a xa geya sɛniyɛnxi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">barima won Marigi Alatala sɛniyɛn!<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s1">Tantui bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Tantui bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:1">Duniɲa birin xa Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Wo xa Alatala batu sɛɛwɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">Wo xa fa a ya i wo sɛɛwɛ xui itexi ra.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Wo xa a kolon Alatala nan wo Marigi Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">A tan nan won daaxi, won findixi a gbe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">Won findixi a xa ɲama nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">naxan luxi alɔ a xa xuruse gɔɔrɛ a naxan dɛmadonma.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Wo so a xa naadɛe ra a tantufe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">wo so a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui a matɔxɔfe ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">Wo tantui rasiga a ma, wo a xili matɔxɔ,<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />barima Alatala fan, a xa xanunteya buma nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">a xa dugutɛgɛɲa mu ɲɔnma duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari ma.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s1">Dawuda xa natɛe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">N dugutɛgɛɲa nun tinxinyi matɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">N bɛɛti bama i tan nan bɛ Alatala.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />N fe birin nabama lufe ra tinxintɔɛ xa kira xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">I fama n yire mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">N na n ɲɛrɛma nɛ n bɔɲɛ fiixɛxi ra n ma mixie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />N mu n ya tima fe tinxintare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">n mu tinma yanfante xa kira ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">n nun e tan mu lanma fe yo ma.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />N tan nun mixi ɲaaxi tagi kuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">n mu wama yunubi xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />N mixi dɛ balanma nɛ naxan a boore mafalama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">N mu tinma yɛtɛ matɔxɔɛ nun yɛtɛ igboɲa ra.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />N na n ɲɔxɔ sama nɛ yi bɔxi dugutɛgɛe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">alako e xa lu n sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">N wama tinxintɔɛe nan xɔn ma, e xa n mali.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Yanfantee mu luma n ma mixie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">wule falɛe mu tima n ya i.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Gɛɛsɛgɛ birin n mixi kobie sɔntɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">alako na mixi mɔɔli naxa lu Alatala xa taa kui.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s1">Furema xa maxandi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi nun Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Tɔɔrɔmixi naxan Alatala maxandife a xa tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Alatala, i xa n ma maxandi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">i xa i tuli mati n wa xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />I naxa i kobe so n na n ma tɔɔrɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">I xa n ma maxandi suxu mafuren.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />N ma simaya na lɔɛfe alɔ tuuri lɔɛma kuye ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">n xɔrie na ɲɔnfe alɔ yege ganma tɛ ra ki naxɛ,<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />n bɔɲɛ na lisife alɔ sɛxɛ naxan na fiili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">N mu donse donma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />N na wa n xui itexi ra, n xɔrie birin makɛnɛnma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />N bara lu alɔ xundi naxan toma wula i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">alɔ koofole naxan na banxi tonbolonyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />N mu nɔma xide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">N kiroxi alɔ xɔni naxan na kerenyi ma banxi fari.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />N yaxuie yoma n ma lɔxɔɛ birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">e n xili rawalima dankɛ wɔyɛnyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />N dɛ rafexi tɛxube ra alɔ donse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">n yaye silɔnma n ma minse xun ma<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />i xa bɔɲɛte nun i xa xɔnɛ xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">I bara n keri pon!<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />N ma simaya bara lu alɔ niini naxan lɔɛma dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">alɔ sɛxɛ naxan lisima fiili ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Kɔnɔ i tan Alatala luma nɛ i xa kibanyi kui abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">i xili mu lɔɛma duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />I fama nɛ kelide i xa kinikini Siyoni ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">barima a lanxi i xa hinnɛ a ra yi waxati sugandixi ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />A gɛmɛe nun a bɔxi rafan i xa konyi die ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Sie birin fama gaaxude Alatala xili ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">mangɛe birin fama e xinbi sinde i xa nɔrɛ ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Alatala man fama nɛ Siyoni tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">a a yɛtɛ masen a xa nɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />A a ya rafindima nɛ misikiinɛ xa maxandi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">a mu yo a xa dubɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />Na xa sɛbɛ bɔnsɔɛe bɛ naxee fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">alako mixi naxee mu daaxi sinden e xa Alatala matɔxɔ,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />barima a a ya ragoroma won ma kelife a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi itexi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">Alatala bɔxi matoma kelife koore ma,<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />alako a xa geelimanie wa xui ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">a xa mixie ratanga naxee na faxɛ xa kira ma,<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />alako e xa Alatala xili masen Siyoni taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">e xa a matɔxɔ bɛɛti ra Darisalamu,<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />sie na e malan tɛmui naxɛ Alatala batufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />A bara n ma sɛnbɛ ba n yi ra n ma duniɲɛigiri kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">a bara n ma simaya radunke.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />N naxa a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">i naxa n nii ba n ma simaya tagi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">i tan naxan buma abadan,<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />I tan nan duniɲa daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">i tan nan koore itala i xɔnyɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />E tan ɲɔnma nɛ, kɔnɔ i tan buma nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">e birin forima nɛ alɔ sose, kɔnɔ i tan e masarama nɛ alɔ donma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">I e masarama nɛ, alɔ donma naxan nagoroma, a wɔlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Kɔnɔ i tan mu masarama, i mu ɲɔnma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 102:29" />I xa konyie xa die fama nɛ sabatide be,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:29">e bɔnsɔɛ fa bu xaxilisa kui i ya i.»<verse eid="PSA 102:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa marafanyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">N xa Alatala tantu n nii birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">n xa a xili sɛniyɛnxi matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />N xa Alatala tantu n nii birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">n naxa nɛɛmu a xa hinnɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />A tan nan diɲɛma i xa yunubie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">a i xa furee rayalan,<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />a i ratanga faxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">a i rabilin a xa xanunteya nun a xa kinikini ra.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />A hinnɛma i ra i xa duniɲɛigiri kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">alako i man xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ i xa foriɲa kui alɔ sɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Alatala ɲɛrɛma tinxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">a kiiti tinxinxi sama tɔɔrɔmixie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />A bara a xa kira masen Annabi Munsa bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">a a xa kaabanakoee masen Isirayilakae bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Alatala kinikinima mixie ma, a hinnɛ e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">a mu xɔnɔma e ma mafuren mafuren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">a xa xanunteya gbo.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />A mu mixie tɔɔrɔma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">a xa xɔnnanteya mu buma.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />A mu won ɲaxankatama won ma yunubi rabaxi ki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">a mu won ma yunubi sare ragbilenma won ma.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Koore itexi bɔxi xun ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">a xa xanunteya fan gboxi na ki nɛ a yaragaaxuie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Sogetede makuyaxi sogegorode ra ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">a won ma yunubie fan makuyaxi won na na ki nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Babae kinikinima e xa die ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">Alatala fan kinikinima a yaragaaxuie ma na ki nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />barima a a kolon won yailanxi se naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">a ratuxi a ma a bɛndɛ nan won na.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Adamadie xa simaya maniya sansi ra naxan fugama fiili ma,<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />kɔnɔ foye na bɔnbɔ a ra, a xarama nɛ, a lɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Kɔnɔ Alatala a yaragaaxuie xanuma nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">a xa tinxinyi birama nɛ e bɔnsɔɛe fɔxɔ ra,<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />naxee a xa saatɛ binyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">e a xa sɛriyɛ rabatu.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Alatala bara a xa kibanyi dɔxɔ koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">a duniɲa birin yamari.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Wo tan malekɛe, wo xa Alatala tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">wo tan naxee sɛnbɛ gbo, wo tan naxee a rabatuma.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Wo tan sɛnbɛma naxee na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">wo xa Alatala tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">wo tan naxee a waxɔnfe rabama.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Wo tan birin naxee daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">wo xa Alatala tantu yire birin a xa mangɛya bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">N xa Alatala tantu n nii birin na.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala xa daalisee</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />N xa Alatala tantu n nii birin na.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">N Marigi Alatala, i sɛnbɛ gbo, nɔrɛ nun yanbɛ na i ma,<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />a luxi alɔ naiyalanyi yati findixi i xa guba nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">I koore italaxi alɔ dugi xungbe i sabatixi naxan bun ma,<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />i xa konkoe tixi nuxuie fari ye ragataxi dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">I nuxuie findi i xa ɲɛrɛ se ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">i i ɲɛrɛ foye fari.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />I foye xɛɛma i xa masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">i tɛ rasanbama i xa wali rabafe ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Ala duniɲa tixi nɛ alɔ banxi tixi ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">a mu a mamaxama feo.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />A baa dusu nɛ a xun ma alɔ dugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">a geyae xuntagi makoto.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />I to xaaɲɛ ye ma, a a gi i xa galanyi xui ma,<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />geyae nun gulunbae fa lu yire i nu wa dɛnnaxɛ xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />I naaninyi saxi ye bɛ a mu tuganma naxan xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">alako a naxa gbilen din na xare ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />I dulonyie findi xuree ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">naxee susuma geya longorie ra,<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />a ye xɔli ba burunyi subee birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">a ye xɔli ba wulai sofalee ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Xɔnie sabatixi nee fɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">e e xui raminima wuri salonyie kɔn na burɛxɛe longori ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />I geyae bundama ye ra keli koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">bɔxi wasama i xa wali ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />I ɲooge raminima xurusee bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">i sansie rabulama adamadie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">e baloe sɔtɔma naxee ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />I wɛni fima mixie ma, naxan e bɔɲɛ rafanma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">i ture raminima e bɛ, naxan e kiri ratofanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">i e baloma donse ra, naxan sɛnbɛ fima e ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Liban wuri bilie, Marigi naxee sixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">e bara ye sɔtɔ a fanyi ra,<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />xɔnie e tɛɛ sama e kɔn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">Gbongboe e tɛɛ sama sipirɛ wuri bilie kɔn na,<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />wulai sie xima geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">sagalee luma gɛmɛ longorie ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />I kike yailanxi sali waxatie kolonfe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">Soge a dula tɛmui kolon.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />I dimi rafama kɔɛ ra, burun subee ɲɛrɛma tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Yɛtɛe na e xui ramini donse fenfe ra, Ala e kima baloe ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Soge nɛfɛ mini, e gbilen e xa fɔnmɛe ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Mixie tan mini, e sa fɛɛɲɛn walide.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Alatala, i xa daalisee wuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">I e birin daaxi xaxilimaya nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Bɔxi rafexi i xa daalisee ra,<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />baa fan nafexi i xa daalisee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">ndee xurun, ndee xungbo, e wuya.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Kunkui xungbee ɲɛrɛma mɛnni fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">peremui ɲɛrɛma baa bun ma ɲɛlɛxinyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Yi daalise birin e xaxili tixi i tan nan na e baloe xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />I na e ki, e a sɔtɔma nɛ i saabui ra, e wasa.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />I na e kuma, e gaaxuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">I na e ɲɛngi ba, e faxama nɛ, e gbilen bɛndɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />I na i ɲɛngi raso e fate, e man balo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">bɔxi man fa fan.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Alatala xa nɔrɛ xa bu abadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Alatala xa sɛɛwa a xa daalie ra!<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />A na bɔxi mato, a sɛrɛnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">a na din geyae ra, e ganma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />N Alatala matɔxɔma nɛ fanni n baloxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">n bɛɛti bama nɛ n Marigi Ala bɛ fanni n na duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />N ma dubɛ xa rafan a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">N sɛɛwama nɛ Alatala xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Kɔnɔ yunubitɔɛe tan xa lɔɛ duniɲa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Mixi ɲaaxie naxa lu naa sɔnɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">N bara Alatala matɔxɔ n nii birin na. Wo Alatala tantu!<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayila xa xɔrɛya</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Wo Alatala xili matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">wo a xa kaabanakoe masen ɲamae tagi.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Wo bɛɛti ba a bɛ a xa kaabanakoee xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Wo xa sɛɛwa a xili sɛniyɛnxi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">mixi naxee Alatala fenma, e xa ɲɛlɛxin.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Wo xa Alatala xa sɛnbɛ fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">wo xa kata lude a ya i tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Wo xa ratu a xa kaabanakoe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">wo naxa nɛɛmu a xa kiiti ma,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />wo tan Ala xa konyi Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">wo tan Yaxuba xa die a naxee sugandi.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />A tan nan won Marigi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">a kiiti sama duniɲa birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Alatala a ratuma a xa saatɛ ma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">a mu nɛɛmuma a xa laayidi ma abadan,<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />a naxan tongoxi Iburahima nun Isiyaga bɛ marakali ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />A bara na natɛ tongo Yaxuba bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">a bara na saatɛ xiri Isirayila ra,<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />a masenfe ra, «N bara Kanaan bɔxi fi wo ma kɛ ra.»<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Beenu e xa wuya mɛnni,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />e nu na lintanfe tun,<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Ala mu tin mixi yo xa nɔ e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">A naxa a xɔrɔxɔ ɲamanɛ mangɛe bɛ a falafe ra,<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />«Wo naxa n ma ɲama sugandixi tɔɔrɔ de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">wo naxa fe ɲaaxi raba n ma namiɲɔnmɛe ra.»<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Beenu Ala xa kaamɛ ragoro duniɲa ma, a baloe ba duniɲa yi ra,<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />a naxa a xa mixi nde Yusufu rasiga e yara konyiya kui.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />A sanyie nun a kɔnyi nu balanxi yɔlɔnxɔnyi ra,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />han Ala xa laayidi naxa kamali, a nɔndi fi a ma tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Na tɛmui mangɛ xungbe naxa yaamari fi a xa mini geeli kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">a xa fulun.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Mangɛ naxa Yusufu findi a xa banxi xunyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">a a gbe se birin sa a nɔɛ bun ma,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />alako mangɛ xa mixie xa lu a waxɔn ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">bɔxi forie xa xaxili sɔtɔ a saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Na dangi xanbi, Isirayila ɲama Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ naxa fa Misira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">e sabati Hami xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Ala naxa a xa ɲama wuya dangife e yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />A naxa Misirakae bɔɲɛ masara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">han e fa a xa ɲama xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">e natɛ ɲaaxi tongo e xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Na tɛmui a naxa a xa konyi di Munsa xɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">a nun a xa mixi sugandixi Haruna.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />E naxa Ala xa tɔnxumae makaabaxie raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">Hami xa bɔxi xa mixie tagi.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />E to Ala xa masenyi ti Misirakae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">Ala naxa dimi rasin bɔxi ma, kuye naxa ifɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />A naxa mɛnni ye mafindi wuli ra, yɛxɛe fa faxa.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />E xa bɔxi naxa rafe lanxansarimae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">e so han mangɛ xa banxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />A naxa yaamari fi xɛɛrie nun saasie xa din bɔxi birin na.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />A naxa balabalanyi nun tunɛ ragoro bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">seyamakɔnyi naxa din mɛnni ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />A naxa e xa wɛni bilie nun e xa xɔrɛ bilie kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">a nun wuri bilie birin naxee nu na e xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />A naxa yaamari fi katoe xa wuya han,<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />e fa sansie birin kana Misira bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">e bɔxi daxamui birin don.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />A raɲɔnyi a naxa di singe birin faxa e xa bɔxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">e naxee bari e sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Ala naxa a xa ɲama ramini kɔbiri nun xɛɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">mixi yo mu faxa e ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Misirakae naxa sɛɛwa e xa mini ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">barima e nu bara gaaxu Isirayilakae ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Ala naxa nuxui itala e xun ma yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">a tɛ ti koore ma kɔɛ ra naiyalanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />E to a maxandi, a naxa fa kɔnkɔlɛe ra e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">naxan findixi koore baloe ra e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />A naxa fanye rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">a ye ramini e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">alɔ xure naxan ɲɛrɛma gbengberen yire tagi.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Ala to ratu a xa laayidi sɛniyɛnxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">a naxan tongo a xa konyi di Iburahima bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />a naxa a xa ɲama ramini sɛɛwɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">a a ragiri a xa mixi sugandixie xa ɲɛlɛxin bɛɛti ba.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />A naxa si gbɛtɛe xa bɔxi fi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">ɲamanɛe xa naafuli naxa findi e gbe ra,<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />alako e xa Ala xui suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">e xa a xa yaamarie rabatu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s1">Nɛɛmufe Ala xa xanunteya ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">Wo xa a tantu barima a fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">a xa xanunteya buma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Nde Alatala xa wali xungbe masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">nde a xa matɔxɔɛ bama?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Sɛɛwɛ na tinxintɔɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">naxee birama tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra lɔxɔɛ birin.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Alatala, i xa ratu n ma i hinnɛma i xa ɲama ra tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">i na e rakisi, i xa n fan mali,<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />alako n xa i xa mixi sugandixie xa hɛri sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">n xa sɛɛwa i xa ɲama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">n xa ɲɛlɛxin i kɛ tongomae ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Muxu bara yunubi raba alɔ muxu benbae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">muxu bara fe kobie raba ɲaaxuɲa kui.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Muxu benbae to nu na Misira bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">e mu e ɲɔxɔ sa i xa kaabanakoe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">e mu ratu i xa xanunteya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">E naxa e kobe raso i ra Xulunyumi baa fɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Kɔnɔ a naxa e rakisi a xili xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">alako a xa a sɛnbɛ masen.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />A to xaaɲɛ Xulunyumi baa ma, a naxa xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">e naxa a igiri a xaraxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />A naxa e rakisi e xɔnmixie bɛlɛxɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">a e xunsara e yaxuie bɛlɛxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Ye naxa dusu e yaxuie xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">hali mixi keren a mu kisi.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Na kui e naxa la a xa masenyi ra, e a matɔxɔ bɛɛti ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Kɔnɔ a mu bu, e man naxa nɛɛmu a xa walie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">e tondi a waxɔnfe rabade.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />E naxa bira e yɛtɛ waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">e Alatala mato.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />A naxa e waxɔnse so e yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">kɔnɔ na dangi xanbi, a naxa e raɲɔn.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Ala xa ɲama naxa Munsa nun Haruna tɔɔnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">naxee findixi Alatala xa konyi sɛniyɛnxie ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Bɔxi naxa a rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">a Datan nun Abirami xa mixie ragoro a kui.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Tɛ naxa e fɔxirabirɛ ɲaaxie gan.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />E naxa ninge misaali yailan wure ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">e a batu kuye ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Ninge naxan sɛxɛ donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">e naxa na misaali findi e Marigi Alatala ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />E naxa nɛɛmu e Rakisima Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">naxan fe xungbee raba Misira,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />naxan kaabanakoee raba Hami bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">naxan fe magaaxuxie raba Xulunyumi baa ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Ala nu wama e sɔntɔfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">kɔnɔ a xa mixi sugandixi Munsa naxa a maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">a xa a xa xɔnɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ lu na.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />E naxa tondi a xa bɔxi fanyi suxude, e mu la a xa laayidi ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />E naxa ti Alatala kanke e xa kiri banxie kui, e mu a xui suxu.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Na kui a naxa laayidi tongo e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">a xa e faxa gbengberenyi ma,<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />a xa e bɔnsɔɛ faxa ɲamanɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">a xa e rayensen duniɲa ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />E naxa Bali Peyori batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">e sɛrɛxɛ sube don naxan baxi mixi faxaxie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />E naxa Ala raxɔnɔ e xa fe kobie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">han a naxa fure ɲaaxi nde ragoro e ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Finexasi to keli, a naxa Ala maxandi e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">fure ɲaaxi naxa ba e ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Mixi naxa na tinxinyi kolon a bɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Alatala xa ɲama naxa a raxɔnɔ Meriba xure fɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">Annabi Munsa naxa tɔɔrɔ e xa fe ra,<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />a to wɔyɛn xɔrɔxɔɛ fala e xa Ala matandi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />E mu Kanaan sie sɔntɔ alɔ Alatala e yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />E naxa sabati e ya ma, e bira e naamunyie fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />E naxa nee xa kuyee batu, na fa findi gantanyi ra e bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />E naxa e xa di xɛmɛe nun e xa di ginɛ ba sɛrɛxɛ ra ɲinnɛe bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />E to e xa die faxa sɛrɛxɛ ra Kanaan xa kuyee bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">e naxa bɔxi findi bɔxi sɛniyɛntare ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />E e yɛtɛ findi mixi sɛniyɛntare ra na ki nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">e e Marigi yanfa.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Na kui Alatala naxa xɔnɔ a xa ɲama ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">a kɛ tongomae mu rafanxi a ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />A naxa e rabolo si gbɛtɛe yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">e yaxuie naxa e yamari.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />E yaxuie naxa nɔ e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">e fa lu e sɛnbɛ bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Sanya wuyaxi Ala naxa e rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">kɔnɔ e mu gbilen a matandife ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">Na kui e naxa lɔɛ e xa yunubie xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Kɔnɔ Ala naxa e tɔɔrɛ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">a naxa e wa xui mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />A naxa ratu a xa saatɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">a kinikini e ma a xa xanunteya tilinxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />A naxa a niya mixie xa kinikini e ma konyiya kui.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Muxu Marigi Alatala, muxu rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">I xa muxu ramini sie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">alako muxu xa i xili sɛniyɛnxi tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">muxu xa sɛɛwa i matɔxɔfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Tantui na Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ abadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Ɲama birin xa a fala: «Amina!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Wo xa Ala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="s1">Tantui sɛrɛxɛ kisi xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Wo Alatala tantu, barima a fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">a xa xanunteya buma abadan!<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Alatala naxan xun sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">a naxee baxi e yaxuie yi ra,<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />a naxee raminixi sie tagi sogetede nun sogegorode mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">a naxee faxi kelife kɔɔla nun baa mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">e birin xa Alatala tantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Ndee lɔɛxi gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">e mu sabatide yo toxi.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Kaamɛ nun ye xɔli nu e halakima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">limaniya naxa ba e yi.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />E to e dɛ rawa Alatala bɛ e xa tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">a naxa e fulun e xa ɲaxankatɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />A naxa e raɲɛrɛ kira tinxinxi nde xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">alako e xa yire fanyi to e sabatima dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />E xa Alatala tantu a xa xanunteya xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">nun a xa kaabanakoee xa fe ra a naxan nabaxi adamadie bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />barima a ye xɔli bama mixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">a kaamɛtɔɛe rawasama donse fanyie ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Ndee nu sabatixi dimi kui nun faxɛ xa nɔɛ bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">geeli xɔrɔxɔɛ kui, yɔlɔnxɔnyi mabalanxi e ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />Barima e muruta nɛ Ala xa masenyi xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">e Ala xa marasi xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />A naxa e bɔɲɛ mafiixɛ tɔɔrɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">E naxa dagalan yɛ, mixi yo mu e mali.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />E naxa Marigi maxandi nimisɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">a naxa e rakisi e xa ɲaxankatɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />A naxa e ramini dimi kui nun faxɛ xa nɔɛ bunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">a naxa luutie bolon e nu xirixi naxee ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />E xa Marigi batu a xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">nun a xa wali makaabaxie xa fe ra adamadie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Barima a bara wure naadɛe wuru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">a kondonyie kana.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Xaxilitaree nu bara e yɛtɛ suxu e xa murutɛ nun e xa fe ɲaaxie ra, e lu nimisɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Donse birin bara nu raɲaaxu e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">e nu fa na faxɛ nan dɛi.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />E xa na xɔrɔrɔɛ kui, e naxa e xui rate Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">a naxa e rakisi e xa xɔrɔrɔɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />A naxa a xa masenyi rasanba e ma, a e rayalan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">a e ba e xa ɲaxankatɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />E xa Marigi tantu a xa dugutɛgɛɲa nun a xa wali makaabaxie xa fe ra adamadie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />E xa sɛrɛxɛe ba a xa wali fanyie kolon fe ra a bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">E man xa a xa wali fanyie ifala e xui itexi ra sɛɛwɛ kui!<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Naxee nu biyaasima kunkui xungbee kui baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">e man nu yulɛya raba yee xun ma,<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />nee bara Marigi wali fɔxie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">nun a xa wali makaabaxie to baa ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />A naxa masenyi ti, turunnaadɛ foye naxa keli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">a mɔrɔnyie ramaxa,<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />a nu biyaasilae xa kunkui ite a nu a sin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">e nu na ɲaxankatɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />E xun naxa magi a ra e naxa lu alɔ siisilae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">E xa xaxilimaya birin naxa lu e ma fu.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />E xa nimisɛ kui e naxa Marigi xili e xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">a naxa e ratanga na gbaloe ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />A naxa turunnaadɛ foye iti, a a masabari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">mɔrɔnyie naxa e raxara.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />E naxa sɛɛwa nee xa maraxarɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">a naxa e xunti e waxɔnde ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />E xa Marigi tantu a xa dugutɛgɛɲa nun a wali makaabaxie xa fe ra adamadie bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />E xa a xa fe gbo ɲama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">e xa a matɔxɔ Forie xa malanyi!<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />A xure xungbee masarama gbengberenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">a dulonyi findi bɔxi maxare ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />A bɔxi fanyi findima fɔxɔɛ yire ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">na bɔxikae xa fe ɲaaxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />A gbengberenyi findima xure ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">a yire maxare findi xure guli ra,<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />a kaamɛtɔɛe rasabati naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">e taa ti naa e sabatide.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />E xɛ sama, e wuri bilie sima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">naxee bogi barakama.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />A dubama e bɛ, e wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">a mu sese bama e xa xuruse kɔnti ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Ndee gbee xurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">tɔɔrɛ nun ɲaxankatɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />A maraɲaaxui dusuma forie xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">a e ralɔɛ gbengberenyi ma kirae mu dɛnnaxɛ ma,<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />A misikiinɛe bama tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">a e xa denbayae rawuya alɔ xurusee.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Mixi tinxinxie na toma e ɲɛlɛxinma a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">Kɔnɔ tinxintaree birin dɛ balanma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Xaxilima naxan na, a xa a ɲɔxɔ sa yi fe birin xɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">a xa Marigi xa dugutɛgɛɲa fahaamu.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s1">Xunnakeli Ala saabui ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Ala, n bara natɛ tongo n bɔɲɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">N Marigi Xunnakeli Kanyi, n n xui raminima nɛ bɛɛtie ra.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />N n ma kɔrae nun n ma maxasee berema nɛ subaxɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />N Marigi, n i batuma nɛ sie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">n i matɔxɔma nɛ bɛɛti ra ɲamanɛe ya ma,<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />barima i xa dugutɛgɛɲa gbo dangi koore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">i xa xanunteya ite alɔ nuxuie.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Ala, i xunyi rakeli koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">i xa nɔrɛ xa lu bɔxi birin xun ma,<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />alako i xanuntenyie xa kisi i sɛnbɛ saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">Yandi, n ma duba suxu.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Ala bara wɔyɛn a xa lingira sɛniyɛnxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">«N n xun nakelima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">n Sikemi bɔxi itaxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">n Sukɔti gulunba sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />N gbe nan Galadi ra, n gbe nan Manasi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Efirami bɔxi tan luma nɛ alɔ n xun makantase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Yudaya findi n ma munyaati ra.<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />N n sanyi maxama Mowaba bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">n n ma sankiri wolima Edon nan ma a xa findi n gbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">N gere ti xui mɛma nɛ Filisita bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />«Nde n xun tima taa makantaxi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Nde n xaninma Edon bɔxi ma?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Ala mu a ra, naxan muxu rabɛɲinxi gere kui?<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />I xa fa muxu malide, i xa muxu ba muxu yaxuie yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">Adamadie xa mali fufafu na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 108:14" />Won fama won sɛnbɛ raminide Ala xa mali saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:14">A tan nan fama won yaxuie iwurude.»<verse eid="PSA 108:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s1">Tɔɔɲɛgɛla xa maxandi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:1">N Marigi Ala, n naxan matɔxɔma, i naxa lu dundui kui,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />barima mixi ɲaaxie na wule falafe n xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">E dɛ mu fan, e wule fala tun.<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />E na n nabilinfe xɔnnanteya wɔyɛnyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">hali n mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi e ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />N na fe fanyi raba e bɛ, e n gere.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">N a ragbilenma i tan Ala nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />E n ma wali fanyi sare ragbilenma n ma a kobi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">n ma xanunteya, e na masarama n bɛ xɔnnanteya ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />I xa na tɔɔɲɛgɛtɔɛ taxu mixi kobi nde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">a dɛfanboore xa a yanfa.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />A na makiiti, kiiti xa kana a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">I naxa a xa maxandi suxu.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />A xa simaya xa dunke kɔti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">Mixi gbɛtɛ xa a xa wali tongo.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />A xa die xa findi kiridie ra, a xa ginɛ xa findi kaaɲɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />A xa die xa findi ɲɛrɛtie ra naxee kulɛ matima tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">E xa makuya e baride ra naxan bara kana.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Donifa xa a kɛ birin tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">a xa geeni birin xa findi si gbɛtɛe gbe ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Mixi yo naxa kinikini a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">mixi yo naxa hinnɛ a xa kiridie ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />A bɔnsɔɛ xa sɔntɔ, e xilie xa nɛɛmu mixie ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Alatala xa ratu a xa fe kobie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">a nga xa yunubi naxa xafari.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Alatala xa ratu na yunubie ma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">a xa e xa fe ranɛɛmu duniɲa ra,<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />barima e mu dugutɛgɛɲa rakamalima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">e misikiinɛe nun fuxarilae tɔɔrɔma, han e faxa sunnunyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Naxan mixi dankama, na kanyi xa dankɛ sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">Naxan dubama mixie bɛ, a xa barakɛ sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Dankɛ xa ragoro a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">alɔ a donma ragoroma a ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">A xa so a fate i alɔ ye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">a xa so a xɔrie alɔ ture.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />A xa lu a ma alɔ a xa sose luma a ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">a xa bilin a ma alɔ a bɛlɛti bilinma a tagi ki naxɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Alatala xa na sare fi n ma yaxuie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">naxee fe kobi falama n xun ma.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Kɔnɔ i tan n Marigi Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">i xa hinnɛ n na i xili xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">i xa n nakisi i xa dugutɛgɛɲa fanyi saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />N luxi nɛ alɔ misikiinɛ fuxarila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">naxan bɔɲɛ na tɔɔrɔfe ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />N ma fe ɲɔnfe alɔ niini naxan kuyama nunmare ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">Mixi n kerima alɔ katoe kerima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />N xinbie sɛrɛnma, n fate ɲɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">sunyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />E n nayaagima tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">E na n to, e yoma n ma tun.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />N Marigi Ala, i xa n mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">i xa n nakisi i xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />E xa a kolon, i sɛnbɛ na n malife.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />E tan n dankama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">kɔnɔ i barakɛ nan fima n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">Yaagi fama nɛ dusude e xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">kɔnɔ n tan i xa konyi di, n sɛɛwama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />N yaxuie xa ifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">e xa yaagi xa dusu e xun na.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />N Alatala tantuma nɛ n xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">n a matɔxɔma nɛ ɲama ya ma,<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />barima a tixi misikiinɛ sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">a xa e ratanga mixie ma naxee wama e faxafe.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala nan Mangɛ Xungbe dɔxɔma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Alatala xa masenyi n marigi bɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">«I magoro n yifanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">han n xa i sanyi ti i yaxuie fari.»<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Alatala i sɛnbɛ ragboma nɛ kelife Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">han i i yaxuie yamari.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />I xa sɔɔrie luma nɛ i fɔxɔ ra gere kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">Na kuye na iba subaxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">i sɛnbɛ gboma nɛ sɛniyɛnyi kui alɔ i fonike waxati.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Alatala bara a kali yi laayidi ra, naxan mu kanama:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">«N bara i findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">a Melekisedeki daaxi.»<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Marigi luma i yifanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">a mangɛe kanama nɛ a xa xɔnɛ lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />A a xa kiiti raɲɛrɛma nɛ ɲamanɛe fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">a e sɔntɔ, a mangɛ xungbe nde xun nakana.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Mangɛ xure ye minma kira i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">A xun nakelima na nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s1">Ala matɔxɔma fe naxee ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">N Alatala batuma nɛ n bɔɲɛ birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">tinxintɔɛe nun ɲama ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Marigi xa walie makaaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">E rafan mixie ma naxee tinma e matode.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />A xa walie nɔrɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">a xa tinxinyi buma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />A a niya birin xa ratu a xa kaabanakoe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Alatala hinnɛma adamadie ra, a kinikini e ma.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />A baloe fima mixi ma naxan gaaxuma a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">a ratu a xa saatɛ ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />A bara a xa wali sɛnbɛ masen a xa ɲama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe kɛ sofe ra e yi.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />A walima nɔndi nun tinxinyi nan fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">A xa yaamarie findima sɛriyɛ fanyi nan na,<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />naxee mu kanama abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">adamadie lanma e xa naxee rakamali.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />A bara a xa ɲama xun sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">a bara a xa saatɛ mabanban abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">A xili sɛniyɛn, a magaaxu.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Xaxilimaya fɔlɔma Alatala yaragaaxui nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Mixi naxan gaaxuma Ala ya ra, a xaxili fanyi sɔtɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Adamadie lanma e xa a matɔxɔ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s1">Tinxintɔɛ sare</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Wo Marigi Ala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Hɛɛri na mixi bɛ naxan gaaxuma Marigi ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">naxan tinma a xa yaamarie rabatude.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />A bɔnsɔɛ sɛnbɛ gboma nɛ bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">Barakɛ luma tinxintɔɛ nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Naafuli nun bannaya luma a yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">a xa tinxinyi xanxi abadan.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Yanbɛ minima dimi kui tinxintɔɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">naxan kinikinima a boore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">naxan hinnɛma adamadie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">naxan luma ɲɛrɛ ra tinxinyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Barakɛ luma mixi bɛ naxan mixie kima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">naxan tinma mixi donide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">naxan walima tinxinyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Na kanyi mu birama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">mixie mu nɛɛmuma a xa tinxinyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />A mu gaaxuma xibaaru ɲaaxi ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">barima a xaxili tixi Alatala ra, a bɔɲɛ xanxi.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />A bɔɲɛ raxara, gaaxui yo mu a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">A raɲɔnyi, a nɔma nɛ a yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />A misikiinɛ kima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">a ɲɛrɛma tinxinyi kui tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">a xun nakelima tun.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Mixi ɲaaxi tɔɔrɔma na tofe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">a a ɲinyi maxinma, a xa fe xun nakanama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">Mixi ɲaaxie xa natɛ mu kamalima fefe ma.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala maniyɛ mu na</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Alatala xa konyi die, wo xa a matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Wo Alatala xili matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Tantui na Alatala bɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Tantui na Alatala bɛ yire birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">kelife sogetede mabiri, han sogegorode.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Alatala xa nɔɛ na ɲamanɛe xun ma, a xa nɔrɛ na koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Nde maniyɛ won Marigi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">naxan magoroxi a xa kibanyi kui koore ma,<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />naxan a ya ragoroma koore nun bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />A misikiinɛ xun nakelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">a tɔɔrɔmixi bama a xa setareɲa kui.<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />A a tima a xa kuntigie sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />A di gbegbe fima ginɛ dibaritare ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">alako a xa sɛɛwa sɔtɔ a xa die ya ma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayila bɔxi Ala xa ɲama rasɛnɛfe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ naxan findixi Isirayila ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">e naxa mini Misira xa konyiya ra,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />e sabati Yudaya Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira luxi dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Isirayila bɔxi naxa findi Ala xa mangɛya ra.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Xulunyumi baa to Isirayila ɲama to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">a naxa rabi mafuren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">Yurudɛn xure to e to fa ra, a man naxa kira fi e ma.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Isirayila geyae to e to, e naxa tugan tugan ɲɛlɛxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">alɔ yɛxɛɛ kontonyie nun yɛxɛɛ yɔrɛe tuganma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Munse a niyaxi na baa xa rabi mafuren?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Munse a niyaxi Yurudɛn xure kira fixi e ma?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Munse a niyaxi Isirayila geyae xa ɲɛlɛxin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">alɔ yɛxɛɛ kontonyie nun yɛxɛe yɔrɛe?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Duniɲa birin xa sɛrɛn Marigi ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">naxan findi Yaxuba Marigi Ala ra,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />naxan ye dulonyi ramini fanye xɔrɔxɔɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala gbo kuyee bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Matɔxɔɛ mu lanma muxu tan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">matɔxɔɛ lanma Alatala nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">a xa hinnɛ nun dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Munfe ra ɲamanɛe a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">«E xa Ala na minden?»<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Muxu Marigi Ala na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">a a waxɔnfe birin nabama.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Kɔnɔ e xa kuyee yailanxi xɛɛma nun gbeti nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">e yɛtɛ bɛlɛxɛe saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Dɛ na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu wɔyɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">ya na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu se toma,<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />tuli na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu xui mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">ɲɔɛ na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu se xiri mɛma.<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />Bɛlɛxɛ na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu se masuxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">sanyi na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu e ɲɛrɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">Xui yo mu minima e kɔn na!<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />E yailanmae fama nɛ lude alɔ e tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">Mixi naxee e xaxili tima e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">e findima sɛnbɛtaree nan na.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, i xaxili ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">naxan findi i xa dɛmɛri nun i kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Haruna bɔnsɔɛ, i xaxili ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">naxan findi i xa dɛmɛri nun i kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Wo tan naxee findixi Ala yaragaaxuie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">wo wo xaxili ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">naxan findi i xa dɛmɛri nun i kantama ra.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Marigi a ɲɔxɔ saxi won xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">A won barakama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ yo, Haruna bɔnsɔɛ yo,<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />nun Ala yaragaaxuie birin yo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">e barakɛ sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Alatala xa wo tan nun wo xa die yiriwa.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Alatala naxan koore nun bɔxi daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">a xa barakɛ fi wo ma.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Alatala nan gbe koore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">kɔnɔ a naxa duniɲa tan fi adamadie ma.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Mixi faxaxie xa mu Alatala matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">mixi naxee sigama aligiyama e mu nɔma matɔxɔɛ rabade,<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />kɔnɔ won tan naxee na duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">a lanma won xa tantui rasiga Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">fɔlɔ yi tɛmui ma han dan mu naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa kisi faxɛ ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />N Alatala xanuma barima a n xui mɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">A naxa kinikini n wa xui ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />A to a tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">n a maxandima nɛ n ma simaya birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Faxɛ luuti nu bara n xiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">aligiyama tɔɔrɛ nu bara n li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">nimisɛ nun kɔntɔfili nu bara nɔ n na,<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />kɔnɔ na tɛmui n naxa Alatala maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">«Alatala, yandi, n nakisi!»<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Hinnɛnte nan Alatala ra, a tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Won Marigi Ala kinikinima won ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />A mixi magoroxi kantama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">N sɛnbɛ to ɲɔn, a naxa n nakisi.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />N xa n nii raxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">barima Alatala bara fe fanyi raba n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Alatala, i bara n nii ratanga faxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">i yaye ba n ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">i n sanyi sɛnbɛ so,<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />alako n xa ɲɛrɛ i tan Alatala ya ra mixi baloxi ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />N to nu n xaxili tima i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">n naxa a fala i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">«N na tɔɔrɔfe.»<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Limaniya to ba n yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">n naxa a fala, «Wule falɛ nan mixi birin na.»<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Alatala, n i sare fima di, i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />N i xa maratangɛ masenma nɛ ɲama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">Alatala xili matɔxɔfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />N na n ma laayidie rakamalima nɛ Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">a xa ɲama birin ya xɔri.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Alatala a ɲɔxɔ sama nɛ a batulae xa simaya xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />I tan Alatala xa konyi di nan n na, i xa konyi ginɛ xa di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">i naxan nafulunxi saya luuti ra.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />N tantui sɛrɛxɛ bama nɛ i bɛ, n i xili matɔxɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />N na n ma laayidie rakamalima nɛ Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">a xa ɲama birin ya xɔri,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />Alatala xa banxi tɛtɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Darisalamu ɲama ya xɔri.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Wo Marigi matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa xanunteya</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Si birin xa Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">bɔnsɔɛ birin xa a tantu,<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />barima a xa xanunteya gbo won mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">a xa dugutɛgɛɲa mu ɲɔnma abadan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s1">Xaxili tife Alatala ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Wo Alatala tantu barima a fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">a xa xanunteya mu ɲɔnma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Isirayila xa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">«A xa xanunteya mu ɲɔnma abadan!»<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Haruna bɔnsɔɛ xa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">«A xa xanunteya mu ɲɔnma abadan!»<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Ala yaragaaxuie xa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">«A xa xanunteya mu ɲɔnma abadan!»<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />N ma tɔɔrɛ kui, n naxa Alatala maxandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">A naxa n ma duba suxu n fulunfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Alatala na n sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">n mu gaaxuma fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">Adamadi nɔma munse niyade n na?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Alatala na n fɔxɔ ra, a n malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">N fama nɛ nɔde n yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Xaxili tife Alatala ra, na nan fan beenun xaxili tife adamadi ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Yɛtɛ taxufe Alatala ra dangi yɛtɛ taxufe duniɲa mangɛe ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Si birin nu n nabilinxi n gere xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">kɔnɔ Alatala naxa a niya n xa nɔ e ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />E nu n nabilinxi a ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">kɔnɔ n naxa nɔ e ra Alatala xili ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />E naxa din n na alɔ kumi tɔnsɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">kɔnɔ e naxa ɲɔn alɔ sɛxɛ xaraxi ganma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">Alatala nan a niya n xa nɔ e ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />E nu n matutunma sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">a gbe mu nu luxi n xa bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">kɔnɔ Alatala naxa n mali.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Alatala nan na n sɛnbɛ nun n ma sɛɛwɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">A bara n nakisi!<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Sɛɛwɛ nun xunnakeli xui naxa mini tinxintɔɛe xɔnyi a falafe ra,<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />«Alatala naxa wali sɛnbɛ ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">A naxa a mangɛya masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">a kaabanakoe raba.»<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />N mu faxa, n naxa kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">alako n xa Alatala xa kaabanakoe masen ɲama bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Alatala bara n ɲaxankata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">kɔnɔ a mu n luxi n xa faxa.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Wo tinxinyi naadɛe rabi n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">n soma mɛnni Alatala tantufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Alatala xa naadɛ nan yi ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">tinxintɔɛe soma naxan kui.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />N i tantuma nɛ, barima i bara n ma duba suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">i bara findi n nakisima ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Banxitie mɛɛ gɛmɛ naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">na bara findi banxi sangantimɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Na kelixi Marigi nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">Kaabanakoe na a ra won tan bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Lɔxɔɛ nan yi ki Alatala naxan ɲanigexi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">won xa ɲɛlɛxin, won xa sɛɛwa a xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Yandi Alatala, muxu rakisi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">Yandi Alatala, muxu xun nakeli.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Baraka na mixi ma naxan fafe Marigi xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Muxu Alatala matɔxɔma a xa banxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Marigi nan na Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">naxan xa nɔrɛ bara yanba won ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">Wo xa sɛrɛxɛ xiri sɛrɛxɛbade sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />N Marigi Ala nan i ra, n i tantuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">n Marigi Ala nan i ra, n i matɔxɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Wo Alatala tantu barima a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">A xa xanunteya mu ɲɔnma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa sɛriyɛ kerenyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee ɲɛrɛ ki tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">naxee biraxi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixie bɛ naxee Ala xa masenyi mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">naxee a fenma e bɔɲɛ birin na.<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Nee mu tinxintareya rabama fefe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">e birama Ala xa kira nan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />I bara i sago masen muxu bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">alako muxu xa muxu ɲɔxɔ sa a xɔn ma a fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />N wama fe birin nabafe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">alako n xa i xa yaamarie rabatu.<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Na kui n mu fama yaagide i waxɔnfe xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />N na i xa yaamarie kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">n i batuma nɛ n bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />N i xa yaamarie ratinmɛma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">i naxa mɛ n na kerenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Fonike ɲɛrɛma sɛniyɛnyi kui di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">A bira i xa masenyi fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />N i fenma n bɔɲɛ birin nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">I naxa n lu n xa makuya i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />N i xa masenyi ragatama nɛ n bɔɲɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">alako n naxa yunubi raba i ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Matɔxɔɛ na i bɛ Alatala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">I xa yaamarie masen n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />N i xa sɛriyɛ durusima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">i naxan masenxi i kɛrɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />N sɛɛwaxi birafe ra i xa masenyi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">alɔ n na findi banna belebele ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />N n ɲɔxɔ saxi i sago xɔn ma, n i xa kira matoma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />I xa yaamarie rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">n mu nɛɛmuma i xa masenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Fe fanyi raba n tan, i xa konyi di bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">alako n xa kisi, n xa i xa masenyi ratinmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />N ya rabi alako n xa i xa sɛriyɛ fanyi igbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Xɔɲɛ nan lanxi n ma yi duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">i naxa i xa yaamarie nɔxun n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />N hayi na i xa tinxinyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />I i xui ratema yɛtɛ igboe xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">mixi dankaxi naxee i xa yaamarie rabɛɲinma.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />I xa n natanga yaagi nun maraɲaaxui ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">barima n i xa masenyi suxuxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Hali mangɛe n tɔɔɲɛgɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">i xa konyi di a ɲɔxɔ sama nɛ i xa yaamarie nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />I xa masenyi rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">e n nasima a fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />N na tɔɔrɛ xungbe kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">Yandi, i xa n nakisi i xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />N to n ma ɲɛrɛ ki masen i bɛ, i n yaabi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">Yandi, i xa i xa yaamari masen n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />N mali i sago fahaamufe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">alako n xa n ɲɔxɔ sa i xa kaabanakoe xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />N na wafe nimisɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">N xun nakeli alɔ i a laayidixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Wule falafe makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">Hinnɛ n na i xa sɛriyɛ saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />N bara dugutɛgɛɲa kira sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">n bɔɲɛ birama i xa sɛriyɛ nan fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Alatala, n xirixi i xa sɛriyɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">i naxa n lu yaagi kui.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />N na n ɲɛrɛfe i xa yaamarie xa kira nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">barima i bara a niya i waxɔnfe xa lu n bɔɲɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Alatala, n matinxin i xa yaamarie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">alako n xa lu i xa kira xɔn ma n ma simaya birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Xaxili fanyi fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">alako n xa n ɲɔxɔ sa i xa sɛriyɛ xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">n man xa a rabatu n bɔɲɛ birin na<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />N naɲɛrɛ i xa yaamarie xa kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">barima e rafan n ma<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />N bɔɲɛ rafindi i xa masenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">i naxa a rafindi bannaya tinxintareya ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />N yae ba see ra naxee ɲɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">n nakisi i xa kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />I xa laayidi rakamali i xa konyi di bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">i naxan nagataxi i yaragaaxuie ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />N ba yaagi kui n gaaxuxi naxan ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">barima i xa sɛriyɛ fan.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />N wama birafe i xa masenyi fɔxɔ ra a fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">N nakisi i xa tinxinyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Alatala, fa i xa xanunteya nun i xa kisi ra n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">alɔ i a laayidi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Na tɛmui, n nɔma nɛ n maberema yaabide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">barima n tan laxi i xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />I naxa nɔndi masenyi ba n dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">barima n xaxili tixi i xa kiiti ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />N i xa sɛriyɛ rabatuma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />N luma xɔrɛya nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">barima n na i sago nan fenfe.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />N i xa masenyi falama nɛ mangɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">n mu fama lude yaagi kui.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Birafe i xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, na rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />N na n bɛlɛxɛe itema tantui ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">i xa yaamarie xa fe ra, naxee rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">N wama n ɲɔxɔ safe i xa sɛriyɛe xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />I xa ratu i xa masenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">i naxan masen i xa konyi di bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">naxan xaxili sa fima n ma yare.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />N madunduma n ma tɔɔrɛ kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">i xa laayidi nan saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Yɛtɛ igboe n mayelema nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">kɔnɔ n mu i xa sɛriyɛ kira bɛɲinma.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Alatala, n to n natu i xa kiiti tinxinxie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">i naxan saxi tɛmui dangixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">n bɔɲɛ limaniyama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />N bɔɲɛ texi a ɲaaxi ra tinxintaree xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">naxee i xa sɛriyɛ raboloma.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />N sabati dɛdɛ, n bɛɛti bama nɛ i xa yaamarie xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Kɔɛ ra n na n natuma nɛ i xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">Alatala, n fama nɛ i xa sɛriyɛe ratinmɛde.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />N darixi i sago rabatufe nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Alatala, i tide gbo n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">N bara laayidi tongo i xa masenyi rabatufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />N wama lufe i sɛɛti ma n bɔɲɛ birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">Hinnɛ n na alɔ i a masen ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />N to n ɲɛrɛ ki mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">n bara gbilen i xa masenyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />N gbatama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">n mu dugundima i xa yaamarie rabatufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Hali mixi ɲaaxie kankan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">n mu nɛɛmuma i xa sɛriyɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Kɔɛ tagi, n kelima nɛ, n i matɔxɔ i xa kiiti tinxinxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />I yaragaaxui birin findixi n ɲɛrɛboore nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">nun naxee i sago rabatuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Alatala i xa xanunteya na duniɲa birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">n xaran i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Alatala, i bara fe fanyi raba n tan i xa konyi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">alɔ i a laayidixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />N xaran fe tagi rasade nun fe kolonyi ra, barima n laxi i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />N nu bara lɔɛ beemanu i xa n ma fe magoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">kɔnɔ yakɔsi fa n na i xa masenyi nan nabatufe.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />I fan, i fe fanyi rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">n xaran i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Hali yɛtɛ igboe wule sama n xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">n i xa yaamarie rabatuma nɛ n bɔɲɛ birin na.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />E bɔɲɛ xɔrɔxɔ alɔ gɛmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">kɔnɔ i xa sɛriyɛ ɲɔxun n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />N ma tɔɔrɛ bara n mali i xa yaamarie kolonfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />I xa masenyi fan n bɛ xɛɛma nun gbeti ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />I tan nan n daaxi, i tan nan n nafalaxi i xɔnyɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">Fahaamui fi n ma i xa yaamarie kolonfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />I yaragaaxuie xa sɛɛwa n tofe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">barima n xaxili tixi i xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Alatala, n a kolon i xa kiiti tinxinxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">n a kolon i n ma fe magoroxi xanunteya nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Yandi, i xa xanunteya xa n madundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">alɔ i a laayidi n tan, i xa konyi bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />I xa kinikini n ma alako n xa kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">barima i xa sɛriyɛ rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Yɛtɛ igboe xa yaagi sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">barima n mu fe yo rabaxi e ra e n tɔɔrɔma naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">N tan ɲɔxɔ sama i sago nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />I yaragaaxuie xa gbilen n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">a nun naxee i xa masenyi kolon.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />N bɔɲɛ xa i xa yaamarie suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">alako yaagi naxa fa dusu n xun na.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />A xɔli n ma n xa i xa kisi sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">kɔnɔ n xaxili tixi i xa masenyi nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />N i xa laayidi rakamalixi mamɛfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">N a falama n bɔɲɛ kui, «I n madunduma mun tɛmui?»<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />N luxi alɔ kundi naxan na raxarafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">kɔnɔ n mu nɛɛmuma i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />N xa mamɛ ti han mun tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">beenun i xa n yaxuie ɲaxankata?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Yɛtɛ igboe gantanyi tima n ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">Sɛriyɛ mu na ki.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />I xa yaamari birin tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">N natanga tɔɔɲɛgɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />A gbe mu luxi e xa n ma fe kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">kɔnɔ n tondi nɛ i xa yaamarie rabolode.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />N nakisi i xa xanunteya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">alako n xa i xa masenyi suxu.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Alatala, i xa masenyi na koore ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />I xa xanunteya buma nɛ kelife to bɔnsɔɛ ma han bɔnsɔɛ naxee sa fama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">I duniɲa xanxi nan daa.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />I xa sɛriyɛ buma han to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">birin na i xa mangɛya nan bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Xa n mu sɛɛwa i xa sɛriyɛ ra nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">n bara bɔnɔ n ma tɔɔrɛ kui nu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />N mu nɛɛmuma i xa masenyi ra feo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">barima i n kisixi e tan nan saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />N bara n yɛtɛ fi i ma, n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">N tinma i sago suxufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Mixi ɲaaxie wama n faxafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">kɔnɔ n tan ɲɔxɔ saxi i xa masenyi xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />N a kolon duniɲa fe birin ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">kɔnɔ i xa sɛriyɛ mu kanama abadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />I xa sɛriyɛ rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">N na n ɲɔxɔ saxi a xɔn ma kudɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />I xa yaamarie n findima fahaamula nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">dangi n yaxuie ra, barima e na n bɔɲɛ kui tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />N xaxili fan n karamɔxɔe xaxili bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">barima n na n ɲɔxɔ saxi i xa masenyi nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />N fe kolon dangife forie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">barima n i sago rabatuxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />N bara n sanyi ba kira ɲaaxie xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">n xa bira i xa masenyi fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />N mu i xa sɛriyɛ bɛɲin, barima i tan nan yati n xaran na ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />I xa masenyi ɲɔxun n dɛ kui dangi kumi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />N xaxili fanyi sɔtɔ i sago nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">Na kui n bara kira ɲaaxie tan xɔn.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />I xa masenyi findixi lanpui nan na n san tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">a findi naiyalanyi ra n ma kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />N bara laayidi tongo naxan mu kanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">n fama nɛ birade i xa sɛriyɛ tinxinxi fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />N bara tɔɔrɔ a gbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">Alatala, n nakisi i xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Alatala, n bara i maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">i xa n ma matɔxɔɛ suxu sɛrɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">i xa n xaran i sago ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />N nii na faxɛ ya i tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">kɔnɔ n mu nɛɛmuma i xa sɛriyɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Mixi ɲaaxie gantanyi tema n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">kɔnɔ n mu n makuyama i sago ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />I xa masenyi findixi n kɛ nan na abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">a n bɔɲɛ rasɛɛwama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />N bɔɲɛ birama nɛ i xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra abadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />N filankafui xɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">kɔnɔ i xa sɛriyɛ rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />N kantari nun n makantama na i tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">n xaxili tixi i xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Wo wo masiga n na, wo tan mixi kobie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">alako n xa Ala xa yaamarie ratinmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />N dɛmɛn alɔ i a laayidi ki naxɛ, alako n xa kisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">I naxa fe kana n xaxili tixi naxan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />I xa ti n fanga ra, alako n xa kisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">N ya tixi i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />I xa tondi mixie ra naxee e makuyama i xa sɛriyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">barima madaxuɲa nun wule na e xa fe birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />I mixi kobie ɲɔnma nɛ yi duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">alɔ xabui gbeti gbi bama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">Na nan a ra i xa masenyi rafan n ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />N fate sɛrɛnma i xa magaaxui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">n hanmɛxi i xa kiiti ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />N walima nɔndi nun tinxinyi nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">I naxa n lu n yaxuie yi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />I xa n ma fe sɔɔnɛya i sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">I naxa lu yɛtɛ igboe xa nɔ n na.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />N ya tixi i xa kisi ra tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">a nun i xa masenyi tinxinxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Hinnɛ i xa konyi ra i xa xanunteya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">N xaran i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Fahaamui fi n tan, i xa konyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">alako n xa i xa masenyi kui kolon.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Mixie na i xa sɛriyɛ matandife.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">Alatala, a lanma i xa ti e ya ra yakɔsi.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />I xa yaamarie rafanxi n ma dangife xɛɛma fanyi ra,<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />n to a maɲɔxun i sago tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">n kira birin xɔnma nɛ naxan mu findi nɔndi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />I xa masenyi n dɛ ixarama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">n a rabatuma na nan ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />I xa masenyi kui matofe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">a xaxili fima nɛ xaxilitaree ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />A na n nii ra n xa i sago kolon.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />I ya rafindi n ma, i xa hinnɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">alɔ i darixi a raba ra ki naxɛ i xanuntenyie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />I xa n ti i xa masenyi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">i naxa lu fe ɲaaxi yo xa nɔ n na.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />N ba adamadie xa nɔɛ bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">alako n xa i xa yaamarie ratinmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />I yatagi nɔrɛ rayanba i xa konyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">i xa n xaran i xa yaamarie ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />N luma wa ra a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">barima n a kolon mixie mu i xa sɛriyɛ ratinmɛma.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Alatala i tinxin, i xa kiitie fan tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />I xa masenyi tinxin, a man findixi nɔndi yati nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />N bɔɲɛ raɲaaxuma nɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">barima n yaxuie mu e tuli matima i xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />I xa masenyi bara a yɛtɛ xa nɔndi masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">a rafan n tan i xa konyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Hali n xurun, mixie yoma n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">n mu nɛɛmuma i sago ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />I xa tinxinyi buma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">I xa sɛriyɛ nɔndi na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Sunnunyi nun tɔɔrɛ n suxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">kɔnɔ i xa yaamarie nɔxun n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />I xa sɛriyɛe tinxin abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">Fahaamui fi n ma alako n xa kisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Alatala, n na n dɛ rawafe i bɛ n bɔɲɛ birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">N yaabi, alako n xa nɔ i xa yaamarie ratinmɛde.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />N na n dɛ rawafe i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">N nakisi, alako n xa nɔ i sago rabade.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />N kelima beemanu subaxɛ xa a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">n i maxandi i xa n dɛmɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">N xaxili tixi i xa masenyi nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />N mu xima kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">n na n maɲɔxunma i xa masenyi nan tun ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />I i tuli mati n xui ra i xa xanunteya xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">Alatala, n nakisi i xa kiiti bɛrɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Mixie bara maso n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">naxee wama fe ɲaaxie xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">E makuya i xa sɛriyɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Kɔnɔ i tan Alatala, i makɔrɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">i xa yaamarie findixi nɔndi nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />N a kolon kabi a rakuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">i bara i xa masenyi mabanban alako a xa bu abadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />N ma tɔɔrɛ mato, i xa n nakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">barima n mu nɛɛmuxi i xa sɛriyɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />I xa n xun mafala, i xa n xun sara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">N nakisi alɔ i a laayidi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Kisi makuya mixi ɲaaxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">barima e mu birama i xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Alatala, i xa kinikini gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">N nakisi i xa kiiti bɛrɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />N gerefae wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">kɔnɔ n mu gbilen i sago fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />I yanfamae tofe raɲaaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">barima e mu i xa masenyi suxuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />A mato, i xa yaamarie rafan n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">Alatala, n nakisi i xa xanunteya xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />I xa masenyi nɔndi na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">i xa kiiti tinxinxi buma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Mangɛe n tɔɔrɔma hali n mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">kɔnɔ n gaaxuma i xa masenyi ya ra n bɔɲɛ birin na.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />N sɛɛwaxi i xa laayidi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">alɔ mixi naxan geeni xungbe sɔtɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />N wule xɔnxi, a raɲaaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">kɔnɔ i xa sɛriyɛ n xanuntenyi na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />N i matɔxɔma sanmaya solofere lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">i xa kiiti tinxinxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Bɔɲɛsa gbegbe nan na mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">i xa sɛriyɛ rafanxi naxee ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">Fefe mu e rabirama.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Alatala, n xaxili tixi i xa kisi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">n birama nɛ i xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />N i xa masenyi suxuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">barima e rafan n ma ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />N birama nɛ i sago nun i xa masenyi fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">I n ɲɛrɛ ki birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Alatala, i xa n ma duba suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">Fahaamui fi n ma i xa masenyi saabui ra.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />N ma maxandi xa i li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">N nakisi alɔ i a laayidi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />I matɔxɔɛ xa mini n dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">barima i n xaranfe i xa yaamarie nan na.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />N dɛ xa bɛɛti nde ba i xa masenyi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">barima i xa yaamarie birin tinxin.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />I xa fa n dɛmɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">barima n i sago nan sugandixi.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Alatala, n nii na i xa kisi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">i xa sɛriyɛ n nasɛɛwama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />I xa n nakisi alako n xa nɔ i matɔxɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">I xa kiitie xa n dɛmɛn.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />N nabɛɲinxi nɛ alɔ yɛxɛ lɔɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">I xa n tan i xa konyi fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">barima n mu nɛɛmuxi i xa yaamarie ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s1">Ratangafe gere ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">N na Alatala maxandi n ma tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">a n yaabima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Alatala, n natanga wule falɛe dɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">naxee mixie madaxuma.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Mixi madaxui, a fama munse rabade?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />A fama sɔxɔɛ nan tide tanbɛ raluganxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">a fama ganyi tide tɛ wolee ra.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />A xɔrɔxɔ n bɛ lufe ra Meseki bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">a xɔrɔxɔ n bɛ lufe ra Kedari bɔnsɔɛ ya ma.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />N bara bu yi mixie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">naxee bɔɲɛsa xɔnxi.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />N tan na bɔɲɛsa nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">kɔnɔ n nɛfɛ wɔyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">e tan wama gere nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s1">Dɛmɛri kelima Ala ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">N na n ya ratema geyae mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">N ma dɛmɛri kelima minden?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />N ma dɛmɛri fatanma Alatala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">naxan koore nun bɔxi daaxi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />A mu tinma i xa bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">A i kantama, a mu kinsɔnma.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Isirayila kantama mu kinsɔnma, a mu xima.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Alatala nan i kantama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">A findixi niini nan na i bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />alako soge naxa i tɔɔrɔ yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">kike naxa i tɔɔrɔ kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Alatala i ratangama nɛ tɔɔrɛ birin ma, a i nii makantama.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />I na mini, Alatala luma nɛ i sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">I na so, Alatala birama nɛ i fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">A na i sɛɛti ma yakɔsi, a na i sɛɛti ma abadan.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s1">Bɔɲɛsa xa lu Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde Dawuda naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">N bara sɛɛwa n biyaasi booree xa wɔyɛnyi ma, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">«Won xɛɛ Alatala xa banxi!»<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />«Yakɔsi muxu sanyie tixi i tan Darisalamu sode dɛ ra.»<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Darisalamu taa na a ra naxan tixi lanyi kui.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Alatala xa mixie tema nɛ naa e bɔnsɔɛ ki ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">alako e xa Alatala xili matɔxɔ alɔ a yamarixi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Kiitisa xa kibanyie dɔxɔxi mɛnni nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ xa mangɛ kibanyie.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Wo bɔɲɛsa maxandi Darisalamu bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">«Ala xa i xanuntenyie ratanga fe xɔrɔxɔɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Ala xa a niya bɔɲɛsa xa lu i xa tɛtɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">Ala xa i ratanga gere ma.»<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />N ngaxakerenyie nun n xanuntenyie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">n a falama nɛ, «Bɔɲɛsa xa lu wo bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />N i xa hɛɛri fenma nɛ won Marigi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira xa fe ra.»<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa konyie</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">N na n ya ratema i tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">i tan naxan ma kibanyi na koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Muxu yae tixi muxu Marigi Alatala nan na a xa kinikini xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">alɔ konyie yae tixi e marigi ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Alatala, kinikini muxu ma, barima ɲama bara yo muxu ma,<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />yɛtɛ igboe bara muxu mabere.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa maratangɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde Dawuda naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Isirayila ɲama xa a fala:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Xa Alatala mu lu won sɛɛti ma nu,<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />xa Alatala mu won mali gere kui nu,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />na gerefae bara won xun nakana e xa xɔnɛ ra nu,<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />alɔ banbaranyi dinma xure ma ki naxɛ,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />a fa mixie madula ye xɔɔra sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Tantui na Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">naxan mu tin e xa nɔ won na.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Won bara kisi alɔ xɔni naxan kisixi gantanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">Gantanyi bara kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">yɛlɛ bara bɔɔ a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">won bara e lu naa.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Won ma dɛmɛri na Alatala xili nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">naxan koore nun bɔxi daaxi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala a xa ɲama rabilinfe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">Naxee e xaxili tima Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">e sɛnbɛ sɔtɔma nɛ alɔ Siyoni geya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">naxan mu sɛrɛnma, a bu abadan.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Darisalamu rabilinxi geyae ra ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">Alatala a xa ɲama fan nabilinxi na ki nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Mangasanyi ɲaaxi mu tinxintɔɛ xa bɔxi yamarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">alako tinxintɔɛ bɛlɛxɛ naxa lan fe ɲaaxi.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Alatala, hinnɛ mixi fanyie ra, naxee bɔɲɛ fiixɛ,<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />kɔnɔ i tan Alatala, i xa tinxintaree keri e yuge ma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Ala xa bɔɲɛsa lu Isirayila bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s1">Ala mixi xɔrɛyafe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">Alatala to geelimanie ragbilen Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">a lu nɛ muxu bɛ alɔ xiye.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Muxu naxa yele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">muxu naxa bɛɛti ba sɛɛwɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Sie nu a falama nɛ e bore bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">«Alatala bara kaabanakoe raba yie bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Iyo, Alatala bara kaabanakoe raba muxu bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">muxu sɛɛwaxi ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Alatala, muxu harige ragbilen muxu ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">alɔ ye ragbilenma Negewi bɔxi xure xɔrixie ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Mixi naxee xɛ sama yaye ra, e fama nɛ a xabade sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Mixi naxan sigama sansi side, e na wafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">na mixi gbilenma nɛ baloe ra, a sɛɛwaxi.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s1">Ala nan banxi tife</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde Sulemani naxan ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Xa Alatala xa mu banxi ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">a timae walima nɛ fufafu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Xa Alatala xa mu taa makantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">a kantamae walima nɛ fufafu.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Wo kelima subaxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">wo walima han kɔɛ ra baloe sɔtɔfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Na kui wo walima tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Kɔnɔ Ala a xanuntenyie man kima e sa tɛmui.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Die findima nɛ kɛ ra mixi bɛ Alatala naxan kima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">fe fanyi sare nan e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">naxee kelima a tan ma.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Die naxee sɔtɔxi fonike tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">nee tide luma nɛ alɔ sɔɔrie xa xalie.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Barakɛ na mixi bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">naxan xa xali sase rafexi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">A yaxuie mu nɔma a rayaagide ɲama ya i.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s1">Di findixi baraka nan na</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">Sɛɛwɛ na Alatala xa yaragaaxui nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">naxan ɲɛrɛma a xa kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />I xa wali geeni luma i tan nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">a findi sɛɛwɛ nun harige ra i bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />I xa ginɛ luma nɛ alɔ wuri bogila i xa banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">i xa die luma nɛ alɔ wuri nɛɛnɛe i xa teebili sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />A na na ki nɛ Alatala xa yaragaaxui bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">a barakaxi.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Alatala xa i baraka kelife Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">I xa Darisalamu harige to i xa simaya birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />I xa i xa die xa die to.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Ala xa bɔɲɛsa lu Isirayila bɔxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xunnakeli fife tɔɔrɔmixi ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Isirayila xa a fala:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">N gerefae bara n tɔɔrɔ kabi n fonike tɛmui.<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />E bara n tɔɔrɔ a ɲaaxi ra kabi a fɔlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">kɔnɔ e mu nɔ n na.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />E bara n fari ibɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">alɔ xɛ sae bɔxi bɔɔma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Kɔnɔ Alatala tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">A bara mixi kobie xa luuti xirixie bolon.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Ala xa Siyoni xɔnmixie rayaagi.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Ala xa e lu alɔ banxi fari ɲooge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">naxan xarama beenun a xa tala,<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />naxan mu findima baloe ra xɛ sae bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Dangi mixie naxa duba wo bɛ, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">«Ala xa wo baraka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Muxu bara duba wo bɛ Alatala xili ra.»<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s1">Alatala Marakisima</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">Alatala, n i xilima n ma tɔɔrɛ tilinxi nan kui.<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />N Marigi, i xa i tuli mati n xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">i xa n ma maxandi ramɛ kinikini kui.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Xa i tan Alatala ratuma mixie xa yunubie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">nde nɔma tide i ya ra sɔnɔn?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Kɔnɔ i tan yunubie xafarima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">Na kui mixi gaaxuma nɛ i ya ra.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />N xaxili tixi Alatala nan na n nii birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">n ya tixi a xa masenyi nan na.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />N xaxili naxan tixi n Marigi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">na dangi taa makantɛ xa mamɛ ti ra kuye iba ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">A gbo na bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Isirayila, i xa i xaxili ti Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">barima i xa xanunteya na a bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">a i xunsare birin fima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />A tan nan Isirayila xun sarama a xa yunubie birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s1">Danxaniyatɔɛ xa maraxarɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde Dawuda naxan ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">Alatala, yɛtɛ igboe mu n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">n mu la n yɛtɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">N mu soma fee ya ma naxee sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">naxee dangi n ma fahaamui ra.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />N naxan nabaxi, n na n sabarixi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">n na n nii raxara alɔ di dɛ baxi.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Isirayila, i xa i xaxili ti Alatala ra tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa laayidi Dawuda nun Darisalamu bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">Alatala, i xa ratu Dawuda ma a nun a xa tɔɔrɛ birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />A naxa a rakali Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">a naxa a rakali Yaxuba Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛma bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />«N mu soma n xɔnyi, n mu n sama,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />n mu n ya maxima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:4">n mu n ya magirama,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />han n sa lingira sɔtɔma Yaxuba Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛma bɛ tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Won nu bara a xa fe mɛ Efarata bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">Won naxa a li Yaara xa xɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />«Won xɛɛ a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">won xa won xinbi sin a santide ya i.<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Alatala, keli i xa talu i sabatide, i tan nun i xa saatɛ kankira.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />I xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa lu xunnakeli kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">i dugutɛgɛe xa e sɛɛwɛ xui rate.»<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />I xa konyi Dawuda xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">i naxa mɛɛ i xa mangɛ sugandixi ra.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Alatala a kali nɛ Dawuda bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">marakali naxan mu kanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">a naxɛ, «N i bɔnsɔɛ nde nan dɔxɔma i xa kibanyi ma.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Xa i xa die sa n ma saatɛ binya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">e n ma yaamarie rabatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">e xa die fan luma nɛ i xa kibanyi ma abadan.»<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Barima Alatala bara Siyoni sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">mɛnni nan nafanxi a ma a sabatide ra.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />A naxɛ, «N sabatide nan be ra abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">N dɔxɔma be n ma kibanyi kui barima be rafanxi n ma.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />N barakɛ sama nɛ Siyonikae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">n baloe fi e xa misikiinɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />N kisi fima nɛ e xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">e dugutɛgɛe bɛɛti bama nɛ sɛɛwɛ kui.»<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />«Be n Dawuda sɛnbɛ rakelima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">n naiyalanyi raminima nɛ n ma Mixi Sugandixi bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />N yaagi dusuma nɛ a yaxuie xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">kɔnɔ n nɔrɛ dusuma a tan nan xun na.»<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa ɲama xa lanyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde Dawuda naxan ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">Ngaxakerenyie lanma e xa lu lanyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">Fe fanyi yati yati nan na ki.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Na fan alɔ ture naxan surusuruma Haruna xunyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">a fa goro a dɛxabe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">han a dugi li.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Na luma nɛ alɔ xini naxan goroma Xerimon nun Siyoni geyae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">barima Alatala barakɛ nun kisi ragoroma naa abadan.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s1">Duba sɛrɛxɛdubɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Biyaasilae xa bɛɛti nde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">Wo tan Alatala xa konyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">wo tan naxee walima kɔɛ ra Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Wo xa wo bɛlɛxɛ ite hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Alatala matɔxɔfe ra.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Alatala naxan koore nun bɔxi daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">a xa barakɛ sa wo ma kelife Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayila xa matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Alatala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Wo Marigi Alatala matɔxɔ, wo a xili matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Alatala xa konyie, wo xa a matɔxɔ,<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />wo tan naxee walima Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">won tan naxee walima Ala xa banxi tɛtɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ, barima a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">Wo xa bɛɛti ba a xili matɔxɔfe ra, barima a rafan a ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Alatala bara Yaxuba sugandi a yɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">alako Isirayila xa findi a xa ɲama fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />N tan a kolon a Alatala gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">won Marigi dangi alae birin na.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Alatala a waxɔnfe rabama nɛ koore nun bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">a a rabama nɛ baa tilinxie ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />A nuxuie ratema keli duniɲa tunxunyi naani ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">a tunɛ rafa nun seyamakɔnyi, a foye xungbe ramini a ragatade kui.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />A Misira di singee birin faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">keli mixie ma han a sa xurusee li.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />A naxa tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe raba Misira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">Firawuna nun a xa walikɛe birin xili ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />A naxa sie wuyaxi bɔnbɔ, a mangɛ sɛnbɛma gbegbe faxa.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />A naxa Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">Basan mangɛ Ogo, nun Kanaan mangɛ birin xa bɔxi tongo,<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />a naxa a fi a xa ɲama Isirayila ma kɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Alatala, i xili mu lɔɛma abadan, i xili ifalama nɛ tɛmui birin,<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />barima Alatala fama nɛ a xa ɲama gbeɲɔxɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">a fa kinikini a xa konyie ma.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Si naxee mu Ala kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">e kuyee yailanma xɛɛma nun gbeti nan na e bɛlɛxɛe ra.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Dɛ na na kuyee bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu wɔyɛnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">Yae na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu se toma.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Tulie na e bɛ, kɔnɔ e mu fe mɛma. Ɲɛngi yo mu e fate i.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />E rafalamae xa lu alɔ e tan, a nun naxee birin lama e ra.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Isirayilakae, wo tan xa Alatala tantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">Haruna bɔnsɔɛ, wo xa Alatala tantu.<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ, wo xa Alatala tantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">Wo tan Ala yaragaaxuie, wo xa Alatala tantu.<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Tantui na Alatala bɛ kelife Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Tantui na Alatala bɛ naxan sabatixi Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s1">Tantui na Ala bɛ a xa xanunteya xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Wo Alatala tantu, barima a fan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Wo Alatala tantu naxan dangi alae birin na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Wo marigie xa Marigi tantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Wo xa a tan tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">a tan naxan keren kaabanakoe rabama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />a tan naxan koore daaxi a xa fahaamui ra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:5">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />a tan naxan bɔxi itala yee fari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />a tan naxan yanba se xungbee daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />soge, alako a xa yanyi iyalan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />kike nun tunbuie, alako e xa kɔɛ iyalan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Wo xa a tan nan tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">a tan naxan Misirakae xa di singee faxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:10">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11-12" />a tan naxan Isirayila ramini Misira bɔxi ma a sɛnbɛ nun a xa nɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:11-12">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />a tan naxan Xulunyumi baa ibolon firin na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:13">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />a tan naxan Isirayilakae radangi baa tagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />a tan naxan Firawuna nun a xa ɲama rasin Xulunyumi baa xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Wo xa a tan nan tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">a tan naxan a xa ɲama radangi gbengberenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />a tan naxan mangɛ xungbee faxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:17">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />a tan naxan mangɛ sɛnbɛmae faxa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:18">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />alɔ Amori mangɛ Sixɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />alɔ Basan mangɛ Ogo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:20">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21-22" />a tan naxan e xa bɔxi fi a xa konyi Isirayila ma kɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21-22">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Wo xa a tan nan tantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">a tan naxan ratuxi muxu xa konyiya ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />a tan naxan muxu baxi muxu yaxuie yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:24">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma,<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />a tan naxan nɛmɛ fima a xa daali birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:25">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Wo Ala tantu naxan na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:26">barima dan mu na a xa xanunteya ma.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayila xa konyiya Babilɔn bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Muxu nu dɔxɔxi Babilɔn xuree dɛ ra Siyoni xa fe ratufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Muxu nu bara muxu xa kɔrae gbaku wuri bilie kɔn na.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Muxu yaxuie nu Siyoni bɛɛtie maxɔrin muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">e nu wama bɛɛti sɛɛwaxi nde xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">E naxɛ, «Siyoni bɛɛti nde ba muxu bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Muxu nɔma bɛɛti bade Alatala bɛ yi konyiya kui di?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Darisalamu, xa n nɛɛmu i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">n bɛlɛxɛ naxa nɔ kɔra raberede sɔnɔn,<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />n nɛnyi xa kankan n dɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">Na xa raba n na xa a sa li n naxa nɛɛmu Darisalamu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">xa a xa fe mu findi n ma sɛɛwɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Alatala, i xa ratu Edonkae xa fe raba ma Darisalamu xa nimisɛ lɔxɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">E tan nan nu a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">«Won xa a kana han won sa a ba a bunyi ra.»<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Babilɔn, wo xa xunnagore bara gɛ ɲanigede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">sɛɛwɛ na a bɛ naxan i sare ragbilenma i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">i fe ɲaaxi naxan nabaxi muxu ra.<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">naxan i xa die suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">a e butuxun fanye fari.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s">Ala batufe bɔɲɛ birin na</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />N i batuma nɛ n bɔɲɛ birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">n i matɔxɔ alae ya i.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />N na n xinbi sinma nɛ i xa hɔrɔmɔlingira mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">n i xili matɔxɔ i xa xanunteya nun dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">barima i bara i xili nun i xa masenyi rate fe birin xun na.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />N to i xili, i naxa n yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">i naxa n nalimaniya i sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Mangɛ naxee birin na yi duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">e na i xa masenyi ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">e xa i matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />E xa Alatala xa kira matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">barima Alatala xa nɔrɛ gbo.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Hali Alatala na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">a mɛɛnima nɛ mixi magoroxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">kɔnɔ a makuyama nɛ yɛtɛ igboee ra.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />N na lu tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">i n nakisima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">i n yaxuie xa xɔnɛ xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">i fa n nakisi i sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Alatala n ma fee rakamalima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Alatala, dan mu na i xa xanunteya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">I naxa i xa daalie rabolo.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s1">Ala mixie kolonfe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">Alatala, i n bɔɲɛ birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />I n dɔxɔ tɛmui kolon, i n keli tɛmui kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">i n ma maɲɔxunyie birin kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">beenun n xa e maɲɔxun.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />I n ɲɛrɛ tɛmui kolon, i n sa tɛmui kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">i n ma kirae birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Beenun wɔyɛnyi xa mini n dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">i tan ɲan bara a birin kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />I n nabilinma nɛ i xɔnyɛe ra.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Na fe kolonyi makaabaxi gbo n tan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">a dangi n ma fahaamui ra.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />N sigama minden, n xa n makuya i Xaxili ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">N na n gima minden, n xa n nɔxun i ma?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Xa n sa te koore nɛ, i na mɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">Xa n sa goro aligiyama nɛ, n i lima nɛ naa.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Xa n sa keli subaxɛ ma, n baa igiri,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />i bɛlɛxɛ n naɲɛrɛma nɛ, i sɛnbɛ n malima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Xa a sa li n fa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">«N nɔma n nɔxunde dimi kui naiyalanyi mu na dɛnnaxɛ,»<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />i n toma nɛ na dimi kui alɔ n na soge nan bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />I tan nan n nii daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">i tan nan n nafalaxi n nga tɛɛgɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />N i matɔxɔma nɛ barima n daa ki makaaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">I xa wali maniyɛ mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">N na kolonxi a fanyi ra.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />N fate ki mu nu nɔxunxi i ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">a to yailanxi gundo kui.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />I yae naxa n to beenun n xa findi a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">N ma lɔxɔɛe birin nu sɛbɛxi i xa buki kui beenun n xa daali.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Ala, i xa maɲɔxunyie gbo, e tilin.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Xa n sa e kɔntima nɛ nu, e wuya mɛyɛnyi xɔri bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">Na birin kui, n luma i yi.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Ala, yandi, i xa mixi ɲaaxie faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">i xa faxɛtie makuya n na.<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />I yaxuie fe ɲaaxi falama i xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">e i xili kanama.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Alatala, a mu lanma n xa i xɔnmixie xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">A mu lanma i matandilae xa raɲaaxu n ma?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />N e xɔnma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">E bara findi n yaxuie ra.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Ala i xa n bɔɲɛ kui mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">i xa n ma kɔntɔfili kolon.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />A mato xa n na kira kobi nde nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">i naxan xɔnxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">Xa a na na ki nɛ, i xa n ti kisi kira nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s1">Mixi kobi alɔ bɔximase</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ bɛ<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Alatala, n natanga mixi ɲaaxie yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">naxee wama n tɔɔrɔfe,<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />naxee natɛ tongoma e bɔɲɛ ma gere masofe ra lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />E xa wɔyɛnyi xɔnɔ alɔ bɔximase xa xɔnɛ. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Alatala, i xa n natanga mixi ɲaaxie bɛlɛxɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">I xa n natanga mixi kobie ma naxee wama n nabirafe.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />I xa n natanga yɛtɛ igboe xa gantanyi nun luutie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">naxee yɛlɛe italama n ma kirae ra n suxufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Alatala, n Marigi Ala nan i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">I xa i tuli mati n wa xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Alatala, n nakisima sɛnbɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">naxan n natangama n gere lɔxɔɛ,<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />i naxa tin mixi kobie waxɔnfe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">i naxa na sɔɔnɛya e bɛ alako e xun naxa fa rakeli. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />N gerefae xa fe ɲaaxi maxirixie xa gbilen e ma.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Tɛ wole xa dɔxɔ e xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">e xa radin tɛ xɔɔra, e naxa fa mini na kui sɔnɔn.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />Fe ɲaaxi rabae naxa sabati yi bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">tɔɔrɛ nan tun xa ragiri e ma.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />N a kolon Alatala kiiti fanyi sama nɛ misikiinɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">a nɔndi fima setaree ma.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 140:14" />Tinxintɔɛe i xili matɔxɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:14">nɔndilae kisima nɛ i ya i.<verse eid="PSA 140:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s1">Mixi ɲaaxie xa gantanyi</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Alatala, n bara i maxandi, i xulun n malife ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">i xa i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />N ma duba xa te i mabiri alɔ surayi xiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">n ma bɛlɛxɛ ti xa lu alɔ nunmare sɛrɛxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Alatala, n dɛ makanta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">alako fe ɲaaxi yo naxa mini n dɛ kui.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />I naxa tin n bɔɲɛ xa siga fe ɲaaxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">n naxa lan wali kobi rabae ma n ma geeni xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Xa tinxintɔɛ n bɔnbɔ, a fan n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">a xa xurui fan alɔ labundɛ naxan sama n fate ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">N mu tondima na fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Kɔnɔ n Ala maxandima a xa mixi ɲaaxi waxɔnfe kana.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />E xa kiitisae xa radin gelenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">Mixi ɲaaxie xa a kolon n ma masenyi fan.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />E xa a fala, «Muxu xɔrie bara yensen aligiyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">alɔ xɛ sa bɔxi buxama ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Kɔnɔ n Marigi Alatala, n ya tixi i tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">N kantari toma i sɛɛti ma, i naxa n nii rabolo.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />N natanga gantanyie ma e naxee tema n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">n natanga mixi ɲaaxie xa yɛlɛe ma.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />E tan xa suxu nee ra, n tan xa kisi.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s1">Danxaniyatɔɛ xa kantari</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Dawuda xa lɔnni bɛɛti a to nu na fɔnmɛ ra<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />N na n xui ratema Alatala nan ma kinikini xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />N na n ma kɔntɔfili dɛntɛgɛma a tan nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">n na n ma nimisɛ ya ba a bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Limaniya na ba n yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">i tan n sigade kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">E bara gantanyi te n bɛ n ma kira ra.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />N nabilinyi mato: mixi yo mu na n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">kantari mu na n bɛ, mɛɛnima yo mu na n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Alatala, i tan nan keren peti na n bɛ sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">I keren nan findixi n kantama ra yi duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />I xa n wa xui mɛ, barima n sɛnbɛ birin bara ɲɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">N ba n kerimae yi ra, barima e sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 142:8" />N namini geeli kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">alako n xa i xili matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">Na kui tinxintɔɛe fama nɛ e malande n yire i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 142:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa maxandi hagigɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Alatala, i tuli mati n ma maxandi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">i xa kinikini n wa xui ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">I xa n ma duba suxu i xa dugutɛgɛɲa nun i xa tinxinyi xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />I naxa i xa konyi makiiti, barima daali yo mu tinxin i ya i.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />N yaxui birama nɛ n fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">a n boronma nɛ bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">a n luma nɛ faxɛ niini bun ma alɔ faxamixie.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Na kui n xaxili bara ifu. Limaniya bara ba n yi.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />N natuma nɛ lɔxɔɛ dangixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">n na n xaxili rasigama i xa wali birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">n na n ɲɔxɔ rasiga i xa daalie ma.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />N na n bɛlɛxɛ italama nɛ i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">n nii i fenma nɛ alɔ gbengberenyi ye fenma ki naxɛ. <char style="qs">Ɲɛngi rate.</char><verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Alatala, yandi, i xulun n yaabife ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Limaniya bara gɛ bade n yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">I naxa i kobe raso n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">xa na mu n luma nɛ alɔ faxamixie.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Kuye na iba, i xa i xa dugutɛgɛɲa masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">barima n xaxili tixi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">N ɲɛrɛ kira masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">barima n xaxili tixi i tan nan na.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Alatala, n natanga n yaxuie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">barima n kantari sɔtɔma i niini nan bun ma.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />N xaran i waxɔnfe rabafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">barima i tan nan na n Marigi Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">I Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa n ti kira fanyi xɔn ma.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Alatala, i xa n nakisi i xili xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">i xa n ba tɔɔrɛ kui i xa tinxinyi xa fe ra,<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />i xa n yaxuie dɛ balan i xa dugutɛgɛɲa xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">i xa n gerefae xun nakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">barima i xa konyi nan lanxi n ma.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s1">Munse na adamadi ra Ala bɛ?</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala maxandi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Dawuda xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">Tantui na Alatala bɛ, naxan findixi n ma fanye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">naxan n bɛlɛxɛ rawalima a xa gere kui,<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />naxan findixi n xanuntenyi sɛnbɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">naxan findixi n kantama nun n nakisima ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">naxan nɔma n yaxuie ra alako n xa kantari sɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Alatala, munse na adama ra i to fa mɛɛnixi a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Munse na adama xa di ra i to fa i ɲɔxɔ saxi a xɔn ma?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Adamadi luxi nɛ alɔ ɲɛngi foye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">a xa simaya dangima nɛ alɔ niini dangima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Alatala, i xa koore rabi i gorofe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">i fa din geyae ra alako tuuri xa te.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />I xa seyamakɔnyi rabula yaxuie rayensenfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">Xalie woli alako e xa siga.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />I xa i bɛlɛxɛ itala kelife koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">alako i xa n nakisi, i xa n natanga n yaxuie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">alɔ mixi ratangama mɔrɔnyie ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />N nakisi wule falɛe ma naxee wama n madaxufe.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Ala, n bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ bama nɛ i bɛ n ma kɔra luuti fu daaxi xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />N i matɔxɔma nɛ, i tan naxan mangɛe xun nakelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">naxan i xa konyi Dawuda ratangama santidɛgɛma ɲaaxi ma.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />N nakisi, n natanga n yaxuie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">naxan wule falama mixi madaxufe ra.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Na tɛmui muxu xa di xɛmɛe fanma nɛ alɔ wuri bilie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">muxu xa di ginɛe tofanma nɛ alɔ kɔntigiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">naxee masolixi mangɛ banxi kui.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Muxu xa banxie rafema nɛ daxamui mɔɔli birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">muxu xa gɔɔrɛe wuyama nɛ a wulu wulu ma,<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Muxu xa ningee xungboma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">lanyuru yo mu luma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">e furi mu birama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">sɔnxɔɛ mu mɛma muxu malandee.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Sɛɛwɛ na ɲama bɛ Ala fama yi fe mɔɔli rabade naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">Sɛɛwɛ na ɲama bɛ Alatala findixi naxan Marigi Ala ra.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa kaabanakoe nun xanunteya</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawuda xa Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />N ma Mangɛ Ala, n i matɔxɔma nɛ, n i xili tantuma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ n i matɔxɔma nɛ, n i xili tantuma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Alatala sɛnbɛ gbo, matɔxɔɛ birin na a tan nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">adamadi mu nɔma sode na birin kui.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Yi waxati mixie fama nɛ i xa kaabanakoe falade boore waxati mixie bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />E fama nɛ i xa nɔrɛ tofanyi masende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">N luma nɛ i xa kaabanakoe maɲɔxun na.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />E fama nɛ i sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi xa fe falade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">N luma nɛ i xa kaabanakoe masen na.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />E fama nɛ ɲɛlɛxinde i xa hinnɛ xungbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">e i xa tinxinyi masenma nɛ bɛɛti sɛɛwaxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Alatala hinnɛ mixi ra, a kinikini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">a diɲɛxi, a xa xanunteya gbo.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Alatala fe fanyi rabama mixi birin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">a kinikini a xa daali birin ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Alatala, i xa daalie birin i matɔxɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">i xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe i tantuma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />E i xa mangɛya xungbe xa fe masenma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">e i sɛnbɛ xa fe falama nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />alako mixie xa i xa kaabanakoe kolon, a nun i xa mangɛya nɔrɔxi.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />I xa mangɛya mu ɲɔnma nɛ, i xa nɔɛ buma nɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Alatala bira mixi malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">a mixi magoroxi xun nakelima nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Duniɲa birin a xaxili tixi i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">i tan nan e baloma a waxati.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />I tan nan i bɛlɛxɛ rabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">i birin nawasa e hayi na naxan ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Alatala tinxin a xa fe birin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">a dugutɛgɛxi a xa daalie ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Alatala makɔrɛ a maxandilae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">naxee a maxandima e bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />A a yaragaaxuie waxɔnfe rabama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">a e xa duba suxuma nɛ, a e rakisi.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Alatala a xanuntenyie makantama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">kɔnɔ a mixi ɲaaxie birin sɔntɔma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />N dɛ Alatala matɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">Daali xa a xili sɛniyɛnxi matɔxɔ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa mali gbo adama xa mali bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">N nii xa Alatala matɔxɔ,<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />n xa a matɔxɔ n ma simaya birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">N n Marigi Alatala matɔxɔma nɛ bɛɛti ra, fanni n na n nii ra.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ taxu mixi xungbee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">barima adamadie na e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">naxee mu nɔma mixi rakiside.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />E nii bama nɛ e fate i, e gbilen bɛndɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">Na lɔxɔɛ yati, e naxan ɲanigexi, na birin ɲɔnma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ, Yaxuba Marigi Ala naxan malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ, naxan a xaxili tima a Marigi Alatala ra,<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />Ala naxan koore nun bɔxi daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">Ala naxan baa nun a kui see birin daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">dugutɛgɛɲa na Ala naxan bɛ abadan.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Alatala tɔɔɲɛgɛtɔɛe xun mafalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">a donse fima kaamɛtɔɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">a geelimanie raminima geeli kui,<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />a dɔnxuie ya rabɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">a mixi magoroxie xun nakelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">a tinxintɔɛe xanuma,<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />a mɛɛnima xɔɲɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">a kiridie nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe bun tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">kɔnɔ a mixi ɲaaxie tan xun nakanama nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Siyoni, wo Marigi Alatala xa mangɛya mu ɲɔnma abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s1">Ala sɛnbɛ maniyɛ mu na</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">A lanma Alatala xa matɔxɔ bɛɛti ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Fe fanyi na a ra.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Alatala na gbilenfe Darisalamu ti ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">a Isirayila xa mixi rafama nɛ kelife konyiya kui,<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />a tɔɔrɔmixie ralimaniyama, a e rayalanma e xa fure kui.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Alatala tunbuie kɔnti kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">a e birin xilima e xili ra.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Won Marigi Alatala sɛnbɛ gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">dan mu na a xa fahaamui ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Alatala mixi magoroxi bun tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">kɔnɔ a yɛtɛ igboe xa fe kanama.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Wo xa bɛɛti ba Alatala bɛ tantui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">wo xa bɛɛti ba Ala bɛ kɔrae xui ra.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />A tan nan nuxui raminima koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">a tunɛ rafa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">a sansie rasoli geyae fari.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />A xurusee rabaloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">a donse fima xaxa yɔrɛe ma, e na e xui ramini tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Soe sɛnbɛ mu findixi fefe ra Ala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">Xɛmɛ xa sɛnbɛ mu findixi fefe ra Ala bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Ala yaragaaxuiya nan nafanma a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">Ala wama mixi xɔn naxan xaxili tixi a xa xanunteya ra.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Darisalamu, i xa Alatala matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Siyoni, i xa Ala tantu,<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />barima a tan nan i xa naadɛ makantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">a tan nan barakɛ sama i xa ɲama ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />A bɔɲɛsa fima i xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">a donse fanyi fima i ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Alatala duniɲa yamarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">a a waxɔnfe rayensenma mafuren mafuren.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />A balabalanyi ragoroma nɛ alɔ gɛsɛ fute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">a na rayensen alɔ tɛ xube.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />A ragoro bɔxi ma, nde nɔma tide na xinbeli ya ra?<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />A na a xui ramini e ma, e xunuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">a na foye rafa, balabalanyi man findima nɛ ye ra.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Alatala bara Annabi Yaxuba rakolon a xa masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">a bara a xa sɛriyɛ nun a xa yaamarie masen Isirayila bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />A mu na mɔɔli ragirixi si gbɛtɛ yo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Nee luma Ala xa sɛriyɛe kolontareya nan kui.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s1">Duniɲa xa Ala matɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Wo Alatala matɔxɔ kelife koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Wo a matɔxɔ yire itexi kui.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Alatala xa malekɛe xa a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">a xa galie xa a matɔxɔ koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Soge nun kike xa a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">tunbui dɛxɛxie fan xa a matɔxɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Koore xa a matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">a nun ye naxan toma naa.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />E birin xa Alatala xili matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">barima a yamari nan fi, e naxa daa.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />A naxa e ti e tide, e xa lu naa abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">A naxa na sɛriyɛ sa, naxan mu kanama.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ kelife bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">Baa nun nimase birin naxee na baa tilinyi kui,<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />seyamakɔnyi, balabalanyi, kunda, nuxuie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">nun foye xungbe naxan a xa yaamari ratinmɛma,<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />geyae nun tentenyie, wuri bogilae nun sɛdiri bilie,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />wulai subee nun xurusee, bubusee nun xɔnie,<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />duniɲa mangɛe nun sie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">mangɛdie nun duniɲa kuntigie,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />fonikee nun ginɛdimɛdie, dimɛe nun forie,<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />e birin xa Alatala xili matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">barima a xili gbansan nan itexi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">a nɔrɛ dangi koore nun bɔxi ra.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />A bara mangɛ sɛnbɛma rakeli a xa ɲama xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe naxan matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">sɛniyɛntɔɛe naxan findixi Isirayila a xa ɲama xanuxi ra.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Wo bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ ba a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">wo matɔxɔɛ raba a batulae tagi.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Isirayila xa sɛɛwa a daali Marigi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">Siyoni ɲama xa sɛɛwa e xa Mangɛ ra.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />E xa a xili matɔxɔ fare boron yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">e xa bɛɛtie ba maxase nun kɔra xui ra,<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />barima Alatala sɛɛwaxi a xa ɲama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">a kisi fima nɛ yɛtɛ magoroe ma.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />A xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe xa sɛɛwa yi binyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">e xa e sɛɛwɛ xui ite</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">hali e xa sadee ma.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Ala matɔxɔɛ xa lu e dɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">Na luxi alɔ santidɛgɛma xaaɲɛxi e bɛlɛxɛ kui,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />e naxan nawalima e gbe ɲɔxɔfe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">si ɲaaxie ɲaxankatafe ra.<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />E e yaxuie xa mangɛe sama nɛ yɔlɔnxɔnyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">e e xa yareratie xirima nɛ a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />na fa findi e xa kobiɲa sare ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Xunnakeli belebele nan na ki Ala xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe bɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s1">Birin Ala matɔxɔfe</para>
  <para style="s2">Ala matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Wo xa Ala matɔxɔ a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Wo xa a matɔxɔ koore ma.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Wo xa a matɔxɔ a xa kaabanakoe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">Wo xa a matɔxɔ a sɛnbɛ xungbe xa fe ra.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Wo xa a matɔxɔ feri xui nun kɔra xui ra,<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />wo xa a matɔxɔ maxase nun fare boron yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">wo xa a matɔxɔ kɔra maniyɛ nun xule xui ra,<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />wo xa a matɔxɔ maxase xui itexi ra.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Nimase birin xa Alatala matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Wo Alatala matɔxɔ!<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>